<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Utumbuli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu su Utumbuli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Utumbuli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Utumb</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kitabu su utumbuli</para>
  <para style="is">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Liina lende li kitabu su Utumbuli mana jaki gagatumbuli. Kitabu sehesi kilongale nndema ewabombwa nu utumbuli wa bandu na mahakau egatumbuliya na mang'aliku pu nndema. Ahelahe kilandi Sapanga ejatumbuliya kwaahenge bandu majambu gingi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu su Utumbuli kiwesa kubaganiswa pandu pabeli. 1. Sula ja 1-11, jilangi nndema ewabombwa na Sapanga na majambu ga bandu mwandi. Hapa wagabona majambu gaka Adamu na Eva, Kaini na Abeli, ling'ai la masi nu nnala uku Babeli. 2. Sula ja 12-50, homu wagabona majambu ga aseja ba mwandi ba bandu buku Izilaeli. Mundu ju utumbuli jwabiya Ibulaimu jojamanyikana ndaba jukunzoane nu kunhobale Sapanga. Ndienu wagabona majambu gaka Isaka mwana mwanalomi jwaka Ibulaimu na Yakobu nsokoo waka Ibulaimu. Kabee ankemika Izilaeli. Ndienu wagabona majambu ga bana akanalomi komi na abeli baka Yakobu babube kupete bombi makabila komi na mabeli guku Izilaeli gatenda kutumbuli. Ahelahe majambu makolongu galangi mwana jumu jwaka Yakobu liina laki Josepu na hindu yeyahenga Yakobu na bana baki bangi akanalomi na bandu bu nyumba yabu ajenda kutama ku nndema guku Misili.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu senze kibii ngati kilandi majambu ga bandu, lakini majambu makolongu ngani mu kitabu senze ndi majambu gaguge Sapanga jutei kugahenga. Kitumbuli kutulangi kubanga Sapanga jabombiki nndema woti na kijomule sukutulandi Sapanga jupwagiki jiendaliya kwaapwatali bandu baki. Mu kitabu soti joandogo ngani ndi Sapanga, hoju juamuu na kwaapeke azabu bandu baahenga mahakau jalongosa na kwaajangatii bandu baki, jwaahenga abiya baamboni mu womi wabu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu senze sa mwandi kiandikwi ili kutunza majambu ga bandu babunhobaliya Sapanga na saakolo bandu aendaliya kunhobale Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Kubobwa ku nndema joti na bandu. Lipungu la 1:1-2:25</para>
  <para style="io">Mahakau egatumbuliya na azabu. Lipungu la 3:1-24</para>
  <para style="io">Kuhuma kwaka Adamu mbaka kwaka Noa. Lipungu la 4:1-5:32</para>
  <para style="io">Noa na Ling'ai la masi. Lipungu la 6:1-10:32</para>
  <para style="io">Nnala uku Babeli. Lipungu la 11:1-9</para>
  <para style="io">Kuhuma kwaka Shemu mbaka Abulamu. Lipungu la 11:10-32</para>
  <para style="io">Aseja Ibulaimu na Isaka na Yakobu. Lipungu la 12:1-35:29</para>
  <para style="io">Ibeleku yaka Esau. Lipungu la 36:1-43</para>
  <para style="io">Josepu na alongu baki. Lipungu la 37:1-45:28</para>
  <para style="io">Bandu buku Izilaeli ebabiya atama ku Misili. Lipungu la 46:1-50:26</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Sapanga jubomba nndema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Pakwatumbuliya Sapanga jabomba kunani nu nndema. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Nndema ngasewabii ni liumbu na wabii nntopu. Lwii lwabiya luyekali masi na Mbomu waka Sapanga jabiya jujobatii panani ja masi. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Sapanga jalagalakiya, “Unang`anu gubiya.” Unang`anu gwatenda kupiti. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Sapanga jugubona unang`anu kuba ndi wa sapi. Ndienu Sapanga jugubaganisa unang`anu na lwii. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Jugukema unang`anu, “Muhi” na lwii julukema “Ikilu” pakamii patenda kupeta, kwahika pulukela, lisoba lu utumbuli.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Sapanga jalagalakiya, “Pabiya pandu panga na sindu, papabaganisa masi pandu pabeli.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Sapanga jalenganakia pandu panga na sindu, kugabaganisa masi gangi gabia kunani na gangi gabia pai ndi kwabiya ahelahela. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Sapanga japakema pandu panga na sindu pala, “Anga.” Ndienu pakamii kwatenda kupeta kwahika pulukela lisoba la pili.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Sapanga jalagalakiya, “Masi gagabii pai ja pandu pajomu pabongika pandu pamu, ili nndema wanga na sindu gupitila.” Ndi kwabiya ahelahela. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Sapanga japakema pandu pajomu, “Nndema,” nu kubongeka kwa masi kola jugukema, “Nnhanga.” Sapanga jaabona kubii kwaamboni.<verse eid="GEN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Ndienu Sapanga jalagalakiya, “Nndema gumela mimea jejipapa imbeju, ni mikongu jejipapa matunda gagabii ni imbeju.” Kwabiya ahelahela. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Ndienu nndema wamela mimea jejipapa imbeju kulengana na aina ju mmea, ni mikongu jejipapa matunda gagabii ni imbeju kulengana na aina ju nkongu. Sapanga jabona ndi kubi kwaamboni. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Pakamii patenda kupeta, kwahika pulukela, lisoba la tatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Sapanga jalagalakiya, “Minang`anu jibiya ku lianga jibaganisa muhi ni ikilu, jilangia ipindi, masoba na yaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />jinang`ana kunani nu kumulaki mu nndema.” Ndi kwabiya ahelahela. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Henu, Sapanga jahenga minang`anu mibeli mikolongu, nkolongu gola gunang`ana muhi nu nsoku gola gunang`ana ikilu, kabee jwalaenganakia na ndondu. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Sapanga jijibeka minang`anu heji pi lianga ili jinang`anakiya nndema, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />jiwesa kunang`ana muhi ni ikilu, nu kubaganisa unang`anu na lwii. Sapanga jabona kubi kwaamboni. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Pakamii kwatenda kupeta, kwahika pulukela, lisoba lu nnsesi.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Sapanga jalagalakiya, “Kubiya ni iumbi ya aina hingi yomi mmasi ni ijuni igoluka pi lianga.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Ndienu, Sapanga jabomba iumbi ikolongu nakanopi yu mu nhanga nkolongu na aina yoti yi iumbi yomi yeitweli mu nhanga, jabomba na aina yoti yi ijuni. Sapanga jukubona kubii kwaamboni. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Sapanga japwaaga, “Henu kubii kwa amboni kwinu nnzenda mwakapapa nu kujonzukeka mwakatwelila mu nhanga nkolongu, nayombi ijuni ijonzukika panani ju nndema.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Pakamii patenda kupeta, lukela lwatenda kuhika, lisoba lu nhwanu.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Sapanga jalagalakiya, “Nndema gupia aina yoti ji iumbi yomi, inyama yukupugwa, iumbi yeikwaba ni inyama yu mukiholi ya kila aina.” Kwabiya ahelahela. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Ndienu, Sapanga jalenganakiya aina yoti yi inyama imwikioli, inyama yukupuga, ni iumbi yeikwaba. Sapanga jabona kubii kwaamboni.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Ndipala, Sapanga japwaaga, “Tunndenganakiya mundu jojulengana na twepani, jojubii na sula ngati jitu, jakabiya nu uwesu panani ja homba yu mu nhanga nkolongu, ijuni yuku nani, inyama yu kupugwa, nndema joti ni iumbi yoti yeikwaba panani ju nndema.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Ndienu, Sapanga jaabomba bandu baalengana na mweni, ku kulengana na sula jaki jatenda kaabomba. Ku kulengana na sula jaki ammbomba mwanalomi nu mmbomba, <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Sapanga jwaapengila na kwaapwagi, “Mpapana mukajonzukika, mwakatwelila mu nndema woti, mwakalong`osa hindu yoti yu punndema. Mwakabiya na makili panani ja homba yu mu nhanga nkolongu, ijuni yu kunani ni iumbi yoti yeibii panani ju nndema.”<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Ndipala, Sapanga japwaaga, “Nnzoannya numpeki kila mmea gogupapa imbeju gogubii punndema, na kila nkongu gogupapa matunda gagabii ni imbeju, imbeju yaki au matunda gabu giibiya posu jino. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Nayombi inyama yoti mu nndema, ijuni yoti yu kunani, iumbi yoti yeikwaba na kila kiumbi sekibii somi, posu jabu jibia manyoi na mahamba goti gi mikongu.” Kwabiya ahelahela. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Sapanga jabona kila sindu sejukihengiki kuba ndii saamboni nakanopi. Pakamii patenda kupeta lukela lwatenda kuhika lisoba la sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Hela ndi Sapanga ejajomula kubomba kunani nu nndema pamu na hindu yoti yeibii momu. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Lisoba la saba Sapanga jatenda kupomule n daba jabiya jujomuli lihengu laki loti. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Sapanga jilipengila lisoba la saba nu kulibagu libiya lisoba laki mweni ndaba lisoba le heli Sapanga jatenda kupomulela pajajomula lihengu laki loti lu kubomba. <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Hela ndi kunani nu nndema ewabombika.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 2:4">Kijongu suku Edeni</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Masoba gala Sapanga ejabomba kunani kwaka Sapanga nu nndema, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />ngasejabii ni mimea mu nndema wala mikongu jabiya ngase jitundulii ndaba Bambu Sapanga ngasejijilei iyula jinelila pu nndema na wala ngasepabii na mundu jukujilema. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Lakini mu masoba haga masi gagabii pai gahika panani ju luombi nukupemesa nndema woti. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga annhenga mwanalomi ku kutumi luombi, ampulaliya mwiimbulu mbomu ja womi, na mwanalomi hoju jabia mundu mwomi.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Ndipala, Bambu Sapanga jabeka kijongu upandi golipiti lyoba uku Edeni, momuje ammbeka mwanalomi hoju joammbombiki. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Bambu Sapanga jamelisa kuhuma mu nndema kila aina ji mikongu jejinyambiki ngani jejipapa matunda gagapalika kwa posu. Pikilanda ji kijongu se hapa kwabiya nu nnkongu wa matunda gwa womi nu nkongu gowahenga bandu baakula matunda gaki amanya majambu gaamboni na majambu mabaja.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kwabii na losi lolupia masi mu kijongu sa Edeni, lolulwe lwabaganisa kuba losi nsesi. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Liina la losi lu utumbuli ndi Pisoni losi lwe holu luyongolota musi uku Havila kokuje kojibii zahabu.<verse eid="GEN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Zahabu ju nndema heji ndi sapi ngani. Kokuje kabee gabii mahuta gaganungi gabagakema bedola na malibu ga bei ngolongu gabagakema Sholamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Liina la losi lwa pili ndi Gioni, hogu guyongalota nndema woti gwa Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Liina la losi lwa tatu ndi Tigi, nagwombi gusembaleka upandi wa golipiti lyoba ku nndema uku Ashulu. Liina la losi lu nnsesi ndi Eupulati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga anzukua mwanalomi we hoju, ammbeka mu kijongu suku Edeni, julema nu kukitunza. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila mwanalomi we hoju, “Guwesa kula matunda gu nkongu wokapi gola mu kijongu suku Edeni, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />ila matunda gi mikongu gu umanyi waamboni nu ubaja, wiikula, ndaba lisoba pawikula matunda gu nkongu hogu gwitenda kuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga japwaaga, “Nga sapi mwanalomi hoju kuba kajika jaki. Nandenganakiya mundu jukunzangatii jojilengana naku.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Henu, kuhuma mu luhombi Bambu Sapanga jabiya jwiilenganaki inyama imwikioli na kila ijuni yu kunani, andetila Adamu julinga juipekiya mahina na mahina gajwaipekiya iumbi ye heyi gabiya ndi mahina gabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Ndienu, Adamu jiipekiya mahina inyama yoti yeipugwa, ni inyama yoti imwikioli ni ijuni yoti yu kunani. Lakini kati ji inyama hei ni ijuni yoti ngasejabona sukunzangati.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga anhenga mwanalomi we hoju jubiya nu lugonu lwingi, na pajabiya mu lugonu, jajukua luteta lwaki lumu nukuyekale pandu pala kwi inyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Bambu Sapanga anndenganakiya mmbomba sukutumii luteta gojahuma naku kwaka mwanaloni jola, ndienu ampelika kwaka mwanalomi we hoju. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Ndienu, Adamu japwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Ooho! Jonzo ndi lihupa kuhuma mu mahupa gango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">ni inyama kuhuma mwiinyama jango.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Jonioju ngiti nunkema ‘Mbomba,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">ndaba juhumiki mu yega jaka mwanalomi.” <verse eid="GEN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Kwa ndaba heji, mwanalomi jaaleka ahengo na anyongo baki, najombi jwiijongana nu mmbomba, nabombi bibiya yega jimu.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Mwanalomi nu nhwanamundu boti babii heu, lakini ngasebabona iyone.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Ing'omu ya bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Lijoka labiya nu ujanza kupeta inyama yoti yumukioli yejuibombiki Bambu Sapanga. Ndienu, lijoka lunndalukiya mmbomba we hoju, “Ati Sapanga japwaaga mwikula matunda gu nkongu wokapi mu kijongo?” <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Mmbomba jilijibua lijoka lela, “Tuwesa kula matunda gu nkongu gokapi gwa mu kijongu, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />lakini Sapanga jutupwagila, ‘Mwiikula matunda gu nkongu gogubii pikilanda ji kijongu, wala mwiigusa ili mwiikuwa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Lijoka lumpwagila mmbomba jola, “Kye ngamwiikue! <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Sapanga japwaaga hela ndaba jumanyiki ana nkuliki matunda gu nkongu hogu nanamu mwibiya ngati Sapanga, na mwiimanya gaamboni na mabaja.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Ndienu, mmbomba pajabona kuba matunda gu nkongu we hogu waasapi na galengane kwa kula, na paugalingali gatenda kulengane, kabee galengane kumpeke mundu malangu, jatongula litunda laki, jakula, ampekiya nu nndomi, najombi kabee jakuliki. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Apalapa malangu gabu gatenda kuyekuliwa, ndi bamanya abii heu, henu basona mahamba gu nkongu gobugukema ntini nu kugalenganake ingobu yukuwata mu kibunu.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Pakamii, kipindi sukuponga nhwai, mwanalomi hoju nu nhwanamundu bajoana Bambu Sapanga jwakajenda, nabombi bajoba pikilanda ji mikongu ji kijongu ili Bambu Sapanga jwaabona. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga ankema mwanalomi we hoju, “Adamu gubii kwako?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Najombi jajibua, “Najoana gutenda kujenda mu kijongu, ndi natenda kujogopa naamua kujoba ndaba nakabii heu.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Bambu Sapanga jaalalukiya, “Nya jojugupwagila gubi heo? Boo, gukuliki lee litunda lu nkongu lenugulagalakiya wiikula?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Mwanalomi we hoju jajibua, “Mmbomba jogumbeki jubiya pamu nanepani ndi jojumbeki litunda lu nkongu we hogu, nane natenda kula.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Ndipala Bambu Sapanga andalukiya mmbomba, “Guhengiki kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Mmbomba jola jajibua, “Lijoka latenda kungonga, nepani naamua kula.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sapanga jutenda kutemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Ndipala Bambu Sapanga jilipwagila lijoka, “Kwa ndaba guhengiki hela, gupatiki lwaambamba kupeta inyama yoti yukupugwa, na kupeta inyama yoti imwikioli. Wiikwaba kulutumbu lwaku na wikula luombi masoba goti ga womi waku. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Nanhenga wehapa nu mmbomba hoju nsukiana, kuhuma mwi kibeleku saki jumu jakiponda kimutu saku na wehapa wanduma kinzekeni saki.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Ndipala ampwagila mmbomba, “Nakujonzukiya usungu kipindi sukupapa na ku usungu wipapa bana. Hata hela wibiya na hamu nu nndomi waku, najombi jiitenda kugulongosa.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Ndipala ampwagila Adamu, “Ndaba wehapa gunzoani nhwanu waku, gukuliki matunda gu nkongu ganugulakaliya wiikula, henu kwa ndaba guhengiki hela nndema nugulapi mbamba. Ili gupata posu kwa ndaba ja womi waku wiipata posu kwi lihengu lelinonwipi. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Nndema wagupapila miha na matungalusi, nawehapa wipalika kula makolu gi mwilitui. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Kwa makili gaku wiipata posu mbaka pawikelubuka muluombi kogwauma, ndaba wehapa ndi luhombi nu mu luhombi witenda kukelabuka.” <verse eid="GEN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adamu ampekiya nhwanamundu liina la “Eva,” ndaba jabiya nyongoo jwa bandu boti. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Bambu Sapanga jaalenganakiya Adamu nu nhwanamundu ingobu ya ngosi ikinyama, nakawatika.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Eva baabenga ku kijongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga japwaga, “Henu mundu jubii ngati twepani, jumanyiki gaamboni na giliya. Kutaki kumpengale kula litunda lu nkongu wa womi, ndaba anajukuliki jwiitama masoba goti ganga na mwisu!” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ammbengila Adamu nu nhwanamundu kunza ji kijongu sa Edeni, ili jakalema mu ndema gowatumika kumbomba. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Ammbengila kunza nu kumbeka mlonda upandi golipiti lyoba ukijongu sa Edeni nu upanga wa mwotu gogwang`anambuka koni na koni, kujilenda indela jejijenda mu nkongu wa womi.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Ndienu, Adamu jagonila nu nhwanamundu Eva, na Eva japata kitumbu, ambelika mwana. Eva japwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga junyangati mbatiki mwana mwanalomi.” Henu ankema liina Kaini. <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Kabee Eva ambelika mwana jongi ankema Abeli. Abeli jabia jojupuga makondoo na Kaini jabia nndemi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Lisoba limu, Kaini ampikia Bambu Sapanga matambiku kuhuma mu ilebi yu mu litui. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Najombi Abeli ampikia Sapanga litambiku. Jakoma kibeleku simu su utumbuli kati ji ibeleku ya makondoo gaki nukumpeke Bambu Sapanga inyama ja sapi ji likondoo heli. Bambu Sapanga jalenganiwi na Abeli ni litambiku laki kabee, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />lakini Sapanga ngase jalenganiwi na Kaini wala litambiku laki. Ndienu Kaini jayomiki ngamaa na pamihu jaki patenda kutulana. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Bambu Sapanga anndalukiya Kaini, “Ndaba jaki gutei kuyoma, na ndaba jakii pamihu jaku patulini hela? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Boo, anaguhengiki saamboni nga wijetakalewe? Ana nga seguhengiki gaamboni, ngawikubi nu uwesu ukugapenga mahakau.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Kaini ampwagila nndongu waki Abeli, “Tuboka kulungwenza.” Henu, pababia kulungwenza Kaini antukaliya Abeli nu kunkoma.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Bambu Sapanga andalukiya Kaini, “Boo nndongu waku Abeli jubii kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Kaini jajibua, “Nepani ngasemanyiki! Boo, nepani ndi nu nndonda uku nndongu wango?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Bambu Sapanga japwaaga, “Guhengiki kike? Mwai uku nndongu waku gunele kuhuma puluombi. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Henu wehapa gupatiki yaambamba! Bagubenga mu luombi lolubii na mbolea lolulwe lunywelali mwai uku nndongu waku joukomiki. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Anagulemiki mu luombi nga jagupeke kabee ilebi yaki. Wibiya wa mundu ukutangatanga, jwanga nu pukutama pani punndema.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini ampwagila Bambu Sapanga, “Azabu jangu ndi ngolongu ngani, nganhwesi kujitotola. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Lelenu gumengiki kuhuma mu luombi lolubii na mbolea nu kuba kutali nawehapa. Ndienu nibiya na mundu ukutangatanga, jwanga na pukutama pa pamanyakini pani punndema, na jokapi jojwiimona jwiitenda kungoma.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga jajibua, “Ngahela! Jojagukoma wehapa wa Kaini nanndepisa mala saba.” Ndienu Bambu Sapanga ammbeka alama jukulakali, ili jokapi joammbona jaankoma. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Ndienu, Kaini jaboka palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, jabiya jutama mu musi wa Nodi mana jaki kutangatanga, upandi golipiti lyoba uku Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kibeleku saka Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Pagapeta masoba haga, Kaini nu nhwanamundu bapata mwana mwanalomi na ankema liina Enoki. Kaini jasenga musi jugukema Enoki liina laka mwanamundu. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoki ammbelika Iladi na najombi Iladi ammbelika Meuyaeli na Meuyaeli ammbelika Metushaeli na Metushaeli ammbelika Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki jajukwi akammbomba abeli, jumu ankemika Ada na jongi ankema Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada ammbelika Yabali jojuwe jabii ahoku jwa bandu bababiya baapuga inyama na atama ku maema. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Nndongu waki jabiya Yabali, hoju jabiya ahoku ba bandu boti baapega ilimba na pyelembi. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Najombi Sila ammbelika Tubali Kaini, jojuwe jakabii jojuponda hindu ya shaba na yiisomasoma. Nu nndombu waka Tubali Kaini jabiya Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameki jaapwagila aka ahanamundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Sila nnzoaninya sauti jangu! Nzoaninya gambwaaga mwaka ahanu baka Lameki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Nepani nakomiki mundu ndaba jandei kunhumisa, helo nunkoma nkombu hoju ndaba jandei kunhumisa. <verse eid="GEN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Ana joankoma Kaini jwiilepiswa mala saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">nala sakaka joankoma Lameki jwiilepiswa mala sabini na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seti na Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu jagonila kabe nu nhwanamundu Eva, najombi ammbelika mwana mwanalomi ankema Seti japwaaga, “Sapanga jumbeki mwana jongi badala jaka Abeli jojakomika na Kaini.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Najombi Seti japata mwana mwanalomi, ankema Enoshi. Papuje ndi bandu pabatumbuliya kunndoba Bambu Sapanga ku liina laki.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Kibeleku saka Adamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1Majambu gi Ipindi 1:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Jenze ndi namba ji ibeleku yaka Adamu kipindi Sapanga pa ammbomba mundu, ammbomba ku kulengana na jombi. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Jaabomba mwanalomi nu mmbomba, ndipala jaapengaliya na kaapeke liina, “Bandu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu pajabiya na yaka mia jimu na selasini jwapata mwana jo jwalengini ngamaa najombi, ankema liina Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Baada jukumpapa Seti, Adamu jatemi yaka yengi mia nane, nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akammbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Adamu jatemi yaka mia tisa selasini ndi jatenda kuwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seti pajabii na yaka mia jimu nu nhwanu, ammbelika Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Eammbelika Enoshi, Seti jatemi yaka yengi mia nani na saba, nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akammbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Seti jakuwa pajwabia na yaka mia tisa na komi ni ibeli.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enoshi pajabiya na yaka tisini ammbelika Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Eammbelika Kenani, Enoshi jatemi yaka yengi mia nani komi nu nhwanu nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akabomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enoshi jakuwa koni jubii na yaka mia tisa nu nhwanu.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenani pajabii na yaka sabini, ammbelika Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Eammbelika Mahalaleli, Kenani jatemi yaka mia nane na alubaini nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenani jakuwa koni jubii na yaka mia tisa na komi.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalaleli pajabiya na yaka sitini nu nhwanu, ammbelika Yaledi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Eammbelika Yaledi, Mahalaleli jatama yaka mia nani selasini nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalaleli jakuwa koni jubii na yaka mia nani na tisini nu nhwanu.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaledi pajabii na yaka mia jimu na sitini ni ibeli, ammbelika Enoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Eammbelika Enoki, Yaledi jatemi yaka mia nani nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaledi jakuwa koni jubii na yaka mia tisa sitini ni ibeli.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Enoki pajabiya na yaka sitini nu nhwanu, ammbelika Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Eammbelika Metusela Enoki jatama suku nndengane Sapanga kwa yaka mia tatu na jabelika bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Enoki jatemi yaka yengi mia tatu na sitini nu nhwanu. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Enoki jatama sukundengane Sapanga na ndienu bandu ngasebummbona kabete ndaba Sapanga jatei kunzuku.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Metusela pajabii na yaka yengi mia jimu na semanini na saba ammbelika Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Eammbelika Lameki, Metusela jatemi yaka yengi mia saba na semanini ni ibeli, nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Metusela jakuwa jubii na yaka yengi mia tisa na sitini na tisa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lameki pajabii na yaka mia jimu na semanini ni ibeli, ammbelika mwana mwanalomi. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Ankema mwana we hoju Noa, japwaaga, “Mwana we hoju ndi jo jwatutogulisa mwoju kulengana ni lihengu litu le linonipi letuhenga kwa maboku gitu mu luombi lojululapila mbamba Bambu Sapanga.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Eammbelika Noa, Lameki jatemi yaka yengi mia nhwanu na tisini na nhwanu nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lameki jakuwa koni jubii na yaka mia saba na sabini na saba.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Noa jabii na yaka miaka mia nhwanu, ammbelika Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Mahakau ga bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Bandu ebajonzukika nu kuenee punndema nu kubeleka aka kamwali, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />bana akakombu baka Sapanga bangi baabona aka kamwali ba bandu atei kunyamba, baajukua ba baapai na kuba aka ahanu babu. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Hapa ndi Bambu Sapanga japwaaga, “Mbomu jangu ngajiitami nkati jaka mundu masoba goa ganga na mwisu, ndaba jombi ndi wa kuwa pena. Kutumbuli sajenu nu kuendalee ngabiitami kupeta yaka mia jimu ni ishilini.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Mumasoba ge haga hata ga monikatai, kwabii ni mimundu gagabiya gatama pani punndema. Mamundu gehaga bagakemika Anepili babii kibeleku sa bana akanalomi baka Sapanga na akakamwali babelikwi na bandu. Haba ndi bandu bababii baawesa ngondu na baabii nu ulumbi kipindi se hesi.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Bambu Sapanga pajabona bandu ahenga mahakau gingi ngani pani punndema, na kila sejuholale mundu mmwoju jaki ndi mahakau masoba goti, <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Bambu Sapanga jasikatiki ngamaa, ndaba jukummbomba mundu. Bambu Sapanga jugubona usungu mmwoju jaki, <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />henu, japwaaga, “Namputa nzwe punndema mundu jo nu mmbombiki, nambengila kutali kabee naaputa nzwe inyama ya mwikioli ni iumbi yeikwaba ni ijuni yu kunani. Nhyomiki ndaba naabomba punndema.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Lakini Noa, japatiki upali nkolongu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Ganga majambu gaguhusu Noa jojabii jojujetakeka kajika jaki palongi jaka Sapanga na jojuwe ngasejabii na lawama ipindi yake. Jabii jutama sukunndengane Sapanga. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Noa jabii na bana atatu akakombu, Shemu na Amu na Japeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Sapanga jugubona nndema guhalabiki nu kutwele bandu banga ni ikia. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Sapanga hejugulingalia nndema, jabona guhalabiki ngamaa, ndaba kila mundu japwata indela jaki ja mahakau.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Sapanga ampwagila Noa, “Amwi kwaakoma bandu boti ndaba atweli bandu banga ni ikia. Naakoma pamu nu nndema. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Henu, ujilenganakiya Sapina kwi imbau yu nkongu wu mpengu. Bagula yumba nkati je homu na gupakia lami kunza nu nkati. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Gujilenganakiya ana, Ulasu waki gubiya meta mia moja na selasini na tisa, upana waki meta ishilini nunhwanu nu ulasu waki ukujenda kunani meta komi nu nhwanu. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Sapina heji jibiya ja golopa itatu na jejibii nu nndyangu kulutengu. Jilenganakiya nu nhagaa, kabee ujileka napwasi nusu mita kati ju nhagaa nu ligolu. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Niileta ling`aliku ili kukoma iumbi yomi yoti yeitama punndema. Kila sindu sekibii punndema siitenda kuwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Lakini nihenga Lilaganu nawehapa. Wijingala mu Sapina, wehapa pamu nu nhwanu waku, bana baku naka akanamundu. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Nawehapa wiijingisa mu sapina iumbi ibeli ibeli, sammbomba na sanalomi, ili kwiitunza ibiya yomi pamu na wehapa. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Wijingisa kila aina ji ijuni yu kunani ku lianga, kila aina ji inyama na kila aina ji kiumbi sekikwaba na yoti hei ibiya ibeli ibeli ili kwiitunza ibiya yomi. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Kabee gujukua aina yoti ya posu, ili mwiitunza ndaba jinu na ndaba ji iumbi hei.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Noa jahenga yoti ngati Sapanga eanndagalakiya.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Masi gingi gatwele mu nndema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Noa, “Jingala nkati ja sapina wehapa pamu na bana baku boti, ndaba kati ja bandu boti baatama masoba gaku gani, nugubweni wehapa kajika jaku ndi weguhenga ganagajetake. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Jukua inyama yeijetakiki kupiiki litambiku ikambaku saba ni mikolu saba na jukua inyama yanga kujetakeka kupiiki litambiku ibeli ikambaku ibeli imikolu. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Ahelahela jukua ijuni yumunani ikambaku ni mikolu sabasaba ili kuitunza ibia yomi aina yabu yoti punndema. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Egiipeta masoba saba kutumbuli sajenu, najilekakiya iyula jikuna punndema masoba alobaini ikilu na muhi, na kila kiumbi somi senikibombiki niitenda kukikoma.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Noa jahenga ngati Bambu Sapanga eanndagalakiya.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Noa jabii na yaka mia sita kipindi masi pagatwelila pu nndema. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Noa nu nhwanamundu na bana baki na aka ahanamundu bajingala nkati ja sapina ili kujepana nu kutwele kwa masi. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Inyama yeijetakiki kupiki litambiku ni inyama yanga kujetakeka kupiki litambiku ni ijuni ni iumbi yoti yeikwaba, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />ibeli ibeli, ikambaku ni mikolu, bajingala nkati ja sapina pamu na Noa ngati Sapanga eanndagalakiya. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Egapeta masoba saba, masi gingi gatumbuliya kuguyekale nndema.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Noa pajabii na yaka mia sita, mu lisoba la komi na saba la mwei wa pili, lisoba leheli iliba yoti ya masi yapita masi nu kunani ku lianga kwatenda kuhogoka. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Iyula jakuna mu nndema masoba alubaini ikilu na muhi. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Lisoba alelale iyula pajatumbuliya kukuna, Noa nu nhwanamundu na bana baki, Shemu na Hamu na Yapeti, pamu na akahanamundu, bajingala nkati ja sapina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Bajingala beni pamu ni inyama na aina joti ji inyama imwikioli na inyama yeipugwa na inyama yeikwaba ni ijuni ya kila aina. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Iumbi yoti yomi koni ibii ibeli ibeli yajingala mu sapina pamu na Noa, <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />inyama yoti yeyajingala mu sapina babia makambaku nu nkolu ngati Sapanga eanndagalakia. Ndipala Sapanga jwapunga nndyangu ejajingala pe Noa.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Masi gingi gaendaliya kuba munndema kwa masoba alubaini. Iyula jaendaliya kuna na masi gaendalia kujonzukeka nu kujitondabe sapina nukujebe panani ja masi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Masi gaendaliya kujonzukeka ngani punndema na sapina jajebala panani jaki. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Masi haga gabii gingi ngamaa panani ju nndema, gayekaliya itombi yoti ilasu yupunndema. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Gajonzukika mbaka kujiyekale milema ulasu wa ngati meta saba na nusu. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Iumbi yoti yomi mu nndema yatenda kuwa, ijuni ni inyama yukupugwa ni inyama yu mukiholi ni iumbi yengi yoti pamu na bandu batenda kuwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Kila kiumbi somi mu nndema satenda kuwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Sapanga jakoma kila kiumbi sesabii punndema, bandu ni inyama ni iumbi yeikwaba ni ijuni yukulianga. Noa pe na bajabii naku pamu nkati ja sapina ndi babalama. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Masi haga gaendaliya kuba mu nndema kwa masoba mia moja hamsini.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mwisu ukutwele masi gingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Ndipala Sapanga ankombuka Noa ni inyama yoti imwikioli nu yukupugwa yeyabii pamu naku nkati ja sapina. Ndienu, Sapanga japogisa nhwai panani ju nndema, masi gatumbuliya kupunguu. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Iliba ya masi nu kunani kwaka Sapanga kwatenda kupugwa. Iyula jatenda kukotoka, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />masi gaendaliya kupongoka mbolimboli. Egapeta masoba mia moja hamsini, masi gabiya gapungasiki ngani. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Elahika lisoba la komi na saba ja mwei wa saba, sapina jatola panani ji itombi yuku Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Masi gaendaliya kupunguu mbolimboli ni lisoba lelatumbuliya mwei wa komi, itombi yatenda kubonikana.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Egapeta masoba alubaini, Noa, japungula lindilisa lejwabii julenganaki mu sapina je heji, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />jilipia likongoo kunza nalombi ngaselakelubuka kabete jatama koku mbaka masi egajomaliya. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Ndipala Noa jijipia inzeba ili jakalinga ngati masi gapungasiki panani ju nndema. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Lakini, ndaba masi gabiya gakona gayekalii nndema gwoti, inzeba je heji ngasejapatiki pandu pukutola, jakelubuka kwaka noa mu sapina. Noa jatondabiya kuboku jijikamula nukujikelabuu mu sapina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Noa jalendaliya kabee kwa masoba saba, ndipala jijipia kabee inzeba jela. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Inzeba je heji jakelubuka pakamii koni jitotwi limbandi libei li mizeituni mu ndomu jaki. Ndienu Noa jamanya ndi masi gabiya gapungasiki mu nndema. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Ndienu jalendaliya kabee kwa masoba saba, jijipia kabee inzeba jela, sapwali heji inzeba ngase jakelabwiki kabete.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Noa, pajabii na yaka mia sita na jimu, lisoba lu kutumbuli la mwei gu kutumbuli, masi gabia gajomiki mu nndema. Noa jayekula kipuniku sa sapina na pajalinga jabona nndema wabiya kujomiki. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Lisoba li ishilini na saba la mwei wa pili, nndema wabiya kujomiki ngani.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Hapa Sapanga ampwagila Noa, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Pita kunza jasapina, wehapa pamu nu nhwanu waku na bana baku na akaahanu babu. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Wiipia ijuni yoti ni inyama yoti ni iumbi yomi yengi yoti yeyabii pamu na wehapa ili yapapana nukujonzukeka pundema.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Ndienu, Noa japita mu sapina pamu nu nhwanamundu na bana baki na akahanu babu. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Bapita nsapina kulengana na aina jabu, inyama yoti yu mwikioli ni iumbi yoti yeikwaba ni ijuni yoti ni inyama yoti yomi mu nndema.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noa ampikii Sapanga litambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Noa ansengila Bambu Sapanga mesa jukupiki litambiku, jajukua mu kila aina ji inyama yeibii sapi ni ijuni yeibii sapi, ampikia Sapanga litambiku lukutinii pamotu panani ja mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Ulumba wa sapi wi litambiku le heli gunyambisa Sapanga, najombi japwaga mmoju jaki, “Nganagulapi mbamba nndema ndaba ja bandu, manyiki mawasu gabu ndi giliya tumbuka pu umwana waki. Wala nganikomi iumbi yoti ngati enatei. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Ngati nndema eguendale kuba masoba goti kwibiya ni ipindi yu kupanda nu kuhusa ipindi ikipepu na lyotu, ipindi ipikihuku ni ipindi ipi kilangasi ni ipindi iikilu na muhi.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Sapanga juhenga lilaganu na Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Sapanga ampengila Noa na bana mundu, jaapwagila, “Mmbelikana mkajonzukika, mkatwelakiya nndema. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Inyama yoti, ijuni yoti yu nnani, iumbi yoti yeikwaba panani ju nndema na homba yoti yu mu nhanga itenda kunzogopa mwanganya. Yoti aibei pai ju uwesu winu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Inyama yoti yomi yiibiya posu inu ngati enumpeki mimea kuba posu jinu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Lakini mwiikula inyama jejibii na mwai, ndaba womi gubii mmwai. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Nampekiya azabu kila mundu jojankoma nnzaki. Nakikoma kila kinyama sesankoma mundu. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Joankoma mundu, najombi jikomika na mundu, ndaba Sapanga ambombiki mundu ku kulengana naku.”<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Nanamu mmbelikana, mwakajonzukika, “Mmbelikana ngani, mwakajonzukika mu nndema.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Ndipala Sapanga ampwagila Noa na bana baki, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Lelenu meka lilaganu langu na mwanganya ni kibeleku sinu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />ni iumbi yoti yomi, Ijuni ni inyama yukupugwa ni inyama imwikioli na yoti yeihumiki mu sapina pamu na mwanganya. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Meka lilaganu langu na mwanganya ana iumbi yoti yomi nganaikomi kabee kwa masi gingi wala ngakwipitii kabeti masi gingi gukuhalabana nndema.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Kabee Sapanga jaapwaga, “Jenze ndi alama ji lilaganu lenhenga kati jangu na mwanganya na kila kiumbi somi sesabii pamu na mwanganya kwi ibeleku yoti yeihika. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Meka lusisi lwangu ku maundi, nalwombi lwibiya nginyuli ji lilaganu kati jangu nu nndema. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Kila panaliyekaliya lianga na maundi giiyula, nu lusisi lwi iyula elwibonikana mu maundi, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />nalikombuka lilaganu langu lemei na mwanganya ni iumbi yomi yoti. Masi gingi ngagipiti kabee nu kukoma iumbi yomi yoti. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Lusisi lwe holu elwipitila mu maundi, nalubona nu kulikomboka lilaganu le heli la yaka yanga na mwisu kati jangu ni iumbi yomi yoti yu punndema.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Sapanga ampwagila Noa, “Jenze ndi nginyuli jejuje nijihengiki ni iumbi yomi yoti punndema.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noa na bana baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Bana baka Noa babapita mu sapina babiya Shemu na Amu na Japeti. Amu babia atati baka Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Haba ndi bana atatu baka Noa nu kupete bombi bandu boti baenia pundema.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Noa jabiya nndemi, na jwabiya mundu ju utumbuli kulema litui li mizabibu, <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />jakunywa divai, jalobila ndienu jagonila heu mu lihema laki. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Amu atati baka Kanani, bijibweni heu ja atati baki, japita kunza nakaapwagi akalongu mundu abeli bala. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Lakini Shemu na Japeti bajukua suka, bijibeka mwamabega gabu, bajenda kihanganyuma nukuyekale heu ja atati babu. Balingaliya mulutengu, wala ngasebijibweni heu ja atati babu. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Noa ejakikanuka nu kumanya seanhengi mwanamundu nsoku, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />japwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanani jupata yambamba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Jiibiya ntumwa kwaka alongu baki.” <verse eid="GEN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Kabee japwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">“Shemu jupengiliwa na Bambu Sapanga wangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanani jubiya ntumwa kwaka Shemu. <verse eid="GEN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Sapanga anzonzukiya mipaka ja musi waki Japeti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">ibeleku yaki itama pamu na bandu baka Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanani jubiya ntumwa waka Japeti.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Noa jatama yaka mia tatu hamsini egapeta masi gingi, <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />ndienu jatenda kuwa koni jubii wa yaka mia tisa hamsini.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Ibeleku yaka Noa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1Majambu gi Ipindi 1:5-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Ekwapeta kutwele kwa masi gingi, bana aka nalomi baka Noa, Shemu na Amu na Japeti, bapata bana bingi. Jenze ndi oloza ji ibeleku yabu.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Bana akanalomi baka Japeti babii Gomeli na Magogu na Madai na Javani na Tubali na Meshaki na Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Bana akanalomi baka Gomeli babii Ashikenazi na Lipati na Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Bana akanalomi baka Javani babii Elisha na Talushishi na Kitimu na Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Haba ndi akahoku babu ba bandu baatumbulia kutama kumbwani na ku kilwa kila bandu kwa luga jabu, ku lukolu lwabu ni milema gabu.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Bana akanalomi baka Amu babia Kushi na Misili na Puti na Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Bana akanalomi baka Kushi babia Seba na Awila na Sabita na Lama na Sabiteka. Bana akanalomi baka Lama babia Sheba na Didani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi babia atati baka Nimulodi jwabiya jutumbuli kumanyikana kwa makili gaki punndema. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Sapanga anhenga jubiya jojubenga inyama mwikioli nkolongu, ndienu bandu bapwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga juguhenga gubiya jojubenga inyama mwikioli jojumanyikana ngama ngati Nimulodi.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Misi jabu ju utumbuli mu ulongosi waki jabia Babuloni na Eleki na Akadi mu nndema ja Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Kuhuma hoku ku Nimulodi jajenda ku Ashulu, jasenga misi ja Ninawi na Lehobotili na Kala na, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />Leseni musi gogubii kati ju ku Ninawi na musi nkolongu gwa Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misili jabiya Atati ba Aludi na Waanamu na Waleadi na Wanaputui, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Wapatualusi na Wakasilui hoku ndi kobahumila Apilisiti na Wakaputoli.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanani babia ahoku baka Sidoni jojabii mwana ju utumbuli na Ahiti, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />kabee babii ahoku baka Ayebusi na Aamoli na Agiligashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Ahivi na Aaliki na Asini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Aaluvadi na Asemali na Aamati. Mwenikatai bandu bangi buku Kanani batenda kuenea punndema. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Mipaka ju punndema jabu jajonzukika kuhuma ku Sidoni mbaka ku Gaza nu upandi golipiti lyoba uku Sodoma nuku Gomola na Adima na Sebuimu hadi ku Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Haba ndi ibeleku yaka Amu kulengana na makabila gabu na luga yabu na misi jabu ni milema jabu.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu mmbeli waka Japeti jabii ndi atati ba Aebulania boti. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Bana akanalomi baka Shemu babii Elamu na Ashulu na Alufakasadi na Ludi na Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Bana akanalomi baka Alamu babii Usi na Uli na Geseli na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Alufakasadi ambelika Shela na Shela ambelika Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Ebeli jabii na bana akanalomi abeli, ju utumbuli ankema Pelegi ndaba kipindi se hesi bandu punndema batei kubaganiki na jwa pili ankema Jokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Jokitani jabia atati baka Alumodadi na Shelepu na Hasalamaweti na Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Adolamu na Uzali na Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali na Abimaeli na Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Opili na Awila na Yobabu. Haba boti babiya bana baka Jokutani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Nndema yebatama yatumbuliya ku Mesha mbaka ku Sepisili pa pandu pi itombi pu upandi golipiti lyoba. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Haba ndi ibeleku yaka Shemu kulengana nu lukolu yabu na makabila gabu na luga yabu na misi yabu ni nndema yabu.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Haba ndi bandu bi ibeleku yaka Noa, kulengana ni ibeleku yabu na makabila gabu. Kuhumi mu nndema heji bandu baenia nndema joti baada jukupongo kwa masi gingi gagatweli punndema.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Nnala uku Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Puutumbuli bandu boti punndema babiya na luga jimu na atumia malobi agalaga. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Bandu pababiya ajenda kuhuma upandi golipiti lyoba, bahika mu musi gogubii ubamba uku Shinali, na batenda kutama. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Ndipala bapwaganinya, “Henu! Tukembisa matopwali tugajosa sapi.” Babiya na matopwali badala ja malibu na lami badala ja chokaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Bapwaaga, “Tusenga musi nu nnala goguwe lubekubeku lwaki lwiika kunani kwaka Sapanga ili tumanyikana, twiibokane nndema gwoti.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga jahuluka pai kugubona musi we hogu nu nnala gobugusengiki bandu. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Bambu Sapanga japwaaga, “Bandu haba alonge luga jimu na atumbuli kutenda hela, henu awesa kuhenga sokapi seawesa kutenda. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Henu tuelala pai na twakaangangana luga yabu ili biielewana beni na beni.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga jwaapesangana mu ndema gwoti na bakotuka kusenga musi we hogu. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Musi we hogu bugukema Babeli, ndaba hoku ndi Bambu Sapanga pajahalabana luga ja bandu boti, nu kuhuma kokuje jwaapesangana bandu kila pandu punndema.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibeleku yaka Shemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1Majambu gi Ipindi 1:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Bamba ndi ibeleku yaka Shemu. Yaka ibeli ekwapeta kutwele kwa masi punndema, Shemu jwabiya na yaka mia jimu, ammbelika Alipakasadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Ejabiya ammbeliki Alipakasadi, Shemu jaatama yaka yengi mia nhwanu nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Alipakasadi pajabiya na yaka selasini nu nhwanu, ammbelika mwana mwanalomi ankema Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Ejabiya ammbeliki Shela, Alipakasadi jatemi yaka yengi mia nnsesi ni mitatu nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Shela pajabii na yaka selasini ammbelika Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Ejabiya ambeliki Ebeli, Shela jatemi yaka yengi mia nsesi ni mitatu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Ebeli pajabiya na yaka selasini nu nsesi ammbelika Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Ejabiya ammbeliki Pelegi, Ebeli jabiya jutemi yaka yengi mia nsesi na selasini nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akammbomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi pajabiya na yaka selasini ammbelika Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Ejabiya ammbeliki Leu jatama yaka yengi mia mbili na tisa nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Leu pajabiya na yaka selasini na mbili, ammbelika Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Ejabiya ammbeliki Selugi, Leu jatama yaka yengi mia mbili na saba nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Selugi pajabiya na yaka selasini ammbelika Naoli, <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Ejabiya ammbeliki Naoli, Selugi jatama yaka mia mbili nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Naoli pajabii na yaka ishilini na tisa ammbelika Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Ejabiya ammbeliki Tela, Naoli jatama yaka yengi miya jimu na komi na tisa nu kupata bana bangi akanalomi na akambomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tela pajabiya na yaka yengi sabini, ammbelika Abulamu na Naoli na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibeleku yaka Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Yenze ndi ibeleku yaka Tela, atati baka Abulamu na Naoli na Alani. Alani babiya atati baka Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Alani jakuwa kipindi Tela atati baki babiya atama ku Uli kojasaliwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abulamu na Naoli batei kujukuu akambomba. Nhwanu waka Abulamu ankemika Salai. Nhwanu waka Naoli ankema Milika, jojabii kamwali waka Alani jojuwe kabee atati baki Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Salai jabii tasa, ngasejabii na mwana.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tela anzukua Ibulaimu mwana waki nu nsokoo waki Lutu mwana waka Alani na Salai nhwanu waka Abulamu, baboka boti pamu toka ku Uli, musi uku Kalidayu, bajenda mu musi uku Kanani. Lakini pabahika ku Halani batenda kutama. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tela jakuwa ku Halani koni jubii na yaka mia mbili nu nhwanu.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Sapanga ankema Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Abulamu, “Boka mu nndema jaku, waleka akalongu baku ba nyumba ja atati baku gujenda ku musi gonukulangiya. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Naguhenga wehapa kuba na bandu bingi, nagupengila nu kulihenga liina laku limanyikana ngani, nanagu wibiya waapenge bandu. <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Jojugupenge, niitenda kumpenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">jojugulapi yambamba nanepani nitenda kunndapi yambamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Nukupete wehapa bandu boti punndema biitenda kupengalewa.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Henu, Abulamu jaboka ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalakiya, Lutu jajenda naku pamu. Abulamu jabiya na yaka sabini nu nhwanu pajaboka ku Halani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Anzukua Salai nhwanamundu, Lutu mwana uku nndongu waki, pamu na mali gabu goti na bandu boti bababii baapatiki ku Halani, baboka bajendaninya kunndema uku Kanani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Na bahika ku Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abulamu japeta pikilanda ju nndema mbaka ku Shekemu, pandu pa sapi, pagubii nkongu gwa mwaloni gwaka Mole. Kipindi se hesi Akanani babiya ndi benei ba nndema we hogu. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Ndi Bambu Sapanga ampitila Abulamu, ampwagila, “Nndema gongo naipekiya ibeleku yaku.” Ndienu, Abulamu ansengila mesa ja malibu jukupiki litambiku ndaba jaka Bambu Sapanga joampitila. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Mwenikatai Abulamu jaboka nukujenda ku nndema wi itombi yu upandi golipiti lyoba guku Beseli jabeka lihema laki, jatama pikilanda ja musi uku Beseli na musi uku Ai. Papuje kabee ansengila Bambu Sapanga mesa ja malibu jukupiki litambiku nu kunndoba Sapanga. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Ndipala Abulamu jaendaliya kujenda upandi uku Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu ku Musi uku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Kipindi sehesi, inzala japitila ku nndema uku Kanani. Inzala jeheji jabiya ingali, henu Abulamu japalika kujenda ku Misili kutama hoku ku kipindi pena. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Abulamu pajahegaliya kuhika ku Misili ampwagila nhwanamundu Salai, “Manyiki wehapa gummbomba wogunyambiki ngani. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Amisili ebukugubona bakapwaaga, ‘Jonzo ndi nhwanamundu.’ Ndienu biitenda kungoma ila weapa baaguleka wa mwomi. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Henu wehapa, gupepakoku wakapwagila kubanga wehapa gunndombu wango ili bakandendila gaamboni na bakaneka bila kungoma kwa ndaba jaku.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Abulamu pajwahika ku Misili, benei ba hoku ambona Salai kuba ndi mmbomba jojunyambiki ngamaa. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Atumisi baka Falau eammbona Salai, bumpwagila Falau namuna Sala ejunyambiki. Ndienu anzukua Salai ampelika ku nyumba jaka Bambu nkolongu Falau. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Ndienu ndaba jaka Salai, Falau ampekiya Abulamu nhupi ya, makondoo na ng`ombi na maponda likambaku na atumisi akanalomi na aka kambomba ni liponda lu nkolu ni kinyama sebikikema ngamia.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga andapula Falau ku ugonzu nkolongu jombi na bandu bababii mu nyumba jaki ndaba ju kunzukuu Salai nhwanu waka Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Falau ankema Abulamu anndalukiya, “Boo, ndaba jakii guhengi hela? Ndaba ja kii ngasewambwagi Salai ndi nhwanu wako? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Boo, ndaba jaki wapwaaga nndombu waku mbaka nunzukua na kuba nhwanu wango? Ndienu, nhwanu waku ajoo nzukua nzendaninyaje!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Ndienu Falau jaalagalakiya bandu baki, nabombi bunhindakiya Abulamu ili juboka ku Misili koni jubii nu nhwanamundu na mali gaki goti.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Abulamu na Lutu atenda kutalungana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Abulamu jakelubuka kuhuma ku Misili, jajingala upandi uku Negebu. Jabiya na mali gaki goti pamu na Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Kipindi se hesi, Abulamu jabiya jubii na mali gingi ngamaa. Jabiya ni mipugu lupija na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Jaendaliya kujenda kuhuma ku Negebu mbaka ku Beseli. Jahika pandu pajabia jubei kambi ji lihema pamwandi, pikilanda ja Beseli na Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />papuje jabiya jusengiki mesa ja malibu jukupiki litambiku pala ndi pandu Abulamu anndumbaliya Bambu Sapanga kwi liina laki.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Kabee Lutu jojalongini na Abulamu, jabii na makondoo na ng`ombi ni imbui na mahema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Kwa ndaba jukujonzukeka kwi mipugu jabu kwabii kukolongu ngani ngasebabii na pandu pukupugi kwaahenga Abulamu na Lutu biiwesa kutama pamu mu musi gola. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Ndienu, jatumbukana milomu kati ja alimi baka Abulamu na alimi baka Lutu. Kipindi sehesi Akanani na Apelezi ndi bababii benei ba musi hogu.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Ndienu, Abulamu ampwagila Lutu, “Twiikuba na ngondu kati jitu wala alimi baku na alimi bangu, ndaba twepani twaakilongu. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Linga nndema gwoti gogubii palongi jaku hogu. Tutalukana. Anagwibia gujenda kwa mangega nepani nibiya nyenda ku malele ana gwiijenda upandi uku malele nepani niibia nyenda upandi uku mangega.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Lutu jalinga, julibona ligomba la losi luku Yoludani, jilibona libii na masi gagajagani kila pandu ngati kijongu saka Bambu Sapanga na ngati musi uku Misili upandi uku Soali. Jenze jabia kabula Bambu Sapanga ngase jwaakomiki bandu ba musi uku Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Henu Lutu jilisaguliya ligomba loti la losi luku Yoludani jajenda ku upandi golipiti lyoba ndi kubaganyika na Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abulamu jahigaliya Musi uku Kanani na Lutu jatama kati ja misi jejabii mu ligomba luku Yoludani nukubeka hema pambipi nuku Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Bandu buku Sodoma babii abaja na bahenga mahakau makolongu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu juhami ku Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Lutu ejabiya julekini na Abulamu, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Abulamu, “Linga toka pagubii pani upandi uku kusini nuku kasikazini nuku upandi golipiti lyoba nuku upandi golijingi lyoba. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Musi goni woti gougubona nagupekiya wehapa ni kibeleku saku gubiya gwinu masoba goti ganga na mwisu. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Ibeleku yaku naihenga ibiya hingi yanga kubalangika, ngati luhombi lwa nndema elusindwa kubalangika! <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Ndienu, jumuka ugutembaliya musi gongo pandi yoka ndaba nagupekiya wehapa.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Henu, Abulamu jaboha lihema, jajenda kutama pambipi ni mialoni ja Mamule jejibii ku Hebuloni, hoku ansengila Bambu Sapanga mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Abulamu anhoko Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Kipindi sehesi, bambu nkolongu Ampupeli juku Shinali na bambu nkolongu Alioku juku Elasali na bambu nkolongu Kedolameli wa Elamu na bambu nkolongu Tidali wa Goimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />bajenda kukomana ngondu na bambu nkolongu Bela juku Sodoma na bambu nkolongu Bilisha juku Gomola na bambu nkolongu Shinabu juku Adima, bambu nkolongu Shemebeli juku Seboimu na bambu nkolongu Bela jobunkemika kabe Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Boti babalogwi pamwisu ajonganisi alonda babu pamu kuhuma mu ligomba luku Sidimu yani Nhanga ja mwinyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Kukipindi sa yaka komi ni mibeli babiya atenda kuntumaki bambu nkolongu Kedolaomeli, lakini saka sa komi na tatu, bakana kuntumaki. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Ekwahika saka sa komi nu nnsesi, bambu nkolongu Kedolaomeli na akabambu akolongu ajaki bala bahika na kaawesa bandu buku Lepaimu ku Ashitaloti Kalinaimu na Aazuzi buku Amu na Aemi ku Shawi Kiliataimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />na Aoli ku kitombi sabu suku Seili, baabenga mbaka ku Elupalani pambipi nu lukoba. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Ndienu bakelubuka munyuma mbaka ku Enimishipati yani Kadeshi, baatukaliya Aamaleki na Aamoli boti na kwaalapu bandu babii atama ku Asasoni Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu juku Sodoma na bambu nkolongu juku Gomola na bambu nkolongu juku Adima na bambu nkolongu juku Seboimu na bambu nkolongu Bela bapelika alonda babu ku ligomba luku Sidima, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />kukomana na Kedolaomeli bambu nkolongu juku Elamu na Tidali bambu nkolongu juku Goimu na Amulaeli bambu nkolongu juku Shinali na Alioko bambu nkolongu juku Elasali yani akolongu nsesi kwa akolongu nhwanu. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Ligomba luku Sidimu labiya litweli mabomba ga lami, henu bambu nkolongu juku Sodoma nuku Gomola pababiya atila ngondu bahabukiya momuje, lakini bangi batilila kwi itombi. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Ndienu akabambu akolongu nsesi bala bababiya awesiki, bajukua mali goti guku Sodoma na Gomola ni ilebi yabu ndi batenda kujendane. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Anzukua hata Lutu mwana juku nndongu mundu Abulamu jojabii jutama ku Sodoma pamu na mali gaki na batenda kubokane.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Mundu jumu jabiya jukwelapwiki jajenda kumpwagi Abulamu Nhebulania. Kipindi sehesi Abulamu jabiya jutama pambipi ni mikongu ji mialoni jaka Mwaamoli Mamule. Mamule jabii nndongu waka Eshikoli na Aneli. Boti haba babiya ajongini na Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abulamu pajajoa mwana waka nnuna waki atei kunkamu, jaboka na bandu baki mia tatu na komi na nani buku nyumba jaki babaaboliki kukomana ngondu, na baapwataliya mbaka musi uku Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Ikilu jaabaga bandu baki ili jwaalapulaa bandu babunkamwi Lutu behaba baalapula na kwaabenga mbaka musi uku Hoba gogubii upandi uku kasikazini gwa musi uku Damasiko. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Ndienu, Abulamu jagakombula mali goti gababia ajukwi abaja bala, nu kunhokola Lutu nnuna waki na mali gaki pamu na akambomba na bandu bangi.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melikisedeki ampenge Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abulamu pajakelubuka ejabiya anhwesiki bambu nkolongu Kedolomeli na ajaki, bambu nkolongu juku Sodoma jajenda kuketangana na Abulamu mu ligomba luku Shawi yani ligomba lu ubambu ukolongu. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Najombi Melikisedeki bambu nkolongu jwa musi uku Salemu jojuwe jojabii nngolu jwaka Sapanga Nkolongu jojubi kunani namangani jaleta mabumunda na divai, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Ampengila, “Abulamu su kumpwagi, Abulamu Sapanga jojubii kunani ngani jugupengi! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Julumbaliwa Sapanga Nkolongu jojubii kunani ngamaa, jojuguwesisi kwawesa abaja baku!” Ndienu Abulamu ampekiya Melikizedeki pandu pa komi pa indu yaki yoti yejakamula ku ngondu.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Nkolongu juku Sodoma ampwagila Abulamu, “Ngelubukiya bandu bangu ila mali goa gujukua wehapa.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Lakini Abulamu ampwagila nkolongu juku Sodoma, “Napa mbamba kwaka Bambu Sapanga Nkolongu, jojabombiki nndema nu kunani kwaka Sapanga, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />nganijukui lugoji au nyusi ikilatu, wala sokapi sekibii saku, wakipuna nu kupwaga gunyangatii mia na mali gingi. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Ndienu, nganijukuu sokapi ila pe indu yela ya akakombu bangu yebakuliki na pandu pa bandu babapiti nanepani, Aneli Eshikoli na Mamule haba apata lipungu labu.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Sapanga jubeka lilaganu na Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Egapeta majambu haga, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Abulamu mu mabonu, “Abulamu Wijogopa! Nepani nitenda nagulenda. Nagupekia nhupi ngolongu!”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Abulamu japwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga, wiimbekiya kyane koni endale kutama sanga mwana na mundu jojilisa mali gango ndi jo Eliazali juku Damasiko? <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Linga! Ngasegumbeki mwana. Mtumwa jojubelakiki mu nyumba jangu ndi jojibiya mndisi wangu!”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Eliazali ntumisi jwaku ngajikubi jukulisa mali gaku! Ila nagupekiya mwana ju kubeleka jojibiya jukulisa mali gaku.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Bambu Sapanga anndeta Abulamu kunza nukumpwagi, “Linga kulianga! Balanga ndondu ngati sakaka wiwesa kubalanga! Hela ndi ibeleku yaku eibiya hingi.” <verse eid="GEN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abulamu anhobaliya Bambu Sapanga, najombi Bambu Sapanga anzetakiya Abulamu kuba ndi jojujetakiki palongi jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Abulamu kabee, “Nepani ndi Bambu Sapanga nenuguboa ku Uli musi wa Akalidayu, ili nugupekiya nndema gowiibia pai jaku.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Lakini Abulamu anndalukiya, “Bambu Sapanga, niwesa boo kumanya nndema gongo wiibia paijango?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Netila ng'ombi ju nkolu ja yaka itatu, imbui ja yaka itatu ni likondoo likambaku la yaka itatu ni inzeba na gunda.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Abulamu anndetila haba boti juisekula kila kinyama ipandi ibeli, juipanga pandu pabeli koni itenda kulingalani lakini ijuni ngasejuisekwi ipandi ibele. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Libanga likolongu payapala kula mitui jela, Abulamu jwatenda kwaabenga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Lyoba palabiya litenda kujingila, Abulamu lunkamwi lugonu lukolongu ni kiholu na lwii lwingi lwatenda kunhyekale. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Ndi Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Abulamu, “Gumanya sakaka ibeleku yaku itama ngati ageni mu musi wanga wabu, bibiya atumwa na biitesika kwa muda wa yaka mia nsesi. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Hata hela nagulapula bandu bandema heji babaahenga kuba atumwa, ndi biipita mu nndema hogu koni abii na mali gingi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Lakini wamweti wiitama maisa malasu na wiikuwa mu useja waamboni. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Ibeleku yaku ikelubuka pamba mu kibeleku su nnsesi, ndaba mahakau ga bandu buku Amoli gakona ngase gajagani ili apata azabu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Lyoba palajingala na lwii palwahika, litanulu lapoga liyoi na miengi japia mwotu wapeta pikilanda ji ipandi yi inyama yela. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Lisoba heli, Sapanga jahenga Lilaganu na Abulamu koni jakapwaga, “Ibeleku yaki niipeke nndema jenze kuhuma losi luku Misili mbaka losi lukolongu luku Eupulati. <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Nndema yehei yabia ndi Aakemi na Aakenizi na Akadomoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Aiti na Apelezi na Alepai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Aamoli na Akanaani na Agiligashi na Ayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Ajili na Isimaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Ndienu, Sala nhwanu waka Abulamu, jabiya jakona ngase ammbelaki nndomi mwana. Lakini jabii nu ntumwa jobunkema Ajili jojwaaumila ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Ndi Salai ampwagila Abulamu, “Gumanyiki le Bambu Sapanga ngase jumbengi mwana, ndi Salai ampwagila Abulamu Sapanga ngase junekaki mbata mwana henu nzukua Ajili ntumwa wangu pangi niipata mwana kupete jombi.” Abulamu jwajetakiya lijambu lejapwaga Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Ndipala, Salai ampekiya Abulamu Ajili, ntumisi waki juku Misili jubia nhwanu waki. Haga gapitila baada jaka Abulamu kutama ku Kaanani ku kipindi sa yaka komi. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abulamu anzukua Ajili, najombi Ajili japata kitumbu. Ajili hejwamanya jubii ni kitumbu jatumbuliya kunndongama Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Salai ampwagila Abulamu, “Ajili juhenga haga ndaba jaku weapa, nepani nugupekiya ntumisi wangu henu juboniki jubii ni kitumbu jutenda kunongama! Leka Bambu Sapanga juamua kati jangu na wehapa nya jojuhengiki gaamboni!”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Lakini Abulamu ampwagila Salai, “Ntumisi waku jubii pai ju uwesu waku, nhengila ngati egupala.” Ndienu Salai ang`alisa Ajili mbaka jaamua kutila.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Ntumi ju kunani kwaka Bambu Sapanga ammbona Ajili kulukoba pambipi ni kiliba sa masi sesabii mulutengu ji indela jejijenda ku Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Ntumi ju kunani kwaka Sapanga andalukiya, “Ajili, ntumi waka Salai! Guhuma kwako na gujenda kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Ajili jajibua, “Nuntila nkolongu wangu Asalai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Ntumi waka Bambu Sapanga jola ampwagila, “Kelubuka kukunkolongu waku Salai na wakajetakiya malagalaki gaki ngati ntumwa waki.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Ntumi jwaka Bambu Sapanga jaendaliya kumpwagi Ajili, “Niijonzukiya ibeleku yaku hata ngabiiwesi kubalangika kukujoloka kwabu.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Ndipala Ntumi waka Sapanga jola ampwagila, “Weapa gubii ni kitumbu na wiibelika mwana mwanalomi, wakema Isimaili, ndaba Bambu Sapanga jujoini mang`aliku gaku. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Isimaili jwiibiya mwini milomu ngati kinyama sekisinda kupugika, jwiibiya jukomana na kila mundu na kila mundu jwitenda kukomana naku. Jwiitama koni jukomana na akalongu baki.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Ndienu, Ajili ampekiya liina Bambu Sapanga jojalongii naku, “Weapa ndi wa Sapanga jogumona,” ndaba Ajili japwaaga mmwoju jaki, “Henu nummbweni Sapanga jojumona nepani!” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ndi mana kiliba sela akikema Beeli lahai loi maana jaki kiliba saka jojubii na womi jojumona. Kiliba sehesi kibii pikilanda ja Kadeshi na Beledi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Ajili ammbelakiya Abulamu mwana mwanalomi. Abulamu ankema mwana we hoju Isimaili. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Abulamu jabiya na yaka semanini na sita Ajili paampapa Isimaili.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Lilaganu nu kuseku jandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Kipindi Abulamu pajabii na yaka tisini na tisa, Bambu Sapanga ampitila nukumpwagila, “Nepani na Sapanga jwana makili. Pwata ulongosi wangu na masoba goti guhenga gaganengane. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Nihenga lilaganu nawehapa na kukijonzuke kibeleku saku.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Papuje Abulamu jatenda kunngungamali na Sapanga ampwagila, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />Nhenga lilaganu heli nawepa, wiibiya atati ba bandu bandema jingi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />“Tumbuka sajenu, ngabagukemi kabe Abulamu, ila bagukema Ibulaimu, ndaba nuguhengiki kuba wa atati ba bandu ba ndema jingi. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Naguhenga gubiya ni ibeleku hingi ngani niibeleku yaku yiibia makabi gingi na aka bambu akolongu biipitila kuhumi mu kibeleku saku. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Niitunza lilaganu langu libiya la yaka yanga na mwisu kwaku wehapa ni ibeleku yaku. Na nepani niibia Sapanga waku na Sapanga jwiibeleku yaku yoti. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Nagupekia wehapa ni ibeleku yaku nndema gongo jejuje sajenu wehapa unngeni, nndema goti guku Kaanani gwiibia gwiibeleku yaku nanepani niibia na Sapanga wabu.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Ndipala Sapanga ampwagila Ibulaimu, “Ku upandi waku wehapa gupalika kuhenga ngati lilobi langu elipwaaga, wehapa na bana baku ni ibeleku yaku yoti. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Heli ndi lilaganu lewalikamula wehapa pamu ni ibeleku yaku. Kila mwanalomi kati jinu kupalika jusekuliwa jandu. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Kusekuliwa jandu kwinu ndi kwibia alama ji lilaganu kati jangu na mwanganya. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Kutumbuli sajenu kila mwana mwanalomi jojwiisaliwa kwinu elihika lisoba la nani jupalika kusekuliwa jandu. Kila mwanalomi mu ibeleku inu, jukubi ntumwa jojusaliwi mu nyumba jinu au ntumwa jobundombiki ku lupija lwinu kuhuma kwa ageni banga ibeleku yaku, <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />kila jojusaliwi mu nyumba jaku na hata joandombiki ku lupija lwaku jupalika kusekuliwa jandu. Heji ndi nginyuli ji lilaganu langu mu nhyega inu, lilaganu la yaka yoti yanga na mwisu. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Mwanalomi jokapi jwanga kusekuliwa jandu bandu biitenda kummbagu ndaba jibiya jutunwi lilaganu langu.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Ndipala Sapanga ampwagila Ibulaimu, “Nhwanu waku nga bankemi kabe Salai ila liina laki libiya Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Nampengila, najombi jwagubelakia mwana mwanalomi. Nampengaliya Sala najombi jibiya nyongo jwa bandu ba ndema jingi na akabambu akolongu ba misi bihuma kwaki.” <verse eid="GEN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Hapa Ibulaimu japega magoti mbaka kibongi sagusa pai, jaheka mmwoju jaki koni jakaholaliya, “Eti kuwesikana sakaka le mwana kusaliwa kukunseja jwa yaka mia moja? Boo Sala jojubii na yaka tisini juwesa le kupata mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Ndienu Ibulaimu anndoba Sapanga, “Boo, ndaba ja kii gwandeka Isimaili kuba jukulisi lilaganu le hele?”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Sapanga anzibua, “Ngahela, ila nhwanu waku Sala jagubelakiya mwana mwanalomi, nanagu wankema Isaka. Naligangamalisa lilaganu langu kwaki ni ibeleku yaki kuba lilaganu la yaka petapeta. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Nukupete Isimaili nyoini kuloba kwaku. Naampengaliya, nukumpeke bana bingi na kuba bingi. Isimaili jibiya atati bu ulongosi komi na abeli nanepani nanhenga jubiya atati ba nndema nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Lakini lilaganu langu lela liibonikana kwaka Isaka mweni, jojuwe Sala jagubelakiya pa mwaka kipindi ngati senze.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Sapanga ejajomula kulonge, anndeka Ibulaimu.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Lisoba leleli Ibulaimu ansekula jandu mwanamundu Isimaili na boti babasaliwi mu nyumba jaki na atumwa bajaalombiki ku lupija, ngati Sapanga eandagalakiya. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Ibulaimu jabiya jubii na yaka tisini na tisa pajasekuliwa jandu. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Isimaili mwanamundu jabii na yaka komi ni itatu pajasekuliwa jandu. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Boti basekula jandu lisoba limu. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Kila mwanalomi jojubii mu nyumba jaki Ibulaimu, atumwa boti baasaliwi nyumba jaki na babaalombiki ku lupija lwaki basekuliwa jandu lisoba lelele.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Atumi atatu bukunani kuhuma kwaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Bambu Sapanga ampitila Ibulaimu pambipi ji mikongu ji mialoni jaka Mamule. Ibulaimu jabiya jutami pandu pukujingalii mulihema laki kipindi sa lyotu la muhi. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Ibulaimu ejalinga kulongi, jaabona bandu atatu ajemiki patali kidogu palongi jaki. Pajaabona jabutuka imbelu kuhuma pandu pukujingali mulihema laki, jajenda kwaajopa. Ejahikila jajinama kwi isima. <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Japwaaga, “Mwakabambu bangu, mpepa koku nunndoba mwiimbeta nepani nuntumisi winu ila mpetila kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Ngiti nundetila tumasi nkunywa nu kupomule pai ju nkongu. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Pampomule hapa niandia posu nzokopi mkula ili mpata makili gukuendale na sapwali jinu, ndaba nhiki nepani ntumisi winu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Nabombi bapwaaga, “Tusengu ngamaa! Henga ngati egupwagiki.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Ibulaimu jakelubuka nyata mu lihema ampwagila Sala, “Andiya nyata uwembi wa sapi kilu komi na sita, guunya nu kujosa mabumunda.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Ndipala japita nyata jajenda mu likundi la ng`ombi, jasagula ng'ombi nzoku jimu jejikendiki, ankabisa ntumisi jusinza nukuteleka. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Kabee Ibulaimu jajukua kabee masiba gumugandu na masiba ga masi ni inyama jela jebaandii jaandaliya ageni haba posu najombi jajema pambipi nabombi kwaahudumi pababiya akula pai ju nkongu.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Ageni bala bundalukiya, “Boo, nhwanu waku Sala jubii kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Ibulaimu jajibua, “Jubii mu lihema.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Jumu wabu japwaaga, “Sakaka nihika kabee kipindi ngati senze pa mwaka, nu nhwanu waku Sala jiibia na mwana mwanalomi.” Sala jabii munyuma ja pandu pukujingali ulihema jwatenda kujoane. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Ibulaimu na Sala babii aseja ngani, najombi Sala yaka yaki ukupapa mwana yabiya ipetiki. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Henu, Sala jaheka sumumwoju koni jupwaaga, “Nepani nu nndomi wangu twaaseja nganiwesi kupata mwana. Niwesa boo, kutogule lijambu heli nu kupata mwana?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Hapa Bambu Sapanga anndalukiya Ibulaimu, “Ndaba jaki Sala juhekiki nu kulilaluki ana sakaka juwesa kubeleka mwana koni jubii nseja? <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Boo, libii lijambu lokapi lelisindikana kwaka Bambu Sapanga? Nihika kipindi sekipangiki, kipindi ngati senze pa mwaka na Sala jiibiya na mwana mwanalomi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Lakini Sala, koni jubii ni kiholu, jakana nu kupwaga, “Ngasenahekike!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Hena ukahekike.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibulaimu jaalobe bandu buku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Ndi bandu bala pababiya atenda kuboka na Ibulaimu koni jutenda kwaahindaki, bahika pandu pabawesa kugubona musi uku Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga jilipwagila mwoju. “Boo, nunhiya Ibulaimu lijambu lembala kuhenga? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Jombi jiibiya atati ba nndema ja bandu ba nndema jejibii na makili nukupete jombi ibeleku yoti iitenda kupengalewa! <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Nunhagwi Ibulaimu ili jwaalongusa bana baki na bandu ba nyumba jaki apwata indela jangu sukuhenga majambu ga sapi na majambu gagajekeka palongi jangu. Anaahengiki haga ninhenga ganunndagi Ibulaimu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga apwaagila Ibulaimu, “Gabii malobi giliya ganagajoana gaahenga bandu buku Sodoma nuku Gomola na mahakau gabu gabii makolongu ngani. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Henu niihelala kujenda hoku nakalinga namweti ana mahakau gaahengiki galengana na malobi mabaja ganagajoani. Ana ngahela niitenda kumanya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Kuhuma hapa bandu bala bakamula indela jukujenda ku Sodoma, lakini Bambu Sapanga jabiya juhigali koni jujemiki pamu na Ibulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Ndienu, Ibulaimu anhegaliya Bambu Sapanga nu kundaluki, “Boo, sakaka waakoma bandu baamboni pamu na bandu abaja? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Pangi kubii na bandu baamboni hamsini mu musi je homu. Boo, wagukoma musi gwoti badala jukuguleka ndaba ja bandu baamboni amsini haba? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Ngasehobale witenda hela! Kwaakoma bandu baamboni pamu na abaja, baamboni kwa ahenge sindu simu na abaja! Ngahela! Jojutemu nndema gwoti ngajikotoki kuhenga gagapalika.”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Ana naakoli bandu baamboni hamsini ku musi uku Sodoma, ndienu nganaagukomi musi hogu ndaba ja bandu hamsini haba.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Ibulaimu japwaaga kabee, “Nhwesiki kulonge na Bambu sanga kujogopa, hata ngati nepani ndi luombi na maliu pena. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Anakubii na bandu alubaini nu nhwanu babii baamboni. Boo, wagukoma musi uku Sodoma woti ndaba ja bandu nhwanu bapungasike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Bambu Sapanga jajibua, “Nganaakomi bandu ba musi uku Sodoma ana abii bandu baamboni alubaini nu nhwanu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Ibulaimu jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Tosa bandu alubaini awesa kupatikana momu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Bambu Sapanga anzibua, “Ndaba ja bandu alubaini baamboni nganaakomi bandu ba musi we gola.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Ibulaimu jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Bambu nandi noba wiinhyomela, nanepani mbwaga kabee Tosa ahoto kupatikana bandu Selasini.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Bambu Sapanga anzibua, “Ngandendi hela, ananaakoli bandu ba amboni selasini.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Ibulaimu japwaaga, “Bambu na noba guneka nongila na wehapa kabee kupete lijambu le heli. Kwibiya boo, ana abii bandu baamboni ishilini.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Bambu Sapanga jajibua, “Ndaba ja haba ishilini, nganaakomi bandu musi we hogu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Mwisu weni, Ibulaimu japwaga, “Bambu na nuguloba wiyoma, ila mbwaga kabee mala ja mwisu. Boo ana patakini bandu komi baamboni, kwibiya bole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Bambu Sapanga jajibua, “Ndaba ja bandu haba baamboni komi nganaakomi bandu ba musi we hogu.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Bambu Sapanga pajajomula kulonge na Ibulaimu jatenda kuboka, najombi Ibulaimu jabuja ku nyumba jaki.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Ubaja wa bandu buku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Atumi bukunani kwaka Sapanga abeli bala bahika ku Musi uku Sodoma pakamii, Lutu jojabii jutemi pi litanga la musi uku Sodoma pajaabona, jajumuka nukujenda kwaapengana sukupega magoti nakwajinami, <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />japwaaga, “Akabambu bangu, kalibu kunyuma jangu nepani nu ntumisi winu. Nhwesa kusamba masi nu kugone nnyumba ja lelenu. Pulukela nangani mwiendaliya na sapwali jinu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Lakini bombi bapwaaga, “Ngahela, twepani ngiti tugonila papu lubanza lwa musi pani.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Lutu jaalobiki ngamaa, mwisuwe batenda kujetake nu kujingi mu nyumba jaki. Lutu jaandaliya posu, jajosa mabumunda ganga kujege amila, na batenda kula.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Lakini ikilu kabula jukugone, akanalomi boti kuhuma kila pandu pa musi uku Sodoma, akakombu na aseja, bijiyongulata nyumba jaka Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Bunkema Lutu nu kunndaluki, “Abii kwa akanalomi bala bahiki kunyumba jaku? Apiya kunza, tupala kugone nabu!”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lutu japita kunza kulonge nabu, nukupunga nndyangu mu nyuma jaki. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Jaapwagila, “Mwalongu ba, nundoba mwiitenda kihakau hese. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Nndinga, nepani mii naka kamwali abele babube ngaseawaiki kugone na akanalomi. Nnyetakaliya numpekiya akakamwali be haba mwakahenga ngati empai. Lakini mwaahenga sindu sokapi akanalomi haba ndaba ageni bangu mbalika kwaalenda.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Lakini bombi bapwaaga, “Utupeaje! Wamwe ungeni pe pa musi je pani na sajenu gupala kutuamuli sukuhenga! Ndienu twaguhenga liyaha kupeta ageni baku be haba.” Hapa ankanga Lutu munyuma kulagi atunu nndyangu waki. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Lakini ageni bala batondabiya maboku gabu nu kuhogo nndyangu, bukamula Lutu nukunhuti nkati ja nyumba nu kupunga nndyangu. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Ndipala ageni bala baahenga biiwesa kulinga bandu bababii kunza boti akolongu na soku, ndi ngasebawesa kugubona nndyangu.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutu juboka ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Bandu abeli bala bumpwagila Lutu, “Boo, gubii na mundu jongi pamba, akakamwali na akaasumba baka kamwali baku au bandu bangi baka alongu bako baatama mone? Waboa pandu je pani nyata, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />ndaba twaakoma bandu ba musi gongo eheno, ndaba Bambu Sapanga jujoini mahakau ga bandu ba musi gongo gabii gingi ngamaa palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ndienu jujutumiki tuhika kugukoma musi gongo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Ndienu, Lutu jaajendila akasumba baka kamwali baki nakaapwagi, “Nnyata! Mmbokaninya panipanije, ndaba Bambu Sapanga juguhoa musi we goni.” Lakini bombi bummbona ngati mundu jojuhekesa pena.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Kabula jukukusa, Atumi bu kunani bala anhingamaki Lutu su kupwaaga, “Jumuka, nnzukua nhwanu waku na akakamwali baku abeli biikuwa kipindi bandu ba musi gongo pabiipata azabu kuhuma kwaka Bambu Sapanga.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Lutu jabiya jutenda kuselewa. Lakini ndaba Bambu Sapanga eambonila ikia Lutu, atumi bala baakamula maboku Lutu nu nhwanamundu na akakamwali baki na kwapiya kunza ja musi. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Pabaapiya kunza ja musi, ntumi jumu kati ja abeli bala jaapwagila, “Ntilaninya ili mwiikuwa! Mwilingalii mu nyuma wala mwiijema pokapi pi ligomba hale. Ntilila ku kitombi ili mwiikuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Lutu ampwagila, “Mpepakoku akabambu, nandi noba nijenda kutali hela. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Manyiki monee ikia nukuoko womi wango. Lakini kwi itombi kola kutali ngani nanepani nganiiwesi kutili kola, kuwa hoku kwingolila kabula jukuhika kola na nepani niitenda kuwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Nndingaliya, kolako gubii musi nsokopi goguwe nhwesa kutili ndaba gubii pambipi. Ndienu, nyetakaliya ndilila konioko. Linga musi we nsokopi pena nepani nhwesa kutili kola.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Ntumi jukunani jola jajibua, “Hena, nyeteki kuloba kwaku. Nganuguhoi musi go gupwagiki. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Gutenda nnyata! Gutilila konioko, nanepani ngahengi sokapi mbaka pawihika hoku.” Henu ndi musi we hogu agukema Soali.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujoswa mwotu musi uku Sodoma nuku Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Lyoba labiya lipitiki kipindi Luti pajabiya juhikiki ku musi uku Soali. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga jwahulua mwotu nkali wa malibu ga baluti gaganyaka ngati iyula kuhuma kunani kwa Sapanga ihuluka mmisi juku Sodoma nu ku Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Jijijosa mwotu misi je heji, ligomba loti na bandu baki boti ni mimea joti mu misi je heji. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Lakini pababii mwiindela nhwanu waka Lutu jojabii munyuma jaka Lutu, jalinga munyuma jang'anambuka kikola sa mwinyu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Pulukela ngani, jilisoba lelapwata Ibulaimu jajenda pandu pajabii jujemiki palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Pajabii pala, jalinga pai upandi uku Sodoma nuku Gomola ni lieneu loti li ligomba jasangia kulibona lihoi litutuma kukwela kunani, lihoi ngati lilijiku likolongu. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Sapanga pajijijosa mwotu misi jukumosu mojabia jutama Lutu, ankombuka Ibulaimu kukumpia Lutu mu misi je heji, ili Lutu jwikuwa pamu nabombi.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutumbuli kwa Amoabu na Aamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Lutu jajogupa kutama mu musi wa Soali, henu jahama musi we hogu, jombi pamu na akakamwali baki abeli, bajendannya kutama kukitombi mulikolu. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Pababii hoku, kamwali nkolongu ampwagila nnuna, “Atati bitu aseja ngani nu mmusi gongo gwoti nga mwanalomi jukutujukuu ili tubelika bana ngati bandu eahenga punndema poti. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Twaapekiya atati divai ingali alobila ili tuwesa kugone nabu nukuwesa kujonzukeka kukupata bana kupete bombi.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Ikilu heji baapekia atati babu divai ingali, kamwali ju utumbuli jola jajenda kugone nabu. Lakini atati babu ngasebamanyiki kipindi kamwali waki pajagonila naku, wala pajaboka.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Kilabu jaki, kamwali ju utumbuli jola ampwagila nnuna, “Lisu ikilu nepani nagoni na atati, lelenu kabee twaapekiya divai ingali alobila na wehapa wakagonila nabu, nahela tubelika bana kupete jombi na atati bitu biipata ibeleku.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Ndienu, ikilu jeheji baapekiya kabee atati babu divai ingali ili alobila, ndipala kamwali nsoku jola jajenda kugone nabu. Lakini atati baki ngasebamanyiki kipindi kamwali wabu pabagonila nabu, wala pajabia jutenda kuboka. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Henu akakamwali boti abeli baka Lutu bapata itumbu kuhuma kwa atati babu. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Kamwali ju utumbuli jola jabelika mwana mwanalomi, ankema Moabu. Hoju ndi atati ba bandu buku Moabu mbaki lelenu. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Kamwali nsoku kabee jabelika mwana mwanalomi, ankema Beniami. Hoju ndi atati ba bandu buku Wamoani mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ibulaimu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Ibulaimu jaboka ku Mamule nukujenda ku nndema uku Negebu gogubi pikilanda ja musi uku Kadeshi na musi uku Shuli. Monikatai jwajenda kutama masoba masokopi pena mu musi uku Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Pajabii hoku, Ibulaimu japwaaga nhwanamundu Sala ndi nndombu waki. Ndienu Abimeleki Bambu nkolongu juku Gelali annzukua Sala kuba nhwanu waki. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Lakini Sapanga anhikila Abimeleki mu ndotu ikilu, ampwagila, “Wehapa witenda kuwa ndaba juku mmbomba jounzukwii, jubii nu nndomi waki.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Abimeleki jojwabi jwakona ngasejugoni na Sala jajibua, “Bambu waakoma bandu bunndema wangu banga na makosa. <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Mweni Ibulaimu ndi jojwambwagi jonioju ndi nndombu waki. Kabee hata Sala weni japwaaga Ibulaimu ndi nndongu waki. Nepani nhengiki kwa mwoju waamboni na ngasemii na makosa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Ndienu, Sapanga ampwagila Abimeleki mu ndotu je homu, “Hena manyiki guhengiki hela kwa mwoju waamboni, nanepani ndi nenugukaniki kuhenga mahakau palongi jangu, ndaba ngasenugulekiki kugone nu mmbomba hojo. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Henu gunkelubua mmbomba hoju kukunndomi waki. Ibulaimu ndi mlota wangu, najombi jagulobila gubiya wa mwomi. Lakini ananga kunkelabuu gumanya sakaka wiitenda kuwa pamu na bandu baku boti.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Ndienu, Abimeleki jajumuka pulukela ngani jaakema atumisi baki boti na kwaalandi majambu gajagabona mu nndotu, nabombi batenda kujogopa ngamaa. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Ndienu Abimeleki ankema Ibulaimu nu kunndaluki, “Gutuhengi kike? Boo, nugukosii kike mbaka kunete mihilu haje nepani nu ubambu ukolongu wango? Guhengi majambu ganga kupalika kuhengwa.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Kabee Abimeleki jaendaliya kunndaluki Ibulaimu, “Ndaba jakii guamwii kuhenga hela?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ibulaimu jajibua, “Naholaliya ana, pamba ngasejubii mundu joanzogopa Sapanga, henu mwakatenda kungoma nukunzukuu nhwanu wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Sakaka Sala ndombu wango, atati bitu bamu ila amabu bitu nga bamu, kwa ndaba heji naamua kunzuku jubiya nhwanu wango. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Sapanga pajamoa mu nyumba ja atati bangu nukumbeleka ku ugeni, numpwagila nhwanu wangu Sala, ‘Hela ndi ewilangiya upali waku kwangu kila patwijenda wiipwaaga nepani nu nhasa waku.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Abimeleki ankelubukiya Ibulaimu nhwana mundu Sala, ampekiya ni likondoo na ng`ombi na atumwa akanalomi na akammbomba. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Kabee Abimeleki ampwagila Ibulaimu, “Linga nndema gwoti gongo ndi wangu, henu guhagula pokapi pala pagupala kutama.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Ndienu, ampwagila Sala, “Linga nepani numpeki nndongu waku ipandi elpu jimu yu lupija ili kwaalangi bandu boti baabi pamu na wehapa kuba ngasegubii na makosa na amanya ngasegubii na lawama.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Ndienu Ibulaimu anndoba Sapanga andamisa Abimeleki nu nhwana mundu na atumwa baki aka mmbomba, najombi Sapanga jaalamisi nabombi babiya nu uwesu ukubeleka bana. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Kwa ndaba jagabiya gagapiti kwaka Sala nhwanu waka Ibulaimu Bambu Sapanga jaahenga akammbomba boti bu nyumba jaka Abimeleki biiwesa kubeleka bana.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Kusaliwa kwaka Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Bambu Sapanga ankombuka Sala, anhengila ngati ejalagila. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Ibulaimu pajabiii nseja ngani, Sala japata kitumbu ammbelakiya mwana mwanalomi kipindi aselase Sapanga sejabiya anndagi. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Ibulaimu ankema mwana we hoju Isaka jojuwe jabelika. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Isaka pajahikila masoba nani, Ibulaimu ansekula jandu ngati Sapanga eandagalakiya. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Ibulaimu jabiya na yaka mia moja kipindi Isaka pajasaliwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Najombi Sala japwaaga, “Sapanga jummbeki kiheku, jokapi jojijoa lijambu heli, jitoguliya pamu na nepani.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Nya jojakawesa kumpwagi Ibulaimu kubanga nepani Sala niijongisa bana? Ndaba nummbelaki mwana mwanalomi mu useja waki.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Isaka jaendaliya kukola, ni lisoba lejwalekiswa kujonga, Ibulaimu jahenga tipati ngolongu.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ajili na Isimaili atenda kwaabenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Lisoba limu Sala ammbona Isimaili mwana waka Ibulaimu na Hagali mundu juku Misili akunndongama Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Ndienu, Sala ampwagila Ibulaimu, “Mbengila kutali ntumwa ajo na mwana waki. Ngakuwesikana mwana jwaka ntumwa hoju kulisi pamu na mwana wangu Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Lijambu leheli lumbiniki ngamaa mwoju jaki Ibulaimu ndaba Isimaili kabee jabiya mwana waki. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Lakini Sapanga ampwagila Ibulaimu, “Wiibina mwoju ndaba jaka mwana hoju wala ntumwa hoju. Sokapi sejagupwagila Sala guhenga, sakaka ibeleku yaku bihumila kwaka Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Nukupete mwana waka ntumwa waku najombi nampekiya bana bingi, henu jwibiya atati ba bandu bingi ndaba najombi kabee mwana waku.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Henu, pulukela namangani, Ibulaimu jajukua posu ni kikoi sa masi, ampekiya Ajili nu kuntweka puubega, ammbenga pamu na mwana mundu. Ajili jaboka, jabiya jutenda kujendajenda mu lukoba luku Beli Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Masi pagajomuka mu kikoi, Hagali anngonika mwana waki pai ji kitutu. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Najombi jajenda kutama utali wa ngati atua mia jimu hela, japwaaga mmwoju waki, “Ngasembala kummbona mwana wangu ejukua.” Na pajabiya jutami pala na jwatumbulia kulela.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Sapanga anzoana mwana jola jakalela, nu ntumi jukunani waka Sapanga ankema Ajili kuhuma kunani, anndalukia, “Ajili gubi na sida bole? Wijogopa, Sapanga jujoini kilelu saka mwana waku kojubii hoku. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Jema gunzumua mwana hoju nu kumpolesa mwoju, ndaba nanhenga jubiya atati ba bandu bingi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Sapanga anhogula Agali mihu, najombi jikibona kiliba sa masi. Jajenda nukutwelake masi mu kikoi nukunkenga mwana waki. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Sapanga jabiya pamu na mwana hoju, najombi jaendaliya kukola. Jatama mu lukoba na jabiya jojubenga inyama nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Jabiya jutama kulukoba luku Palani, na anyongo baki anzukiya mmbomba kuhuma ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujetangane na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Kipindi se hesi, Abimeleki pamu na Pikoli, nkolongu jwa alonda baki, anzendila Ibulaimu, nukumpwagi, “Sapanga jubii pamu na wehapa mu kila sindu seguhenga. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Henu gunapila palongi jaka Sapanga kubanga ngawingongi nepani au bana bangu au ibeleku yangu. Ngati nepani enuguhengila saamboni, ahelahe nawehapa gutuhengila saamboni nepani na bandu bangu mu nndema gogutama.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ibulaimu japwaaga, “Hena ndenda kulapa.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Ndienu Ibulaimu andalamaki Abimeleki kupete kiliba sa masi sesuse atumisi baka Abimeleki babiya bunyagiki. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleki ampwagila, “Nepani ngasemanyiki nya jojuhengiki hela mbaka lelenu wehapa ngasegumbwagi, wala nepani ngasenhwaiki kujoana majambu ngati haga mbaka lelenu.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Ndienu, Ibulaimu jajukua likondoo na ng`ombi kumpeke Abimeleki, nabombi abeli haba batenda kujetangane. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Ibulaimu jagatenga makondoo gunkolu saba kuhuma kulikundi. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleki anndalukiya Ibulaimu, “Boo, ndaba jakii gugatenga makondoo gunkolu saba?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Ibulaimu jajibua, “Gajukua makondoo saba ganga gunkolu kuhuma kwangu nepani ili kulangi wehapa gumanyiki nepani ndi nenahembiki kiliba senze.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Henu pandu pala bapakema Beli sheba, ndaba boti abeli batenda kulapani pandu pe pala.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Baada jukujetanga ku Beli sheba, Abimeleki na Fikoli nkolongu jwa alonda baki baboka nu kukelabuka mu nndema gwa Apilisti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ibulaimu jwapandu nkongu gu nkwaju ku Beli Sheba hoku na pala anndumbalia Bambu Sapanga jojutama masoba ganga na mwisu. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Ibulaimu jatama mu nndema wa Apilisti ku kipindi kilasu.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Ibulaimu ampia Litambiku Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Egapeta kipindi kisokopi, Sapanga anndenga Ibulaimu. Sapanga ankema, “Ibulaimu!” Najombi jatenda kujeteka, “Hena nepani!”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Sapanga ampwagila, “Nnzukua mwana waku Isaka jwa kajika jogumpai ngani, gujenda musi uku Molia, ukapia litambiku luku josa panani ji kitombi simu senukulangia.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Henu kilabu jaki, Ibulaimu jajumuka pulukela namangani, jajukua liponda laki jajukua atumisi baki abeli pamu ni Isaka mwana waki. Jaandia nhanzu kwa ndaba ji litambiku lukujosa, ndipala jatumbuliya sapwali kujenda pandu Sapanga paampwagila. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Palahika lisoba la tatu, Ibulaimu jalinga palongi japabona pandu pala su kutali. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Jaapwagila atumisi baki, “Nnenda pamba ni liponda ale. Nepani na mwana wangu tujenda mbaka kolako, tukunndumbaliya Sapanga, mwisi tukelubuka kabeti.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ndienu Ibulaimu jajukua nhanzu yela, antweka Isaka mwana waki, jombi mweni jatotula mwotu na kisu mu kuboku, babokannya pamu. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaka jaalalukiya atati baki, “Atati!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Ibulaimu jajetika, gupwaga boo mwanaa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">“Mwotu na nhanzu tubii naku lakini likondoo lilitambiku lukutini libii kwako?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Ibulaimu jajibua, “Mwanangu, Sapanga mweni jukutupekiya likondoo li litambiku lukutini.” Ndienu, baendaliya na sapwali jabu.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Ebahika pandu papuje Sapanga paanndagalakiya, Ibulaimu jasenga mesa jamalibu jukupiki litambiku nu kupanga nhanzu panani jaki. Ndienu ankonga magolu na maboku Isaka nu kungoneka panani ja nhanzu yeyabii pamesa jukupiki litambiku. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ibulaimu jajukua kisu ili ansinza mwanamundu. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Lakini ntumi ju kunani ankema kuhuma kunani kumaundi, “Ibulaimu! Ibulaimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Najombi jwajetika, “Hena mi pamba!”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Ntumi jukunani kwaka Sapanga jola ampwagila, “Wanhumisa mwanawaku wala kutenda sokapi! Henu manyiki ana unndumbalii Sapanga, ndaba ngase unzimiki hata mwana wa kajika.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Ndienu, Ibulaimu jalinga pulutengu, jilibona likondoo likambaku manyelu gaki gapati pikitutu. Ndienu, jajenda jilijukua likondoo lela nukulipia litambiku lukutini badala jaka mwanamundu. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Henu, Ibulaimu japakema pandu je pala, “Bambu Sapanga ndi jojupia.” Ngati bandu eapwaga mbaka lelenu, “Mukitombi saka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwaapekee bandu baki.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Ntumi ju kunani ankema kabee Ibulaimu kuhuma kunani kwa Sapanga, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />ampwagila, “Bambu Sapanga jwapwaaga, nililapi namwete ndaba guhengiki hela na ngasewakaniki kumpia mwana waku wakajika, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />sakaka ngiti jugupengila ngamaa nukugupeke ibeleku hingi ngati ndondu yu kunani kwaka Sapanga, na ngati nsangi guku mbwani. Nabombi bibia nuuwesu panani ja bandu babaasuki. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Kulengana ni ibeleku yaku bandu ba nndema joti biitenda kupengewa ndaba wehapa gujeteki nhilu wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Ndienu, Ibulaimu jabuja ni Isaka babujaninya kwa atumisi baki bala, naboti pamu batenda kubokane nu kubuja ku Belisheba, Ibulaimu jatama ku Beli Sheba hoku.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bana baka Naoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Egapeta majambu haga Ibulaimu bumpwagila, nndongu waku Naoli jupatiki bana kuhuma kwaka Milika nhwanu waki. <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Mwana ju utumbuli ndi Usi na mwana ja pili Buzi na mwana ja tatu ndi Kemueli atati baka Alamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesedi na Hazo na Pilidashi na Yidilapu na Betueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betueli ammbelika Lebeka. Henu Milika ammbelakiya bana nane Naoli nndongu waka Ibulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Leumani mmbomba jojabii awala waka Naoli, najombi ammbelakiya bana babaakema Teba na Gaamu na Taashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwa Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sala jatemi yaka miya jimu ni ishilini na saba ndi jatenda kuwa. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Jawelila ku Ebuloni nndema uku Kanani na Ibulaimu anndelila nu kunhenge matanga nhwanamundu Sala.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Ibulaimu juguleka ntui waka nhwanamundu, jaboka kujenda kulonge na Ahiti, jaapwagila, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Nepani ndama pamba ngati nungeni kati jinu. Mmbekiya pandu panhwesa kuntaga nhwanu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Ahiti bunzibua Ibulaimu, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Tujoaninya, wehapa ndi ukilongosi nkolongu kati jitu. Guntaga nhwanu waku pandu pokapi pagwihagula, ngamundu jokapi kati jitu jojuwesa kugujima pandu paki pukuntagi nhwanu waku.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Hapa Ibulaimu jajema nu kujinama kwi isima palongi ja Ahiti, <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />japwagila, “Anakubii nnyetaki kuntaga yega juku nhwanu wangu, mpepakoku munndoba Epuloni mwana waka Soali, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />junombasiya likolo laki luku Makipela lelibii mu mpaka mwi litui laki. Munhingamakiya junombasiya nhenga litenge lyangu, jumbekiya kwa bei jokapi jejipala apambane palongi jinu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Mweni Epuloni jabiya kati ja Ahiti bababii pu nndyangu wa musi. Epuloni Anzibua Ibulaimu palongi ja Ahiti boti, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Ngaela Bambu, gupepa koku gunyoaninya. Nugupeke bwaka litui loti ni likolo lelibii momuje kabee nugupekee palongi ja Ahiti ajangu. Gutaga momo yega juku nhwanu waku.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Ibulaimu jajinama kabee kwi isima palongi ja Ahiti bala, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />ampwagila Epuloni, koni Ahiti boti ajoane, “Gupepakoku gunyoaninya. Nagulepa lupija lolujaganii litui laku, na nuguloba gujopa malepu ganga, ili nhwesa kuntaga homu nhwanu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Epuloni anzibua Ibulaimu, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Bambu gunyoaninya, litui lilombeswa kwi ipandi ya Shekeli mia nnsesi ju lupija, lupija nga sindo kati jaku wehapa na nepani? Ntaga nhwanu waku.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Ibulaimu jajetangana na Epuloni, ampekiya ipandi mia nsesi ya malibu ga feza, ngati yejapala palongi ja Ahiti, kulengana ni kipemu sa baalomba nu kulombesa ku kipindi sehesi. <verse eid="GEN 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Ndienu, litui laka Epuloni lelibii ku Makapela upandi golipiti lyoba uku Mamule, likolo ni mikongu joti jejabii momuje pamu na lieneu loti. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Hindu yeheyi ampekiya Ibulaimu ibiya yaki palongi ja Ahiti boti bababii pala pu nndyangu wa musi.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Ibulaimu antaga nhwanamundu Sala pi likolo lelibii mu litui luku Makapela, upandi golipiti lyoba guku Mamule yani Ebuloni mu musi uku Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Litui ni likolo lelibii homu bajetakiya Ahiti libiya mali gaka Ibulaimu ili jaataga bandu baki baakuwa.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Isaka anzukuu Lebeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Ibulaimu jabii nseja jwa yaka hingi, najombi Bambu Sapanga jabiya ammpengi kila sindu sejwahengiki. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Lisoba limu Ibulaimu ampwagila mtumisi waki jojabii kilongosi jwa bangi na jojujemale mali gaki goti, “Nigila nepani mbamba sukubeka kuboku kwaku mu miungu jango, <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />mbala guliga palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga ju kunani nu nndema, ana ngawanzukuki mwana wangu kamwali jokapi kati jaka kamwali baatama pa Kanani pani. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Nigila ana wijenda mbaka ku musi wangu, kwaka alongu bangu, kuntaputi mwana wangu Isaka mmbomba.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Lakini ntumisi hoju anndalukiya, “Kwibiya boo, ana kamwali hoju jukaniki kuhika na nepani kongo nankelubua mwana waku ku musi gogwauhumile?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Ibulaimu ampwagila, “Ngaela! Lingaliya ngani wankelabuu mwana wangu hoku. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga ju kunani, jojwamoiki ku nyumba ja atati bangu nu kuhuma mu musi konzaliwi, na jojuwe jalongila nanepani nu kunigi ana jaapekiya ibeleku yangu mu nndema gongo gwa Kanani. Jombi jaantuma ntumi waki ju kunani ili jukulongusa kunndete mwanangu kamwali kuhuma hoku. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Ana kabee mmbomba hoju ngajipali kulongana nawehapa mbaka kongone, ndienu kuliga mbamba kwangu nga kwagukongi, lakini wankelabuu mwana wahoku.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Ndienu, ntumisi hoju jabeka kuboku kwaki mu miungu jaka Ibulaimu nukuliga mbamba kwaka Ibulaimu kupete lijambu heli.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Ntumisi jola jajukua ngamia komi yaka bambu waki Ibulaimu na nhupi yeinyambiki kuhuma kwaka Ibulaimu, jajenda mu musi gojutamika Naholi upandi uku kasikazini uku Mesopotania. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Pajahika pambipi na musi jiijemika ngamia pambipi ni kiliba sekibii pulutengu ja musi. Kwabiya pakamii papuje akammbomba ajendika kuteka masi ku kiliba. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Najombi jaloba, “Wa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waka bambu wangu Ibulaimu, nuguloba gunyangatiya lelenu numpata kamwali hoju nukutimisa gaumpwagila bambu wangu Ibulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Mii pamba pulutengu ji kiliba papuje akamwali ba benei ba musi gongo ahika kuteka masi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Ndienu, kamwali jonumpwagila jutola pai mndundu waki wa masi jumbekiya masi ngunywa, najombi anajumbeki masi nepani pamu nu kukenga ngamia jangu, ndi jubiya jounhaguli ntumisi waku Isaka. Akubii hela niimanya kubanga gummboni ikia ntumisi wangu Ibulaimu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Ejabiya nganukujomule kuloba, apalapa Lebeka kamwali waka Betueli mwana waka Milika jojuwe nhwanu waka Naoli nndongu waki Ibulaimu, jahika jutotwi mndundu waki mu mabega. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Kamwali we hoju jabii junyambiki ngamaa na jwanga kummnya mwanalomi. Ndienu jahelala mwi kiliba na jatwelakiya mndundu waki masi nu kukwela. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Apalapa ntumisi juka Ibulaimu jola anzombatikiya nukuketangana naku nu kumpwagi, “Gupepa koku, naambeke masi ga kunywa kuhuma mu mndundu wako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Mmbomba jola jajibua, “Haga gukunywa nkolongu wangu.” Apalapa jatola mndundu waki mukuboku nukunkamuli jukunywa. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Ejabiya ampeki masi ampwagila, “Ngiti niitekila ngamia yaku kabee, ikunywa mbaka itosika.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Ndienu, kamwali we hoju jatenda nnyata kujakana masi kuhuma mundundu kujege mu lukoi luku kenge inyama, jabutuka imbelu kuteka masi gangi na jateka masi gagatosaninya kunywa ngamia yoti. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Mundu jola jabiya anndingali nakanopi bila kupwaaga sokapi, ili jumanya ana Bambu Sapanga junhwesisi kutimisa sejajendi mu sapwali jaki.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ngamia payajomula kunywa masi, ntumisi jola ampekiya kamwali jola bangili nzoku yeawata piimbulu jejitopi ngati gilamu sita na bangili ibeli ya zaabu ya gilamu komi kila jimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Anndalukiya, “Gupepa koku gumbwagila, weapa wa kamwali waka nyane? Boo, kunyumba jii pabii pandu pu kugone nepani na bandu bango?” <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Lebeka jajibua, “Nepani ndi kamwali waka Betuali mwana waka Milika, nhwanu waka Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Kwitu gabii manyoi na pandu pakolongu pukuleeke inyama na pandu pukugone mwanganya jibii.” <verse eid="GEN 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Ndipala ntumisi jola japega magoti nu kujinamisa umutu waki pai, anndumbaliya Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Japwaaga, “Julumbalika Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waka bambu wangu Ibulaimu, jojuwe ngasejukotwiki kuhenga gaamboni nukuhobaleka kutimisa malagi gaki kwaka bambu wangu Ibulaimu. Bambu Sapanga ndaba junongwisi namweti mbaka kwaka alongu baka bambu wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Ndipala kamwali jola jabutuka kujenda kunyumba na kwaapwagi anyongo baki goti gagapiiti. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Lebeka jabii nu nhwasa waki joankema Labani. Labani jaboka imbelu kuketangana na ntumisi jwaka Ibulaimu ku kiliba, <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Labani jabiya jijibweni bangili nzoku jukuwata piimbulu na bangili ju mumaboku gaka nndombu waki na jajoini malobi gajalongila Lebeka kundongale mundu hoju. Labani ankolila mundu jola jujemiki na ngamia waki pulutengu ji kiliba. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labani ampwagila, “Kalibu ku nyumba jito weapa wogupengaliwi na Bambu Sapanga. Mbona gujema kunza hoko? Nenuguhandalii nyumba na pandu pukubeka ngamia yaku.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Ndienu, ntumisi hoju waka Ibulaimu jajenda kunyumba kwa aka Labani. Atumisi baka Labani biibopuliya ngamia nu kwiiipeke manyoi ngamia yaki na ampekiya jombi na bandu baki masi gukusamba mu kugolu. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Ndienu, atumisi baka Labani baaletila posu, lakini ntumisi waka Ibulaimu japwaaga, “Nganguli mbaka mbwaga oti sekinetiki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani ampwagila, “Hena utupwagilaje.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Ntumisi jola japwaaga, “Nepani nu ntumisi waka Ibulaimu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />“Bambu Sapanga ampengi ngamaa bambu wangu, na jubii na mali gingi. Bambu ampeki ng'ombi na makundi ga makondoo na malibu ga feza na zaabu na atumisi akanalomi na akammbomba ngamia na maponda! <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sala nhwanu waka bambu wangu mu useja waki, ammbelakiya bambu wangu mwana, na bambu wangu ampeki mwana we hoju mali gaki goti. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Bambu wangu junhengiki niga mbamba nukumbwagi, ‘Naanzukuki mwana waki kamwali jokapi kuhuma nndema uku Kaanani gondama. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Ila gujenda mbaka kunyumba ja atati bangu na kwa alongu bangu ili ukunzukukiya mwana wangu Isaka kamwali.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Lakini nundalukiya bambu wangu, ‘Kwibiya boo, ana jwiitenda kukana kuhika pamu na nepane?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Lakini bambu wangu japwaaga, Bambu Sapanga jonunzetake masoba goa jagutumila atumi baki bu kunani kwaka Sapanga jugulongusa nu kugujangati ili sapwali jaku jibiya sapi, gujenda ukunzukukiya mwana wangu mmbomba kuhuma kwa alongu bangu bu lukolu lwa atati bangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Ana pawakahika kwa alongu bangu ngabagupeke mmbomba hoju, ndienu kuliga mbamba kwangu nga kwagukongi.<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Lelenu enhikika ku kiliba nobika, ‘Wa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waka bambu wangu Ibulaimu, nuguloba gunyangatiya mu sapwali jangu nu gummbonila ikia bambu wangu Ibulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Mii pamba pulutengu ji kiliba. Ana kamwali jwikiki kuteka masi na nepani ana numpwagi gupepa koku gumbekiya masi kidogu kuhuma mu mundundu waku, masi ngunywa, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />najombi ana jumbeki masi ngunywa, nukuiteke ngamia yangu masi, ndienu hoju ndi jubia jounhaguli kuba nhwanu waka mwana waka bambu wangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Enabiya nganukujomo kuloba mwoju wangu, apalapa Lebeka jahika nu nndundu waki puubega jaki, jahelala pi kiliba nukuteka masi. Nanepani numpwagila, ‘Gupepakoku, naambeke masi ngunywe.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Najombi jatola nndundu waki nyata kuhuma muubega nukupwaaga, ‘Ganga kunywa nkolongu wangu. Na kabee ngiti niitekila masi na ngamia yaku.’ Ndi nakunywaa na jwiitekila ngamia na yombi yatenda kunywa. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Ndienu nundalukiya, ‘Boo, wehapa waka mwali waka nyanye?’ Japwaga, ‘Nepani nakamwali waka Betueli mwana waka Milika nhwanu waka Naoli.’ Ndipala panumpekiya bangili nzoku jukuwata piimbulu nu kunhwatika bangili mu kuboku. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Ndipala napega magoti nukujinama nu kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waka nkolongu wangu Ibulaimu, jojunongwisi mwi indela kujenda kwaka alongu baka nkolongu wangu, kunzukuki mmbomba Isaka mwana waka nkolongu wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Henu mmbwagila ananndangi uamboni kokulangi ntenda kuhobaleka kwaka bambu wangu Ibulaimui, anangahela nala mpwaga nanepani niimanya sukuhenga.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Ebabiya jujoini haga, Labani na Betueli bumpwagila, “Lijambu heli lihumiki kwaka Bambu Sapanga, twepani ngatwiiwesi kuamu lokapi. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Lebeka we jonzo, nzukua nzendannya. Najakabiya nhwanu waka mwana waka bambu waku ngati Bambu Sapanga ejupwagiki.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Ntumisi waka Ibulaimu pajajoa malobi haga, japega magoti nukunsengu Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ndipala japia lupija na zaabu ni ingobu, ampekiya Lebeka. Kabee jaapekiya aka kilongu na anyongo baka Lebeka hindu ya bei ngolongu.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Ndienu, ntumisi waka Ibulaimu na bandu bajabia juhikiki naku bakula nakunywa nu kugone koko. Pabajumuka pulukela, ntumisi jola japwaaga, “Nandi noba kubuja kwaka bambu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Lakini Labani na anyongo baka Lebeka bapwaaga, “Gundeka Lebeka jutaama oti kasokopi ngati masoba komi helahe, henu jiwesa kuboka.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Ntumisi jola japwaaga, “Mpepa koku mwinzelawesa ndaba Bambu Sapanga junyangati nsapwali jangu, nandi noba nyetakali kubuja kwaka bambu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Nabombi bapwaaga, “Nala tunkema kamwali weni tunndalukiya.”<verse eid="GEN 24:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Bunkema Lebeka nu kundaluki, “Boo, wiijenda nu mundu ajojo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Najombi jajibua, “Mbaka nyende.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Ndienu, bunzetakaliya Lebeka jujenda nu ntumisi waka Ibulaimu na bandu baki. Na Debola nanyongo jojabiya antunza Lebeka toka pajabiya mwana jajenda pamu nabu. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Ndienu, bumpengaliya Lebeka nukupwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Gunndombu witu! Wakabiya wanyongo wa bandu bingi ngamaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">ibeleku yaku wakabiya nu uwesu panani ja Misi ja bandu babugusuki.” <verse eid="GEN 24:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Ndipala, Lebeka na atumisi baki akambomba bakwela ngamia nu kujenda pamu nu ntumisi waka Ibulaimu, na boti batenda kubokane.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Kipindi se hesi, Isaka jabiya juboi ku Beli Lahai Loi jabiya jutama hoku upandi uku kusini juku Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Lisoba limu Isaka jajenda ku matui kutembale. Ndienu, ejalinga su kutali jiibona ngamia itenda kuhika. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Najombi Lebeka pajalinga su kutali nu kummbona Isaka jahuluka mu ngamia jake, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />nukunndaluki ntumisi waka Ibulaimu, “Boo jojuhika kutujopa jolajo ndi nyane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Ntumisi jola jajibua, “Hoju ndi Isaka bambu wango.” Ndienu, Lebeka jajukua ingobu jaki jiliyeka pamihu jaki. <verse eid="GEN 24:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Ntumisi jola andandila Isaka goti gajahengiki. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Ndienu, Isaka anzukua Lebeka jajenda kutama naku mu lihema mobabii atama anyongo baki a Sala, ndienu jabiya nhwanamundu. Isaka ampala Lebeka nu kutogule mmwoju jaki ngati ejabiya jutogule kabula jakuwa anyongo.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Ibeleku yengi yaka Ibulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Ibulaimu jajukua mmbomba jongi, liina laki Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Ketula ammbelakiya Ibulaimu bana sita akanalomi bana be ndi bamba, Zimulani na Yokishani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokishani ammbelika Sheba na Dedani ni ibeleku yaka Dedani babiya Aashulu na Aletushi na Aleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Bana baka Midiani babii ku Epa na Epeli na Enoki na Abida na Elida. Boti haba babii ibeleku yaka Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Ibulaimu anndisisa Isaka mali gaki goa. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Lakini jaapekiya nhupi bana baatumisi baki bangi kabula ja kuwa kwaki, ndienu jaapelika mu musi wa upandi golipiti lyoba, kutali ni Isaka mwana waki.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Ibulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Ibulaimu jatemi yaka mia jimu na sabini nu nhwanu. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Ibulaimu jakuwa baada jukutama yaka hingi na jwabiya jwaamboni, jijiunga na aseja ajaki babunndonguli kuwa kabula jaki. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Isaka na Isimaili na bana baka Ibulaimu baataga Ahengo babu mu likolu luku Makipela lu upandi golipiti lyoba uku mamule mu litui lelabii la Epuloni na mwana waka Soali Nhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Ibulaimu jabiya julombiki litui heli kwa Ahiti, hoku ndi kobuntaga Ibulaimu nu nhwanamundu Sala. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Egapeta malelu gaka Ibulaimu, Sapanga ampengila Isaka mwana waki. Najombi Isaka jabiya jutama pambipi ni kiliba suku Beli Lahai Loi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibeleku saka Isimaili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1Majambu gi Ipindi 1:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Haba ndi ibeleku yaka Isimaili mwana waka Ibulaimu jojuwe Ajili mundu juku Misili jojabii ntumisi mmbomba waka Sala, ambelakiya Ibulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Ganga ndi maina gabu kulengana nu kusaliwa kwabu. Mwana jukutumbuli ankemika Nebayoti mwana jwapili ankemika Kedali Adibeeli na mwana jwa tatu jwabia Mibisamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />na Mishima na Duma na Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />na Adadi na Tema na Yetuli na Napisha na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Haba ndi bana akanalomi baka Isimaili na baba ndi babia aka kilongosi ba makabila komi na mabeli, pandu pababia atenda kutama ni ijiji yabu pamanyikana kwa mahina gabu. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Isimaili pajabii na umuli wa yaka mia moja selasini na saba pajakua jiliunga na aseja ajaki babalongulii. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Ibeleku yaka Isimaili batama mu lieneu lelibii kati ja Awila na Shuli nu upandi uku Misili nu kujenda ku Ashulu. Batama sukukomana ni ibeleku yengi yaka Ibulaimu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusaliwa kwaka Esau na Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Yenze ndi ibeleku yaka Isaka mwana waka Ibulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaka pajabii na yaka alubaini anzukua Lebeka, kamwali waka Betueli. Mwalamu jwa musi wa Pada nalamu. Lebeka jabiya nndobu waka Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Lebeka jabii ngajukuwesa kubeleka, henu Isaka anndoba Bambu Sapanga. Najombi Bambu Sapanga jajetakiya kuloba kwaki, Lebeka japata kitumbu.<verse eid="GEN 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Kitumbu se hesi sabiya sa mapaa. Bana be haba babiya atenda kusindana mulutumbu lwaka Lebeka najombi japwaaga, “Ndaba jakii majambu haga gapitii kwangu nepane?” Ndienu jajenda kunndaluki Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Bana abeli abii mu lutumbu lwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">ebiikola biikuba bandu ba ndema ibeli ni ibeleku yabu iitenda kukomana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Ibeleku yaka nsoku yiibia na makili kupeta ibeleku yuku nkolongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">ni ibeleku yuku nkolongu yaantumakiya ibeleku yuku nsoku.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Masoba gaki gukubeleka pagahikila, Lebeka jabelika bana mapaa akanalomi. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Jojatumbulia jabiya nkeli jwana majunzu yega joti, henu bunkema Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Jojapwatila kusaliwa jabiya ankamwi Esau mwikinzekeni, henu bunkema Yakobu. Isaka jabiya na yaka sitini kipindi Esau na Yakobu pabasaliwi.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau julombesa napwasi juku kusaliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Bana haba bakola, Esau jabiya mundu jukubenga inyama ngamaa, jwabiya jojupala kupilaki kukioli na Yakobu jabii mundu jojupala kutuli na jwabiya jojupala kutama panyumba ngani. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Ndienu, Isaka ampai ngamaa Esau ndaba jugapai kula inyama yejubengika, lakini Lebeka ampai Yakobu.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Lisoba limu, Yakobu pajabiya juteleka uji, Esau jakelubuka kunyumba kuhuma kukubenga koni junkamwi inzala ngamaa. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Henu ampwagila Yakobu, “Ngua ni inzala lena, gupepa koku nandi gumagulii posu jaku ngeli heji nguule.” Ndi mana ankema liina laki Edomu mana jaki ngeli.<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobu anzibua, “Nombasiya oti napwasi jaku ju kulisa kwaku ngati nsaliwa ju utumbuli.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau japwaaga, “Ena! Nepani nhegale kuwa, kulisi kwangu ngati nsaliwa ju utumbuli kwinyangatiya kyane?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobu ampwagila, “Nigila ote mbamba.” Ndienu, Esau andigila mbamba nu kunndombase napwasi ju ulisi waki ngati nsaliwa ju utumbuli. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Ndienu Yakobu ampekiya Esau libumunda na uji kidogu. Esau jakula nu kunywa ndipala nu kuboka. Hela ndi Esau ejijilongama napwasi ju ulisi waki gu usaliwa gu utumbuli.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Munndema gola japitila inzala ngolongu, inzala jeheji jabii ngolongu kupeta jejapitii kipindi saka Ibulaimu. Isaka jajenda ku musi uku Gelali kuka Abimeleki Bambu nkolongu jwa Apilisiti. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Bambu Sapanga ampitila Isaka nukumpwagi, “Wiijenda ku Misili, ila tama mu musi gonagupwagila. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Tama ku ugeni mu musi we hogu, nanepani nibiya pamu na wehapa nu kugupengale. Nanepani niitimisa lilaganu lenaapekiya atati baku Aibulaimu, ndaba nagupekiya wehapa ni ibeleku yaku milema heji joti, <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Naijonzukiya ibeleku yaku ibiya hingi ngati ndondu yukunani kwa mahundi na kwaapeke milema heji joti. Kupete ibeleku yaku milema joti jiitenda kupengalewa. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Kwa ndaba atati baku Ibulaimu babiya anyetaki nepani nukuhenga ganunndagalakiya juhenga nukupwata malagisu gangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Ndienu, Isaka jatama ku musi uku Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Bandu buku Gelali pabunndalukiya majambu guku nhwanamundu, jombi jajibua, “Jonioju we nndombu wangu.” Jajogupa kupwaaga joniojuwe nhwanamundu ndaba jaholaliya pangi bandu buku Gelali awesa kunkoma ili anzukua Lebeka, ndaba Lebeka jabii jojunyambiki namanopi. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Ejabiya jutami hoku ku kipindi kilasu, lisoba limu Abimeleki bambu nkolongu jwa Apilisiti jalingaliya kunza kupete pilindilisa laki ambona Isaka akunkamukamu Lebeka nhwanamundu. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleki ankema Isaka nukumpwagi, “Kumbi jonioju nhwanu waku! Mbona wapwaaga ndi nndombu wako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isaka jajibua, “Najogopa bandu bunndema goni awesa kungoma ili anzukua Lebeka.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Ndienu Abimeleki anndalukiya, “Majambu boo, gautunhengile? Jumu wa bandu bangu kabiya juwesiki kugone nu nhwanuwaku, nawehapa wakabiya gutubweni twaabaja.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Ndienu Abimeleki jaalagalakiya bandu boti kupwaaga, “Jokapi jojanhengila liya mundu jonzo au nhwanamundu jitenda kukomeka.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Saka sehesi Isaka japanda imbeju mu nndema we hogu, jahusa mala mia jimu nakanopi, ndaba Bambu Sapanga jatei kumpenge, <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />najombi jabiya mundu jwana hindu hingi. Jajonzukika kupata mali na jabiya jwana hindu hingi ngani. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Jabii na makundi ga makondoo na ng`ombi na atumisi bingi, mbaka Apilisiti bumbonila wipu. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Henu, Apilisiti bayelaliya iliba yoti ya masi yebahembiki na atumisi baka Ibulaimu atati baki, batwelakiya luhombi.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Ndienu, Abimeleki ampwagila Isaka, “Boka munndema gwitu, ndaba wehapa gutupetiki makili nakanopi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Ndienu, Isaka jaboka ku Gelali, jasenga likambi laki mu ligomba luku Gelali, jatama hoku. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Isaka jayelumbula iliba yebabiya ahembiki kipindi Ibulaimu atati baki pababii bomi, iliba yeyuye Apilisti babii ayelali baada ja kuwa Ibulaimu. Jiipekiya maina agalaga gabakema atati baki.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Ndienu Atumisi baka Isaka pabahemba mu ligomba lela bapata iliba ya masi gaganyambiki gabiya gatenda kutimbuka, <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />lakini alimi buku Gelali balosana na alimi baka Isaka kupwaaga, “Masi haga gitu.” Henu ndi Isaka jikikema kiliba se hesi Eseki, maana jaki, “Kulosana.”<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Kabee atumisi baka Isaka bahemba kiliba sengi, nasombi kabee balosanii, henu Isaka jikikema kiliba sehesi Sitina mana jaki, “Kupenga.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Ndipala Isaka jajenda pandu pangi nu kuhemba kiliba sengi na ngakuba jobalosana naku, henu Isaka jikikema Lehoboti mana jaki, “Henu Bambu Sapanga jutupeki napwasi ngolongu, natwepani mbaka tuneng`ane nukujonzukeka mu musi we moni.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Isaka jaboka hapa nu kujenda ku musi uku Beelisheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Ikilu jejeji Bambu Sapanga ampitila nu kumpwaagi, “Nepani ndi na Sapanga wa Atati baku Ibulaimu. Wijogopa ndaba mii pamu na wehapa, nagupengaliya nukuijonzuke ibeleku yaku kwa ndaba jaka Ibulaimu, ntumisi wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Henu, Isaka jasenga hoku mesa jukupiki litambiku, nukundumbali Bambu Sapanga. Jatama hoku na atumisi baki bahemba kiliba.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki atenda kujongana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Abimeleki jahuma ku Gelali jabii pamu na Ahuzati nkosi waki, na Pikoli nkolongu wa alonda baki, anzendila Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaka anndalukiya, “Boo, ndaba jakii nhika kwangu koni ntenda kunzukila na mwamenga kwino?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Bombi bunzibua, “Tukumbweni hotuhotu Bambu Sapanga jubii pamu nawehapa. Henu twapwaaga tuliga mbamba wehapa na twepani nukuhenga lilagi, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />ana, ngautuhengi sindu siliya, na twepani ngasetuguhengi sindu siliya ngatwaguhengi sokapi. Tuguhengi gaamboni na tuguleka gujenda ku lukwali sanga kuguhenge sokapi siliya. Nahenu Bambu Sapanga wehapa jutei kugupenge.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Ndienu, Isaka jaahengila tipati, nabombi bakula na kunywa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Kilabu jaki bajumuka pulukela namangani nu kuhenga malaganu. Ndipala Isaka jaahindakiya nukutabukana ku lukwali.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Lisoba alelale atumisi baka Isaka bunhikila nukumpwagi lijambu likiliba sela sebabiya ahembiki, nukupwaaga, “Tupatiki masi!” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Ndienu, Isaka jikikema kiliba sehesi Shiba mana jaki, “Kulapani,” henu musi we hogu bugukema Beelisheba mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akahanu baka Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau pajabia na yaka alubaini, jajukua akammbomba abeli bilikabila la Ahiti, Judisi kamwali waka Beeli na Basemati kamwali waka Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Akammbomba behaba baleta usungu mu maisa gaka Isaka na Lebeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Isaka ampenge Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Isaka jabiya nseja na mihu gaki gabiya ngasegalinga. Ndienu, ankema Esau mwana waki nkolongu, ampwagila, “Mwanawango!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Najombi jajetika, “Eee atati!”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaka japwaaga, “Linga nepani nzejiki ni lisoba lakuwa ngasenilimanye. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Ndienu, jukua nkoa waku nu lupende lwaku, gujenda kukioli wakabenga kinyama. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Kabee gundelakiya posu jejinoi jenijipai gunetila ili ngula nukugupenge kabula ngase nhwii.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Kumbi kipindi sehesi Isaka pajabiya julonge na Esau mwana waki Lebeka jabiya jakajoannya. Esau pajabii ku kioli kubenga, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Lebeka ampwagila mwana waki Yakobu, “Nyoini atati baku ampwagi mmbeli waku Esau, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />akummbengila kinyama nu kulenganake posu jejinoi, ili jukula, nu kumpenge palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga kabula ja kuwa kwaki.” <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Lebeka jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Mwanango gunyoanakiya nukuhenga ngati enugupwagila. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Jenda ku likundi li imbui gunetila imbui ibeli ya sapi naalenganakiya atati baku posu jejinoi jebijipala kula. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Ndipala waapelakiya atati baku akula, ili agupengaliya kabula ja kuwa kwabu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Yakobu jaapwagila anyongo Lebeka, “Nkombuka mmbeli wane Esau jubii na majunzu gingipi nhyega jaki, nanepani ngasemii naku. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Pangi atati biipala kumbapaa nanepani niibonikana ngati nndenda kwaalongama, henu niipata yaambamba badala jukupata mbengale.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Anyongo baki ampwagila, “Mwanango yaambamba yaku iimbata nepani, wehapa henga ngati enugulagalaki jenda ukanetila imbui heye.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Ndienu, Yakobu jajenda, jajukua imbui ibeli, jaaletila anyongo, najombi jaandia posu jejinoi ngani, sebikipala Isaka atati baki. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Ndipala, Lebeka jajukua ingobu ya sapi yaka Esau mwana waki nkolongu, yejabii naku panyumba anhwatika Yakobu mwana waki nsoku. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Anhwatika kabee na ngosi ji imbui yela mukuboku na pandu punhingu jaki. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Ndipala ampekiya Yakobu posu jejinoi ni libumunda lejabiya juandii.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Ndienu, Yakobu jajingala nkati kwa atati baki, jaakema, “Atate!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Nabombi bajetakiya, “Boo, mwanangu, gwegwanyane?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobu jaajibua atati baki, “Nepani Esau, ni kibeleku saku su utumbulii. Nhengiki ngati egunagalakiya. Mpepa koku, ntamakiya nkula inyama jenhumika kubenga ili mmbengaliyaje.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Lakini Isaka anndalukiya, “Kubiboo, kupata kinyama nyata nakanopi mwanangu?” Yakobu jajibua, “Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku ndi jojunyangatile.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Ndi Isaka ampwagila Yakobu, “Ndienu mwanangu, hegaliya ili nugupapia manya sakaka ngati wehapa ndi wa mwanawa wa Esau au boo.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yakobu jaahegaliya atati baki Isaka, najombi ampapia nukupwaaga, “Sauti ndi sauti jaka Yakobu, lakini maboku gaka Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Ngaseammanyiki ndaba maboku gaki gakabii ga majunzu gingi ngati gaka Esau mmbeli waki henu jatenda kumpenge, <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />anndalukiya kabee, “Sakaka le we ndi wamwana wangu Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Najombi jajibua “Hena.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Ndienu, atati baki bapwaaga, “Netila inyama heji ngula mwanawa, nugupengaliya.” Hapa Yakobu jaapelakiya ahengo posu, nabombi bakula, jaapelakiya divai bombi nakunywa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Ndienu, Isaka atati baki ampwagila, “Hegaliya pambipi pamba gunyobatiya.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Ndienu, Yakobu jaahegaliya atati baki nakwaajobate, na atati baki pajanua kunungii kwi ingobu yaki, ampengaliya kupwaaga, “Linga kunungi kwaka mwanangu ngati litui lejupengi Bambu Sapanga! <verse eid="GEN 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Sapanga jugujakaninya ulumi ukunani kwa maundi jugupekiya luhombi lwa sapi, ilebi na divai jingipi. <verse eid="GEN 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Bandu ba makabila goti gagutumakiya, na bandu boti biitenda kugujinami kwi isima. Gubiya gukilongosi waka alongu baku na bana bingi akanalomi waka nyongo baku bagujinamiya kwi isima. Kila jojwalapila yaambamba andapila jombi, kila jojagupengaliya na jipengaliwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau juloba mbenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Isaka pajabiya jujomwi kumpengale Yakobu, najombi Yakobu pajabiya jupita pena palongi ja atati baki Isaka, Esau mmbeli waki jabiya jutenda kuhika kuhuma kubenga. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Esau kabee jalenganakiya posu jejinoi, nakwaapeleke atati baki, nakaapwagi, “Mwa atati nzumuka nkula inyama jenugunhandali nepani na mwanawi, ili mmbengaliya!”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Isaka jaalalukiya, “Wehapa wanyane?” Najombi jajibua, “Nepani na mwanawi Esau, kibeleku saku su kutumbulii.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Papuje Isaka jabagiji ngamaa, nukupwaaga, “Boo, nya jojakabengiki inyama nukunete ngula, nanepani nguliki kabula wehapa jukuhika? Sakaka nummpengali, hena, numpengalike!”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esau pajajoa malobi ga ahengo baki, jalela ngamaa ku usungu. Ndienu, jaapwagila Atati baki, “Mwatati bangu mpepa koku mbengaliya na nepani kabete.”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Lakini Isaka japwaaga, “Nndongu waku jahika nukungonga, najombi jujukwi mbengale yaku.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau japwaaga, “Ndi mana ankema Yakobu! Jujukwi napwasi jangu mala pabeli. Jatumbuliya oti kujuku haki ju utumbuli ukubelakeka, henu jujukwi kabee na mbengale yangu.” Boo ngasejibii mbengale jengi jegumekile?<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaka anzibua, “Nunhengiki Yakobu kuba kilongosi waku, nakwahenga akaalongu baki boti kuba atumisi baki. Numpeki ilebi na divai. Nuguhengila kii heno, wehapa wamwanango?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau jaapwagila atati baki, “Atati mmbii na mbengale jimu pena? Mbengaliya hata na nenga atati!” Papuje Esau jalela kwa sauti ngolongu.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Ndi Isaka atati baki bumpwaagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Kutama kwaku kwibiya kutali nu luhombi lwa sapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">nu kutali nu ulumi ukunani kumaundi. <verse eid="GEN 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Wiitumia makili ili kupata hindu yaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">na wantumakiya nndongu waku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Lakini pagwiwesa kulikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">walibopuliya mu ulongosi waki.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Ndienu, Esau ansukila Yakobu ndaba ja mbengale yejabiya jupatiki kwa atati baki. Esau japanga ana, “Masoba gukukanga luwai lwa atati gahegali, ndi nankoma nndongu wa Yakobu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Lakini Lebeka pajajoa nia jaka mwanamundu nkolongu, ankema mwanawaki nsoku Yakobu, nukumpwaagi, “Nnzepa mmbeli waku Esau hoju juwasali kugukoma. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Henu, mwanangu nyoanakiya malobi gangu. Boka nyata gutilila kwaka nndombu waminepani Labani ku Alani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Wakatama naku kwa masoba masokopi mbaka inyela yuku nndongu waku paikotuka. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Inyela yuku nndongu waku paikotuka, najombi pajiibiya jujewiki gaunhengi, nagutumila lilobi jugukelubua. Ili niiwelewa na mwabana boti mwabeli lisoba limo?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu jutumwa kwaka Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Lebeka ampwagila Isaka, “Ngasemii na laha hata kidogu pandama pundema pani ndaba ja akammbomba Ahiti akaahanu baka Esau. Anakubii Yakobu najombi jujukwi akammboma Ahiti ngati haba nambanga nepani nguwe?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Hela ndi Isaka ankema Yakobu, ampengaliya nukunndagalaki, “Wijukuu mmbomba jokapi juku Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Gujenda ku Padanilamu, kunyumba ja ahoku baku Betueli, ukajukua kamwali jumu jwaka anijaja waku Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Sapanga jwana makili jugupengaliya gupata ibeleku hingi nukujonzukeka, ili gubiya atati bilikundi la bandu bingi banndema hingi. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Jugupengaliya wehapa pamu ni ibeleku ngati eampengila Ibulaimu ahoku baku, ili ugulongusa nndema gongo mogutama sajenu gutama ngati gungeni, gogugwe Sapanga ampeki Ibulaimu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Ndienu, Isaka antuma Yakobu, najombi jajenda ku Padani alamu kwaka Labani, mwana waka Betueli jojahumi mwilikabila lu Alami jojabii nndombu waka Lebeka jojaabeliki Yakobu na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau jujuku mmbomba jongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Esau jabiya jumanyiki ana Isaka ampengi Yakobu nu kuntuma jujenda kujuku mmbomba ku Padani alamu, na pajabiya ampenge ankana jijukuu mmbomba juku Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Esau jamanya ana Yakobu jaajetakaliya anyongo na ahengo baki, jajenda ku Padani alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Ndienu, Esau jamanyiki Isaka atati baki ngasejaapai akammbomba buku Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Henu, Esau jabii na akammbomba abeli, jajenda kwaka Isimaili mwana waka Ibulaimu, anzukua kabee Mahalati kamwali waka Isimaili, dada waka Nebayoti.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndotu jaka Yakobu ku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobu jaboka ku Beelisheba nu kujenda ku Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Pajahika pandu pangi, jagonila hapa ndaba lyoba lakabii lijingii. Jajukua lilibu limu la pandu je hapa jilibeka pai ju umutu waki nukugone. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Jalota ndotu, mundotu je homu, jijibona ngasi jeajemiki punndema mbaka kunani kwa maundi na atumi baka Sapanga bukunani babiya akwela nukuhuluka mu ngasi je heji. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Bambu Sapanga jajema panani ja ngasi je heji ampwagila, “Nepani ndi Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waka Ibulaimu atati baku na Sapanga waka Isaka. Nagupekia wehapa ni ibeleku yaku nndema gongo gogugoluki. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Ibeleku yaku ikuba hingi ngati msangi upunndema, nabombi bienia kila upandi Golipiti lyoba nu upandi Kolijingi lyoba nuku Kasikazini nu Kusini. Nukupete wehapa ni ibeleku yaku na makabila goti gupunndema giitenda kupengalewa. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Nepani mii pamu nawehapa, nagulenda pokapi pawiijenda nukugukelabuu mu nndema gongo. Nganaguleki mbaka panijomulia lilagi lenugupeki.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Ndipala Yakobu jajumuka mu lugonu, nukupwaaga, “Sakaka, Bambu Sapanga jubii pandu pamba, nanepani ngasenamanyiki!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Yakobu jatenda kujogopa nukupwaaga, “Nandinoo! Kyee pandu pamba patisiki ngamaa! Sakaka pamba ndi nyumba jaka Sapanga ni litanga lu kunani ku maundi.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Yakobu jajumuka pulukela ngani, jajukua lilibu lela lejabiya jubekiki pai ju umutu waki, jilijemika wema ngati mpengu nu kulibeka la sapi sukujakanii mauta panani jaki. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Japakema pandu je hapa Beseli maana jaki, “Nyumba jaka Sapanga,” lakini liina lu kutumbuli la musi we hogu labiya Luzu. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Ndipala Yakobu jabeka lilaganu nukupwaaga, “Ana wa Sapanga wibiya pamu nanepani nukunenda mu sapwali jangu, koni gumbeke posu ni ingobu, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />nukunyangati kubuja kunyumba ja atati bangu sapi, ndienu wehapa wa Bambu Sapanga wibiya ndi wa Sapanga wango. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Nalombi lilibu heli lenyemiki hapa ngati mpengu gubiya nyumba jaka Sapanga, nanepani nagupekiya pandu pamu pa komi pa indu yango yewimbekiya.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu jujenda kwaka Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Yakobu jaendaliya na sapwali jaki, jahika ku musi wa bandu bu upandi golipiti lyoba. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Lisoba limu jikibona kiliba pu ubambaa, nu pulutengu jaki gabii makundi matatu ga makondoo gapomuli. Makondoo gabiya galendale kukegwa masi kuhuma mwi kiliba sehesi sesabii kiyekaliwi ni lilibu likolongu. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Kipindi makondoo pagakuba gaketangana hapa, alimi alihingalita lilibu heli kuhuma mu munndyangu ukiliba nu kugakenga makondoo. Ndienu kulikelabu lilibu pandu paki panani ju nndyangu ukiliba.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobu jaajendila alimi na kwaalaluki alimi, “Boo, alongu bango, nhuhumiki kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Bunzibua nukupwaaga, “Tuhumiki ku musi uku Halani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Najombi jaalalukiya, “Boo, mumanyiki Labani nsokoo waka Naoli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Bunzibua, “Tummanyiki.” <verse eid="GEN 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Jaendaliya kwaaaluki, “Boo, jujumwike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Nabombi bunzibua, “Hena, jujumwike, na kamwali waki Laeli jolaa jutenda kuhika na makondoo ga atati baki!”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobu jaalalukiya, “Ndaba jakii mugabongana makondoo pamo? Sajenu kwakona muhe mwagapekiya masi, ndienu mwagapelika gakaendaliya kulele manyoi.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Lakini bombi bunzibua, “Ngatuwesi kulihingalita lilibu lende kajika jitu. Kupalika twaalenda alimi boti ahikaninya na makundi gabu ndi twaliboa lilibu nu kugakenga makundi haga masi.” <verse eid="GEN 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Yakobu pajabiya jakoni jakalongila na alimi haba, Laeli jahika na makondoo ga atati baki, ndi jojabiya jakalima. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobu paammbona Laeli, kamwali waka Labani anijaja baki, pajagabona makondoo gaka Labani jajenda nukilihingalita lilibu lela kuhuma munndyangu ukiliba ndienu jilikenga masi likundi laka Labani. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Ndipala Yakobu andamukiya Laeli sukumbusu nukulela sukutogule. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Kabee Yakobu ammanyisa Laeli kuba, “Nepani ndi namwana waka Lebeka jojuwe nndombu wa atati baku.” Laeli jabutuka imbelu kwaapwagi atati baki. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Labani pajajoa majambu gaka Yakobu anijaja baki, jabutuka imbelu kujenda kukunzopa. Ndienu anzobatya nu kumbusu nu kunkalibisa kunyumba jaki. Ndi Yakobu andandila Labani goti gagahengiki. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Najombi Labani japwaaga, “Sakaka, wehapa ndi gunndongu wangu, wa mwai gumu nanepani.” Yakobu jatama naku ku kipindi sa mwei gumu.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu jaajuku akakamwali baka Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Lisoba limu Labani ampwaagila Yakobu, “Wehapa gunndongu wangu boo, ngiti gundumakiya bwaka? Mbwagila gupala nugulepa senti ilenga!” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Henu Labani jabii naka kamwali abeli, nkolongu ankema Lea nu nsoku ankema Laeli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea ngasejabii na mihu ganga kulinga sapi, lakini Laeli jabii ni liumbu la sapi na jojunyambiki ngani.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobu ampai Laeli, ndienu ampwagila Labani, “Ngiti nugutumakiya yaka saba ili gumbekiya Laeli kamwali waku nsoku hoju jubiya nhwanu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani ampwagila, “Mbanga nugupekiya Laeli wehapa kuliku kuntoo mundu jongi jokapi. Endaliya kutama nanepani kwa yaka saba heji.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Ndienu, Yakobu antumakiya Labani yaka saba ndaba jaka Laeli, lakini yaka yeheyi ngasejuibweni hingi kwa ndaba ampai ngani Laeli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Ndipala Yakobu ampwagila Labani, “Yaka saba yegumbeki jijomwiki, henu mbekiya nhwanu wango.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Ndienu Labani jaandia tipati na kwaakoka bandu boti ba hoku. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Lakini pakamii, Labani anzukua Lea, kamwali waki nkolongu, nukumpeleka kwaka Yakobu, Yakobu jatenda kugone naku. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani ampia Zilipa ntumisi waki jubia ntumisi waka Lea. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Pulukela, Yakobu pajajumuka jasangia kummbona Lea! Yakobu jajenda kwaka Labani nukumpwagi, “Gunhengi majambu bole? Mbona gutei kungonga? Nugutumaki yaka saba ndaba jaka Laeli, mbona gumbeki Lea?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani anzibua, “Ngasetuyobali kuhenga hela munndema witu, nga miilu jitu kuntogulesa kamwali nsoku kabula jaka kamwali nkolongo. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Nzomulakiya Lea masoba gaki saba, natwe twagupekiya Laeli ku utumisi waku wa yaka saba jengi.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobu jajetaki, na Yakobu pajwajomula masoba saba baada jukunzuku Lea, Labani anzetakiya Laeli kamwali waki nsoku jubiya nhwanu waki. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani amboa Biliha ntumisi waki jubiya ntumisi waka Laeli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Ndienu Yakobu jagonila na Laeli kabee. Lakini Yakobu ampai Laeli kuliku Lea antumakiya Labani yaka saba yengi.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bana baka wa kiume wa Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Bambu Sapanga pajabona Lea atenda kunsuki, ampekiya bana na Laeli jabiya ngasejubeleka. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea japata kitumbu, jabeleka mwana mwanalomi, ankema Leubeni japwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga jagabweni mang`aliku gangu, henu manyiki nndomi wangu mbaka jumbali.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Lea japata kitumbu kabeti, jabelika mwana mwanalomi kabee, ankema Simoni, japwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga jumbeki mwana jongi mwanalomi ndaba jujoini.” <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Japata kitumbu kabee, jabelika mwana mwanalomi, ankema Lawi, japwaaga, “Kipindi senze nndomi wangu ngiti jujongana nanepani, ndaba nummbelaki bana atatu akanalomi.” <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Lea japata kitumbu kabee, jabelika mwana mwanalomi ankema Yuda, japwaaga, “Sapwali jenu nundumbalii Sapanga.” Ndipala Lea jakotuka kubeleka kabee.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Lakini Laeli pajabona ngasejubeleka bana, ammbonila wipu Lea, ampwagila Yakobu, “Mbekiya bana ananga hela ngiti ndenda kua.”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobu anhyomila Laeli ngamaa nukumpwagila, “Boo, nepani lee Sapanga kubanga nhwesa kugupengale wehapa wiibeleka bana?” <verse eid="GEN 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Laeli jajibua, “Ntumisi wangu Bilia jubii. Gonila naku ili jubelika bana badala jangu, nanepani niipata bana kuboka kwaka jombi.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Henu Laeli ampekiya Yakobu ntumisi waki Bilia jubiya nhwanamundu jatenda kugone naku. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Bilia japata kitumbu nu kummbelake Yakobu mwana mwanalomi. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Laeli japwaaga, “Sapanga juhengi sapi, jujoini kilelu sangu nukumbeke mwana mwanalomi.” Ankema mwana hoju liina laki Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Bilia ntumisi waka Laeli japata kabee kitumbu sengi nukummbeleke Yakobu mwana wa pili mwanalomi. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Hapa Laeli japwaaga, “Mbengini ngamaa nu mmbeli wangu, nanepani nunhwesiki.” Henu ankema mwana we hoju Naputali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Lea pajabona jukotwiki kubeleka, anzukua Zilipa ntumisi waki nukumpeke Yakobu jubiya nhwanamundu. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilipa ammbelakiya Yakobu mwana mwanalomi. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Lea japwaaga, “Mbatiki ndondukela,” Henu ankema mwana we hoju Gadi. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilipa ntumisi waka Lea ammbelakiya Yakobu mwana wa pili mwanalomi. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Lea jaapwaga, “Mii na ndogule ngamaa! Henu akammbomba boti ngiti angema jwana ndogule.” Henu ankema mwana we hoju Asheli.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Kwabiya kipindi sukuhuna inganu, Leubeni jajenda ku litui japata mitela jejibii ngati matungulusi gobugukema mandilake, jaaletila anyongo baki. Laeli ampwagila Lea, “Gupepakoku maguliya kasokopi mandilaki gaka mwana waku.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Lea andosa ku ukali, “Boo, guholale lenieli lijambu lisoku kunyopa nepani nndomi wangu na henu gupala kujuku mandilake ga mwana wango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Laeli jajibua, “Ana wimbekiya mandilake gaka mwana waku, Yakobu jakagonila kwaku lelenu.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Ndienu, pakamii Yakobu pajabiya jutenda kukelabuka kuhuma ku litui, Lea japita kujenda kunzopa nukumpwagi, “Lelenu gupalika kugone nanepani, ndaba nugulombiki kwa mandilake gaka mwana wangu.” Henu Yakobu jagonila na Lea ikilu heji.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Sapanga jajoaniya kuloba kwaka Lea, najombi japata kitumbu nukummbelake Yakobu mwana wa tanu mwanalomi. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Lea japwaaga, “Sapanga jummbeki malepu gangu ndaba numpeki nndomi wangu ntumisi wangu.” Henu ankema mwana we hoji Isakali. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Lea japata kitumbu kabee nukummbelake mwana wa sita mwanalomi. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Japwaaga, “Sapanga jumbeki nhupi ja sapi. Henu nndomi wangu ngiti jundendila isima ndaba numbelaki bana sita akanalomi.” Henu ankema mwana we hoju Zebuluni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Mwenikatai ambelakiya mwana mmbomba, ankema Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Ndipala Sapanga ankombuka Laeli, jajetakiya kuloba kwaki nu kumpeke mwana. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Laeli japata kitumbu, jabelika mwana mwanalomi, japwaaga, “Sapanga jumoki iyoni yangu.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Henu ankema mwana we hoju Josepu japwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga nandi gumbekiya mwana jongi mwanalomi.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu jukuba na mali gingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Baada jaka Laeli kumbeleka Josepu, Yakobu ampwagila Labani, “Nyetakiya muja kunyumba mu nndema wango. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Mbekiya akanhanu bangu na bana bangu babube mbatiki kuhuma mu utumisi wangu kwaku moka naku. Gumanyiki nugutumaki sapi.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Lakini Labani ampwagila, “Gupepa koku gunyetakali mbwaga sindu. Manyiki kwi indela jukulondo Bambu Sapanga jumbengi kupete wehapa. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Logula malepu gaku gagupala nanepani mwiti nugulepa.” <verse eid="GEN 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobu ampwagila, “Wamweti gumanyiki namuna henugutumaki na namuna henitunziki inyama yaku na eijonzukiki. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Ndaba kabula nepani ngasenhikiki wabii na mali masoku pena lakini tumbuka enahika, mali gaku gajonzukiki na kuba ni inyama hingi ngani, na Bambu Sapanga jugupengi kila konyendika. Boo, henu bana baa nitumbuliya kwaatunza lile?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani andalukiya, “Nugupekiya kyane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakobu jajibua, “Wiimbekee sokapi. Niendaliya kwiitunza inyama yaku ana wibiya guhengi lijambu ale. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Nyetakaliya mbeta kati ji inyama yaku yoa lelenu, nhagula mu likundi la kila makondoo gana madoadoa na mabakamabaka, kila likondoo lijilu, ni imbui yeibii na madoadoa na mabakamabaka. Haga ndi gibiya malepu gangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Ndienu, masoba gagahika kuhobaleka kwangu kwibonikana hotuhotu pawihika kulingali malepu gangu. Imbui jokapi janga na madoadoa au mabakamabaka au likondoo lokapi langa lijilu analibonakini mu likundi langu, heli niibiya nyiibiki.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labani japwaaga, “Hena! Kubiya ngati egupwagiki.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Lakini lisoba alelale Labani jajenda kugatenga mapongu goti gagabii na misitali na madoadoa, ni imbui yoti yunkolu yeibii na madoadoa na mabakamabaka, kila kinyama sekibii lidoa lihuu nyhenga jaki, na kila likondoo lijilu, jaabeka pai ju ulonda wa bana baki. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Labani jatama kutali na Yakobu nu utali ukujenda masoba matatu, najombi Yakobu jahigaliya kulima inyama yaka Labani yeyahigalii.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Ndienu, Yakobu jajukua lundela lubei lu mikongu ju mlubuni, mlozi na mwalamoni, jatuba ili misitali miuu jibonikana mu ndela yeheyi. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Ndienu jabeka ndela yejatubiki mu lukoi likunkenge masi inyama, ili ibiya palongi ja makundi pagahika kunywa masi. Ni inyama payahika kunywa masi ibetwiki, <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />inyama yeyela yakwelwa palongi ja ndonga yehei, nayombi yabelika inyama yeibii ni misitali na mabakamabaka na madoadoa.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobu jagabeka pulutengu makondoo, ndipala jiihenga ilingalania ni inyama yengi yeibii ni misitali ni inyama ijilu mu likundi laka Labani. Kwi indela heji, Yakobu japata likundi laki mweni, wala ngasejahanganaki na laka Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Kwabiya kila ekuhika ipindi yi inyama yeibii na afya kupata kitumbu, Yakobu jabeka ndonga yela palongi jabu mu mikoi yukukenge masi, ili ipata itumbu paibii ndonga heyi. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Lakini ngasejabeka ndonga heyi palongi ji inyama yanga na makili payapata itumbu. Apalapa inyama yanga na makili yela yabiya yaka Labani, na yeyabii na yanga na makili yabiya yaka Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Ndienu Yakobu jabii na mali gingi ngamaa, jabiya na makundi makolongu ni inyama atumisi baki akammbomba na akanalomi, ngamia na maponda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu antila Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Ndienu, Yakobu jaajoana bana akanalomi baka Labani bapwaaga, “Yakobu jujukwi kila sindu sa atati bitu, hela ndi ejawesa kuba na mali gingi kuhuma mu mali ga atati bitu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yakobu jamanya ana kujongana kwabu na Labani ngasekubii ngati puutumbuli. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Ndipala Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Yakobu, “Kelubuka mu nndema wa aseja baku na kwaka alongu baku, nanepani niibiya pamu nawehapa.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Ndienu, Yakobu jaatuma bandu kwaakema Laeli na Lea, aketangana naku kukioli kojabiya julima inyama. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Yakobu ampwagila, “Mona atati binu na nepani ngasetujongana kabeti ngati puutumbuli. Lakini Sapanga wa atati bangu jubii pamu na nepani. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Mmanyiki ana, naantumaki atati binu kwa makili gangu goti. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Hata hela jombi jutei kungonga nu kung`anambu malepu gangu mala komi. Lakini Sapanga ngaseanzetakali junhumisa. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Kila kipindi atati bii apwagika, ‘Inyama yeibii na mabakamabaka ndi babibiya na malipu gaku,’ ndienu likundi loti labelika inyama yeibii na mabakamabaka. Na kila pajupwaaga, ‘inyama yeibii ni misitali ndi yeibiya malipu gaku,’ ndienu, likundi loti labelika inyama yeibii na misitali. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Ndienu, Sapanga ejijukua inyama ya atati binu, jumbekiya nepani.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Masoba gi inyama kupata lubeli nalota ndotu, na mu ndotu heji nagabona mapongu goti gagakwela mikolu gagabii ni misitali na madoamadoa na mabakamabaka. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Ntumi waka Sapanga ju kunani kumaundi jalongila nanepani mu ndotu heji, jangema, ‘Yakobu’ nanepani najetika, ‘Ee!’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Najombi jambwagila, linga, mapongu goti gabii ni misitali na madoadoa na mabakamabaka gagakwela mikolu. Lijambu le heli libii hela ndaba nikibweni seejugunhengi Labani. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Nepani ndi Sapanga jojugupitila ku Beseli, pandu apalapa pawabeka lilibu nu kulijakanii mahuta panani jaki na papuje walapa ndaba jangu nepani. Henu boka mu nndema gongo gukelubuka mu nndema waku gowasaliwa.”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Laeli na Lea bunzibua Yakobu, “Twepani ngasetubii kabee na pandu au ulisi wokapi mu nyumba ja atati bitu! <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Kabee jombi jutubweni twepani ngati twaageni, jutulombisi nukutumii lupija lwitu lwoti. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Mali goti gaguge Sapanga jujukwi kuhuma kwa atati bitu ndi jitu twepani na bana bitu. Henu henga majambu goti gajugulagalaki Sapanga!”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Ndienu, Yakobu jijiandiya kujenda sapwali, jakweika bana baki na akahanamundu panani ja ngamia. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Jajukua inyama yaki yoti pamu na mali gaki gajupatiki ku Padani alamu, jatumbuliya sapwali kukelabuki ku Kanani kwaka Isaka Atati baki. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Kipindi sehesi Labani jabiya jupiti kwiiseku mangoma inyama yaki. Henu Laeli japata napwasi jukujiba imongumongu yi isapanga ya atati baki. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakobu ankonga Labani juku Alami sukutila sanga kulitabuka. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Ndienu, Yakobu jajukua mali gaki goti, nukutila. Ejabiya julombwiki pe losi luku Eufulati, jajenda ku nndema wiitombi yuku Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani ankagu Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Masoba matatu mwenikatai, Labani bumpwagila kubanga Yakobu jutei kutila. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Ndienu, Labani jaajukua akalongu mundu, ampwata Yakobu kwa masoba saba, bunketaninya kukitombi ku nndema uku Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Lakini ikilu, Sapanga ampitila Labani juku Mwalamu mu ndoto ampwagila, “Ulilingaliya! Wampwagi Yakobu lilobi lokapi liliya.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Ndienu, Labani anhikila Yakobu. Kipindi sehesi Yakobu jabiya jugone kukitombi. Labani pamu na akalongu mundu jagonila kwi itombi yu nndema uku Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Ndipala Labani ampwagila Yakobu, “Guhengiki kyane? Mbona gungongike, wajukua akakamwali bangu ngati mateka kungondo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Ndaba jakii watila kwa sile? Boo, ndaba jakii gwatenda kungonga? Boo, ndaba jakii ngasewandabwike? Ana wakambwagi nukugutabuka sukutogule na kwa nyembo ni ing`oma ni kilimba? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Mbona ngasewambeki napwasi jakwaatabuka sakwaajobate akamwali bangu na asoko bangu? Ajaku guhengiki ung`ang`a. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Mii nu uwesu ukugughumisa, lakini Sapanga wa atati baku ambitila ikilu jukujumukii lelenu jumbwagi, ‘Lilingaliya! Wampwagi Yakobu lilobi lokapi la sapi au liliya.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Manyiki gundila ndaba ja hamu ngolongu jukubuja kunyumba jaku. Lakini ndaba jakii wajiba imong`umong`u yiisapanga yango?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobu anzibua, “Najogupa ndaba naholaliya wakanyaga akakamwali baku kuhuma kwangu nepani. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Lakini jowammbona ni imongumongu yi isapanga yaku jwiitama! Palongi ja alongu bitu, langiya sokapi sekibii saku, ukikijukua.” Yakobu ngasejamanyiki ngati Laeli jujibiki imong`umong`u yiisapanga yaka Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Ndienu, Labani jataputa imong`umong`u heyi yi isapanga yaki mu lihema laka Yakobu, laka Lea na la atumisi baki abeli bala, lakini ngasejiipataje. Japita kunza ji lihema laka Lea nukujingi mu lihema laka Laeli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Laeli jabiya jujukwi imong`umong`u ye heyi, jiihiya pai ja matandiku ga ngamia nukutama panani jaki. Labani jiitaputa mu lihema loti lakini ngasejiipataje. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Ndipala Laeli jaapwagila atati baki, “Mpepa koku atati, mwiiyoma, ngasenhwesa kujema palongi jino ndaba mi mu masoba gango.” Ndienu, Yakobu jataputa imong`umong`u yaki, lakini ngasejiipataje.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Ndi Yakobu jatenda kuyoma andaumwa Labani koni jupwaaga, “Likosa lane lako?” Anndalukiya Labani, ndei lihakau bole mbaka kutenda kundaputa? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Gupatiki kyane sesikuba sako baada jukulingalaki misigu jangu jote? Beka palongi ja akalongu bangu boti na akaalongu bako, ili aamua kati jitu twepani twaabeli. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Ndamiki nawehapa kwa yaka ishilini, na masoba goti gehaga makondoo gaku wala imbui yaku ngasenhwaiki kuhalabana kitumbu, wala ngasenhwaiki kula likondoo likambaku lilikundi laku. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Nepani ngasenhwaiki kugulete hata mala jimu kinyama sakusekikomeka ni kinyama sumukioli, ila mbidia hasala je heji namweti. Wehapa gupalika neepa sanga kulinga ajibika muhi au ikilu. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Henu, muhi libabalika lyoba likali ni ikilu kipogila kipepu kikali ngasenhwesiki hata kupata lugonu hata kasokopi. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Kwa yaka ishilini heji joti ndamika panyumba jaku. Nugutumii yaka komi nu nsesi ndaba jaka kamwali baku abeli, na yaka sita nimika inyama yaku. Lakini wehapa wang`anambula malepu gangu. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Ana Sapanga wa atati bangu Ibulaimu, Sapanga jojaahenga atati bangu Aisaka kubagaja, ngabakabii pamu nanepani, sakaka ukabiya gunei moka bila sindu sokapi. Lakini Sapanga jagabweni mang`aliku gangu ni lihengu lenhengika kwa maboku gangu, jugulakaliya ikilu jukujumuki lelenu.<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaganu laka Yakobu na Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Hapa Labani anzibua Yakobu, “Akamwali haba ndi akakamwali bangu, bana haba bana bangu, inyama haye ndi inyama yangu, na yoti yewiibona hapa ndi yangu. Lakini nepani nhwesa kuhenga kyani lelenu kwa akakamwali bangu na bana babu baabeliki haba ili awesa kuhigila? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Henu tuhenga lilaganu wehapa na nepani, libiya ushahidi kati jaku na nepani.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Ndienu, Yakobu jatola lilibu, jilijemika ngati mpengo gukukombuke. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Kabee Yakobu japwagila akaalongu mundu, “Nntondula malibu.” Nabombi batondula malibu nukulihenga lilundu. Ndipala bakula posu pambipi ni lilundu la malibu leheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Labani jilikema lilibu leheli Yegali sahaduta, lakini Yakobu jilikema Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labani japwaaga, “Lilundu ale ndi usaidi kati jaku na nepani lelenu.” Henu Labani jilikema Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Henu Labani kabee japwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga jutulinga patwiibiya kutali sanga kubonana.” Ndienu jijikema mpengu gola Misipa. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Ana waang`alisi akakamwali bangu, au anagujukwi akammbomba bangi kabee ja aba, ndienu gumanya kabee nga usaidi kati jitu ila Sapanga mweni. <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Kabee Labani ampwagila Yakobu, “Linga lilundu la malibu ale na mpengu ago nugujemiki kati jaku na nepani. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Lilundu ale nu mpengu ago jenze ndi lilangi nepani nganaipeti lilundu hale kuhika kuguhumisa, na wala wehapa nganalipeti lilundu hale kuhika kwangu nepani kuguhumisa. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Sapanga waka Ibulaimu na Sapanga waka Naoli na Sapanga wa atati babu, jwiamua kati jitu.” Ndienu Yakobu jalaapa kwa Sapanga jojabiya anhengi atati baki Isaka kubagaja. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Ndipala, japia litambiku kukitombi kola na kwaakoka akalongu baki akulaninya posu. Ebajomula kula bahigaliya hoku ikilu kelukelu. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Pulukela ngani Labani jajumuka, jajobatiya asoko baki na akakamwali baki nakwaapenge. Ndipala nukuboka kubuja kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu jiliandiya kuketangana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yakobu jaendaliya na sapwali jaki. Ndienu, atumi baka Sapanga bukunani batenda kuketangana naku. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Yakobu pajaabona, jaapwaga, “Haba alonda baka Sapanga!” Henu japakema pandu je hapa Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yakobu jaatuma bandu andonguliya kujenda kukundongu waki Esau ku Seili ku nndema uku Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Jaatuma akumpwagila Esau, “Bambu wangu Esau nndongu waku Yakobu jupwaaga ana, ndami kwaka Labani masoba goti haga ngati nunngeni. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Mina ng`ombi na maponda na makundi ga makondoo na atumisi akanalomi na akammbomba. Nugutumii malobi ganga, bambu wangu, ili gunyetakiya kuhika hoku.”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Bandu bala pabakelabuka kwaka Yakobu bumpwagila, “Tuhiki kukundongu waku Esau, najombi jubii mwiindela kuhika kugujopa, koni jubii na bandu mia nsesi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Ndienu Yakobu jajogipi ngamaa nukuhangajika. Jaabagula makundi mabeli bandu bababii pamu najombi na makondoo ni mipugu jengi na ngamia, <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />jaholaliya, “Ana Esau jihika nukulioa likundi limu henu lelihigaliya liitenda kutila.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Ndipala Yakobu andoba Sapanga nukupwaaga, “Wa Sapanga wa ahoku bangu Ibulaimu, Sapanga wa atati ba Isaka! We ndi wa Bambu Sapanga wogumbwagi muja ku nndema wangu na kwaka alongu bangu, nu kunagi kubanga winhengila gaamboni, <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />ngasembalika hata kasokopi majambu gaamboni gagunhengi sukuhobaleka nepani nu mtumi waku. Panalombuka losi lwa Yoludani, ngasenabii na sindu ila ndonga, lakini sajenu mii na makundi mabeli haga. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Nuguloba gunhokua sajenu kuhuma kukundongu wangu Esau, ndaba mi ni kiholu kuba juwesa kutukamu nukutukoma twaboa, akanyongoo pamu na bana. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Wehapa wanagi kunhenge gaamboni na kwiihenga ibeleku yangu ibiya hingi ngati nsangi guku nhanga nkolongu gogugwe ngasegubalangika kukujoloka kwaki.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Ndienu, Yakobu jagonila pala ikilu je heji. Ndipala jatenga pandu pa mali gaki pabiya nhupi kukunndongu waki Esau. <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Imbui yunkolu mia ibeli na mapongu ishilini na makondoo gunkolu mia ibeli na mapongu ishilini, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ngamia selasini yeijongesa pamu na matoli gaki, ng`ombi alubaini na makambaku komi na maponda gunkolu ishilini na makambaku komi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Jaakabisa atumisi baki kila jumu likundi laki, jaapwagila, “Nndonguliya mwijileka napwasi kati ji likundi limu ni likundi lengi mu sapwali jinu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Andagalakiya jojalonguli jola “Nndongu wa Esau pajiketangana na wehapa nukugulaluki, ‘Wehapa gu ntumisi waka nyane? Gujenda kwako? Ni inyama haye yaka nyane?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Wehapa wanzibua, ‘Ganga mali gukuntumisi waku Yakobu tuguleti jibia nhupi yaku na mweni jubii munyuma hamo jutenda kuhika.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Japia lilagisu lele kuku ntumisi ulikundi la pili na la tatu na gangi goa, japwaaga, “Mukumpwagila Esau malobi gaga pamwakaketangana naku. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Kabee mukumpwagila, ‘Ntumisi waku Yakobu jubii munyuma juhika.’ ” Yakobu jahenga hela jaholaliya, “Pangi kwa nantulisa kwa nhupi yenundongulaki heyi, na mwenikatai nhwesa kubonana naku ana kwa ana, tosa mbaka junyopi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Ndienu, jalongulakiya nhupi yaki, lakini mweni jagonila mu likambi ikilu jeheji.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu jukomana malimba na mundu Kupenieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Ikilu jeje Yakobu jajumuka, jajukua akahanamundu abeli, atumisi baki abeli na bana baki abeli komi na jumu, japeta kalosi ka Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Ejabiya jaalombwi kwii bababii na mali gaki goti, <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Yakobu jahigaliya kajika jaki. Mundu jumu jahika nukukomana naku malimba mbaka lioba pa lapita. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Mundu we hoju pajabona ngajuwesi kunhwesa Yakobu jagusa nyonga ji kibunu, najombi jatenda kuteguka pajabiya jukomana naku malimba. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Ndipala mundu jola ampwagila Yakobu, “Neka nyendaje, ndaba kutenda kukusa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Lakini Yakobu ampwagila, “Nganugulekake hata kasokopi mbaka gumbengaliya.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Najombi anndalukiya, “Liina laku nyane?” Jombi jajibua, “Yakobu.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Mundu jola ampwagila, “Ngabagukemi wa Yakobu kabete, ila bagukema wa Izilaeli, ndaba gukumini malimba na Sapanga kabee na bandu, nawe waawesiki.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Ndipala Yakobu ampwagila, “Gupepa koku, nuguloba gumbwagila liina laku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Lakini jombi ampwagila, “Boo, ndaba ja kii gunaluki liina lango?” Ndipala nukumpengale Yakobu.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yakobu japakema pandu je pala Panueli, japwaaga, “Numbweni Sapanga hotuhotu, nanepani ngasenguwike.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Liyoba labiya lipitike kipindi Yakobu pajaboka ku Panueli, jabiya jutenda kusepe ndaba ja nnyonga jaki jateikuteguka. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Ndi mana mbaka lelenu Aizilaeli ngaseakula nsipa wikibaba, ndaba jaka mundu jola angusiki Yakobu papabii ni kibaba mu nsipa ukibunu saki.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu juketangana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Ndienu, Yakobu jalinga, ammbona Esau jihika na bandu mia nsesi. Hapa jaabaga bana baki kati jaka bana baka Lea na bana baka Laeli na atumisi abeli bala. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Jaabeka atumisi na bana baki palongi, ndipala Lea na bana baki nu munyuma Laeli na mwana waki Josepu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Ndipala mweni jatenda kaalongule, jajinama mbaka pai kwi isima mala saba, mbaka pajahika pambipi nu nndongu mundu. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Ndipala, Esau jajenda imbelu kunzopa Yakobu, anzobatiya nukumbusu munhingu, na boa abeli batenda kulela. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau pajalinga na kwaabona akanyongo bala na bana, jalalukiya, “Boo, bamba akanyane?” Yakobu anzibua, “Bamba ndi bana bajumbeki Sapanga sukumbendale, jumbeki nepani nu ntumisi waku.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Ndipala atumisi bala bahegaliya pamu na bana babu, bajinama kwi isima. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Kabee Lea jahika pamu na bana baki, jajinama kwi isima. Mwisu weni Laeli na Josepu bahika nukujinama kwi isima.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Ndienu Esau jalalukiya, “Boo, likundi lengetangini naku mwiindela ale mana jaki kike?” Yakobu jajibua, “Nuguleti ndaba natokuliya gunyetakaliya kuhika kwaku wa bambu wango.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Lakini Esau japwaaga, “Mina mali gukutosa nndongu wangu. Mali gaku gabiya gaku wamwete.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobu ampwagila, “Laa! Ana sakaka gujetaki kunyukua, ndienu nuguloba gujopa nhupi yangu. Kee kupabona pamihu jaku kubii ngati kupabona pamihu jaka Sapanga, kwa ndaba hegunyopiki kwa uamboni nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Henu nuguloba gujetakiya nhupi jenuguleti, ndaba hata nepani kabee Sapanga jutei kumbendale, nanepani mii na mali gingi.” Ndi Yakobu ankololua Esau, najombi jajopa nhupi jaki.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Esau japwaaga, “Hena! Tuendaliya na sapwali jito, nepani mwiti ndenda kugulongulela.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Lakini Yakobu ampwaagila, “Bambu wangu, wehapa gumanyiki bana haba asoku ni mipugu jenze jitenda kujongesa nanepani nhwesa kujitunza ana inyama haye anawiibutuini imbelu kwi lisoba limu ngiti itenda kuwa yote. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Henu nuguloba gulonguliya gunkolongu wangu, nanepani ntumisi waku ngiti mbwata mbolimboli kulengana ni inyama ahaye eijenda na bana mbaka enihika ku Seili.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Hapa Esau japwaaga, “Mbanga nugulekila bandu ba bangi.” Lakini Yakobu japwaaga, “Kubii na sababu boo, jukuhenga hela? Kutosi pagumbeki uamboni palongi jaku unkolongu wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Ndienu, lisoba heli Esau jatumbuliya sapwali jukubuja ku Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Lakini Yakobu jaendaliya na sapwali kujenda ku musi uku Sukoti na hoku jasenga nyumba ni indamba ndaba ji inyama yaki. Kwa ndaba heji pandu je hapa bapakema pa Sukoti.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yakobu jahuma ku Padanilami jahika sapi ku musi uku Shekemu mu nndema uku Kanani jagonila pambipi na musi we hogu. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Pandu pupunndema hapa papuje pajatemi japalomba kuhuma ku kibeleku saka Hamoli atati baka Shekemu, kwi ipandi mia jimu yu lupija. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Hoku jasenga litambiku nukupakema Sapanga ndi Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Shekemu anndimba Dina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Lisoba limu, Dina kamwali waka Yakobu na Lea, jajenda kwaatembale akammbomba baakola. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Ndienu, Shekemu mwana waka Amoli kuhuma likabila la Ahivi, jojabii nkolongu wa nndema hogu, paambona Dina ankamula nukugone naku kwa makili.<verse eid="GEN 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Lakini Shekemu jwalenganiwi ngamaa na Dina kamwali waka Yakobu, ampai mbaka jatumbuliya kulonge naku malobi ga sapi. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Henu, Shekemu jalongila na Amoli atati baki, ampwagila, “Mpepa koku nobila mmbomba hoju nanuntole.” <verse eid="GEN 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobu jajoana kubanga, kamwali waki Dina jusapuliwi na Shekemu, lakini kwa ndaba bana baki babii mu kulima, jatumbala mbaka ebakelubuka. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Amoli atati baka Shekemu, bajenda kwaka Yakobu ili kulongee naku, <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />na kipindi sesesi bana akanalomi baka Yakobu ebajoana lijambu leheli baamua kubuja kunyumba kuhuma kukulima. Akakombu behaba bayomiki ngamaa nukugubona usungu nkolongu, kwa ndaba Shekemu jabiya jwaahengi bandu buku Izilaeli sindu si iyoni sukunndimba kamwali waka Yakobu, ndaba lijambu leheli labiya ngaselipalika, <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Lakini Amoli jaapwagila, “Mwanangu Shekemu ampai ngamaa kamwali winu. Ndienu, mpepa koku munzetakaliya anntolaje. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Ajukuanaje, mwanganya ngiti mutujukuliya akakamwali binu, na twepani ngiti tumpekiya akakamwali bitu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Henu ngiti ntama pamu na twepani, mwiibiya hulu mu nndema gongo. Mwiitama mombo, nhenga biashala nukupata mali.” <verse eid="GEN 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Ahelahe, Shekemu jaapwagila atati na akalongu baka Dina, “Mpepa koku, nannyetakia palongi jino, nanepani ngiti numpekiya sokapi semwiipwaga. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Mbwagila kiasi sokapi sela sa mali na nhupi, hata anakibii kikolongu namuna boo, nanepani ngiti ndenda kupia, ili pe nunzukua mmbomba hoju.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Ndienu bana akanalomi baka Yakobu bunzibua Shekemu na Amoli atati babu kwi isoli, ndaba Shekemu jabiya asapwi dada wabu Dina. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Baapwagila, “Ngatuwesi kuntolake dada witu kwaka mundu jwanga kusekuliwa jandu. Kukuhenga hela twe kwitu Iyoni. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Twiijetanganinya ku mihilu jenze, mwiibiya ngati twepani ku kukuseku jandu kila mwanalomi kati jinu. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Hapa ndi patwaajetakalia kwaajuku aka kamwali bitu na twepani twaajukua aka kamwali binu, twiitama pamu na kuba aka kilongu. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Lakini ana ngasennzetanganii na twepani nukusekuliwa jandu, henu twepani twanzukua kamwali witu nukujenda naku.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Lijambu heli laalengani Amoli na Shekemu mwanawaki. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Nkombu we hoju ngasejaseliwi kuhenga haga ndaba ampai kamwali waka Yakobu. Kabee Shekemu ndi jojwabii ni isima kuliku bangi boti panyumba jabu.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Ndienu, Amoli na Shekemu mwana waki, bajenda kulitanga la musi, pandu pukuketangane, kulonge na bandu babu kupwaaga, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Bandu haba ndi akakosi bitu. Twaajopa atama munndema witu nukuhenga biashala, ndaba tubii na nndema ukututosa twepani na bombi kabee, ndienu twaajukua akakamwali babu na twepani twaapekiya akakamwali bitu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Lakini bombi biijetakiya kutama na twepani na twibiya twaakilongu ku nhilu gongo, twansekula jandu kila mwanalomi kati jitu ngati bombi easekuliwi jandu. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Boo, ngasemmbona mipugu na mali gabu ibiya mali gito? Henu tujetanganinya naku ili atama pamu na twepani.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Akanalomi boti baabilibongini pu nndyangu wa musi we hogu bajetanganinya na Amoli na Shekemu mwana waki. Ndipala akanalomi boti batenda kusekuliwa jandu.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Lisoba la tatu mwenikatai, akanalomi baasekuliwi jandu koni babiya bakona nu ubini nkali, bana abeli baka Yakobu, Simoni na Lawi, alombu baka Dina, bajukua mipamba jabu, bugutukaliya musi sanga bandu ba musi hogu kuhobale na kwaakoma akanaloni boti. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Baakoma ku mipamba Amoli na Shekemu mwana waki, bumpia Dina mu nyumba jaka Shekemu, nukubokane. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Bana bangi baka Yakobu, baakelubukia bandu babaakomiki haba nukujuku hindu yoti yupu musi hogu, ndaba dada wabu jabiya jusapuliwi. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Bajukua makondoo ni imbui na ng'ombi ni maponda na sokapi sesabii kumusi au mu litui. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Bakamula mali goa, bana na akammbomba boti na sokapi sesabii mwamanyumba.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Ndienu Yakobu ampwagila Simoni na Lawi, “Mwanganya nnetii tabu sukunhenga anzukila bandu bu nndema gongo guku Kaanani na Apelizi. Nepani ngasemii na bandu bingi ana bilibongini nukunapu biingoma nepani pamu alongu bangu.” <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Aka kilongu abeli haba bajibua, “Boo, sapi lee kunndeka dada witu bunhenga ngati nselate?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu juhamii ku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Lisoba limu, Sapanga ampwagila Yakobu, “Tumbuliya sapwali gujenda ku Beseli, nukunzenge mesa ja malibu jukupiiki litambiku, nepani nenugupitila kipindi pauntila mmbeli waku Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Ndienu, Yakobu jaapwagila akalongu baki na boti pajabii naku, “Nndekala kutali isapanga ikigeni yemmbi naku, mwilisapisa nukung`anambu ingobu hinu. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Ndipala, twiijenda ku Beseli ili nukunsengila Sapanga mesa jukupiki litambiku, jojanyangatiya lisoba la mang`aliku, Sapanga jojubii nanepani pokapi panyenda.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Ndienu bumpekiya Yakobu imong`u`mong`u yoti ni isapanga ikigeni yebabii naku pamu na ndolosa yebabii aweti mu makutu, najombi jiiyelaliya pai ju mwaloni gowabii pamu na Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Yakobu na bana baki pababiya nsapwali, Sapanga jaapekiya kiholu benei ba misi yoti ya pambipi hata ngasebalengiki kwaapwatalila. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Ndienu Yakobu jajenda jahika ku Luzu yani Beseli mu musi uku Kanani, pamu na bandu boa bajabii naku. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Jasenga hapa mesa jukupiiki litambiku na kupakema Elibeseli ndaba hapa ndi pandu paka Sapanga paampitila kipindi pajabii antila mmbeli waki. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Debola jojabii anntunza Lebeka pajabii mwana jatenda kujomuka na antaga pai ji lilibu upandi ukumosu uku Beseli. Henu Yakobu jugukema musi wehogu Aloni Bakuti, mana jaki, “Nkongu gukulela.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Baada jaka Yakobu kukelabuka ku Padani alami, Sapanga ampitila kabee nu kumpenge. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Sapanga ampwagila, “Liina laku wa Yakobu, lakini ngabagukemi hela kabeti, ila henu liina laku libiya Izilaeli.” Henu Yakobu ankema Izilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Kabee Sapanga ampwagila, “Nepani ndi na Sapanga jwana makili. Gukapata ibeleku ingi kwaku wehapa kwipitila bandu bingi na gwibiya atati bilikundi la bandu bingi banndema hingi na akabambu akolongu. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Musi gonumpeki Ibulaimu ni Isaka, nagupekiya wehapa ni ibeleku yaku.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Ndienu, ejajomula kulonge na Yakobu, Sapanga andeka nukukwela kunani. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Yakobu jajemika mpengu wililibu pandu je pala pajalongila na Sapanga, jilibeka palongi jaka Sapanga sukulijakani litambiku la mahuta na divai. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Ndienu Yakobu japakema pandu je hapa pajalongila na Sapanga Beseli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Laeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Yakobu nu nndongu waki baendaliya na sapwali jabu kuhuma ku Beseli. Pababiya utali kidogu kabula jukuhika ku Epulati, Laeli lunkamula lipyanda lukubeleka. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Najombi pajabii mu lipyanda leheli, sing`anga ampwagila, “Wijogopa gupatiki mwana jongi mwanalomi.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Laeli koni jutenda kuwa ampekiya mwana we hoju liina Benoni. Lakini atati baki ampekiya liina laki Benjamini.<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Ndipala Laeli jakuwa nukuntaga mulutengu ji indela jejijenda ku Epulati sajenu kumanyikana kwi liina la Beteleemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobu jajemika mpengu gukukomboka panani ji litenge laka Laeli goguwe gubii mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Izilaeli jaendaliya na sapwali jaki nu kugone baada jukupeta mu nnala uku Edeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bana akanalomi baka Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Izilaeli pajabii jutama mmusi homu, mwana waki Lubeni jagonila na Biliha, awala wa atati baki, najombi Izilaeli jajoini lijambu le heli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobu jabii na bana komi na abeli akanalomi. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Bana baka Lea babii Lubeni, ndi mmbeleka ju utumbuli jwaka Yakobu na Simoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Zebuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Bana akanalomi baka Laeli babii Josepu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Bana akanalomi bababelakiki na Biliha ntumisi waka Laeli babii Dani na Naputali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Na bana akanalomi bababelakiki na Zilipa ntumisi waka Lea babii Gadi na Asheli. Haba ndi bana baka Yakobu akanalomi, bajabelika pajabii ku Padani alami.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakobu jaboka jajenda ku nndema uku Mamule kwa atati baka Isaka, ku Kiliati aluba yani Hebuloni pandu papuje Ibulahimu ni Isaka atamika ngati ageni. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaka jabii na yaka mia jimu na semanini, <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />henu, Isaka japomula mala ja mwisu na kuwa nu kujongana na aseja ajaki koni jubii na yaka hingi. Nabombi bana baki, Esau na Yakobu batenda kuntaga.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Ibeleku yaka Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Yenze ndi ibeleku yaka Esau liina lengi Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau jajukwi akambomba buku Kanan, anzukwii Ada kamwali waka Eloni Nhiti na Oholibama kamwali waka Hana nsoko waka Sibeoni ju likabila la Ahivi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />na Basemati kamwali waka Ishimaili nndombu waka Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada ammbelakiya Esau mwana ankema Elipazi najombi Basemati ammbelakiya Leueli. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibama ammbelakiya Yeushi na Yalami na Kola. Haba ndi bana akanalomi baka Esau babube akahanu baki bummbelakiya mu nndema uku Kanani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Ndienu, Esau jajukua akahanu baki, bana baki akanalomi na akammbomba na bandu boti bu nnyumba jaki na ng`ombi yaki ni inyama yaki yengi yoti na mali gaki goti gaguge jabiya jupatiki mu nndema uku Kanani, jahamila pandu pangi, kutali nu nndongu waki Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Jahenga hela ndaba mali gabu gakabii gingi nukusindwa kutamani pamu. Musi gobatami ngati ageni we hogu ngasewawesa kwaatosa ndaba ji mipugu jabu kuba jingi. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Henu Esau jajenda kutama ku nndema gwiitombi yuku Seili. Liina lengi laka Esau labiya ndi Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Yenze ndi ibeleku yaka Esau, atati ba Aedomu babatama mu nndema ji itombi ya Seili. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Bana baka Esau akanalomi babii Elipazi jojabelakika na Ada nhwanamundu, Leueli jabelakika na Besemati nhwanamundu jongi. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Bana akanalomi baka Eliapazi babii Temani na Omali na Sepo na Gatamu na Keazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Eliapazi mwana waka Esau jabii na awala liina laki Timuna. Hoju ammbelakiya mwana liina laki Amaleki. Haba ndi asoko baka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Basemati nhwanu waka Esau, ammbelika Leueli. Bana akanalomi baka Leueli babiya Nahati na Zela na Shama na Miza.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Oholibama na kamwali Ana nsokoo wa Sibeoni ammbelakiya Esau bana akanalomi atatu, Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola. <verse eid="GEN 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Bamba ndi akolongu ba makabila gagahumi kwaka Esau. Eliapazi jojabii kibeleku su kutumbuli saka Esau jwabia Temani na Omali na Sepo na Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kola na Gatamu na Amaleki, kila jumu wabu jwakabii nkolongu ulikabila laki. Haba boti ndi bana akanalomi baka Elipazi mu nndema uku Edomu, haba bibiya asokoo baka Ada nhwanu waka Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Leueli mwana waka Esau, jaabelika Nahati na Zela na Shama na Miza, kila jumu wabu jabiya nkolongu ji likabila laki. Haba boti ndi bana akanalomi baka Leueli mu musi uku Edomu haba ndi babiya ansokoo waka Basemati nhwanu waka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Bana akanalomi baka Oholibama nhwanu waka Esau babii Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola, kila jumu wabu jwakabii nkolongu ju likabila laki. Haba ndi bana akanalomi baka Oholibama, kamwali waka Ana, nhwanu waka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Ndienu haba ndi ibeleku yaka Esau yani Edomu, kila jumu wabu jabii nkolongu ulikabila laki.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibeleku yaka Seili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Yenze ndi ibeleku yaka Seili juku kabila la Aholi na ndi benei ba musi we hogu Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishoni na Eseli na Dishana, kila jumu wabu jabii nkolongu ulikabila laki kati ja Aholi bi kibeleku saka Seili mu nndema uku Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Bana akanalomi baka Lotani bakabii Holi na Hemani nu nndombu waki Lotani ankemika Timina.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Bana akanalomi baka Shobali bakabii Aluvani na Manahati na Ebali na shepo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Bana akanalomi buku Sibeoni bakabii Aya na Ana ndi jojabona kutimbilikana kwa masi ga mwotu ku lukoba, pajabiya julima maponda ga atati baki Sibeoni. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Bana baka Ana babii Dishoni na nndombu waki jumu jobunkema Oholibama. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Bana akanalomi baka Dishoni babii Hemudani na Eshibani na Italani na Kelani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Bana akanalomi baka Eseli babii Bilihani Zaawani na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Bana akanalomi baka Dishani babii Usi na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Haba ndi akolongu ba Aholi, Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani, kila jumu wabu jabii nkolongu ulikabila laki mu musi uku Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akabambu akolongu buku nndema uku Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Bamba ndi akabambu akolongu baalongosa musi uku Edomu, kabula nkolongu jokapi kwaalongosa Aizilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela mwana waka Beoli jalongusa musi uku Edomu pajabii jutama mu musi uku Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela ejajomuka, Yobabu mwana waka Zela kuhuma ku Bosila jakuba bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu pajakuwa, Hushamu jwa musi uku Atemani, jabiya bambu nkolongu badala jaki. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushamu pajakuwa Hadadi mwana waka Bedadi jabiya bambu nkolongu na musiwaki wabiya ku Aviti. Hoju ndi jojalapula na kwaawesa Amidiani mu nndema uku Moabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi pajakuwa, Samula jojuhumi ku Masileka, jabia bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samula pajakuwa, Shauli kuhuma musi uku Leoboti, gogubii pambipi na losi luku Eupulati, jabiya bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Shauli pajakuwa, Baali hanani, mwana waka Akiboli jabiya bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Baali hanani mwana waka Akiboli pajakuwa Hadadi jabiya bambu nkolongu, liina la musi waki labiya Pau. Nhwanamundu Akiboli jabiya Mehetabeli na kamwali waka Matiledi nu nsokoo waka Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Akolongu ba makabila gagahumiki kwaka Esau, kulengana na pandu pabu pukutama bakabii Timuna na Aluva na Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibama na Ela na Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenazi na Temani na Mibisali, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magidieli na Ilamu. Haba ndi akolongu ba makabila gagahumi ku Edomu yani Esau na Atati ba Aedomu, baalogwi kulengana na mahengu gabu mu pandu pi milema jealongusa.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Josepu naka akaabeli baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobu jaendaliya kutama ku nndema wa Kanani, moatamika atati baki ngati ageni. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Haga ndi majambu gaka Yakobu. Josepu pajabii nkombu jwa yaka komi na saba, jombi na akaabeli baki bababii bana baka Biliha na Zilipa akaawala ba atati baki babiya alima makondoo ni imbui.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Josepu jabiya jaamanyisa atati baki kupete tabia jiliya jaka alongu mundu.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Izilaeli ampai ngamaa Josepu kuliku bana baki boti kwa ndaba jabiya jubelekiki kipindi su useja waki. Ansonila Josepu kanzu nasu jebijilembiki ngani. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Lakini akaabeli baki pababona atati babu ampai Josepu kuliku bombi, bunsuki ngamaa ata kulonge naku ku lukwali kwatenda kusindikana.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndotu yaka Josepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Ikilu jimu, Josepu jalota ndotu, lakini pajaasimuliya akaabeli baki, bombi ndi bajonzukiya kunsuki. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Jaapwagila, “Nzooninya ndotu jenotiki. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Notika ana twaboa, twabii mu litui tukongika makenda gi inganu na apalapa likenda li inganu langu libopuka nukujema wema. Makenda ginu gabonganika nukuyongolota nukulijinamii likenda li inganu la nepani.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Akaabeli baki bunndalukiya, “Boo, gupala kutupwagi wiitenda kutulongosa? Boo, wiibiya nu uwesu kupete twepane?” Ndienu baendaliya kunsuki nakanopi, ndaba ja ndotu na malobi gaki.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Ndipala Josepu jalota kabee ndotu jengi, jasimuliya kabee akaabeli baki, kupwaaga, “Nzoaninya notiki kabee ndotu jengi, nilibweni lyoba, mwei na ndondu komi na jimu itenda kunyinamii.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Lakini pajaasimuliya ahengo naka kaka baki ndotu jeheji, atati baki batenda kunndakali kupwaaga, “Boo, jenieji je ndi ndotu bole jegulotiki jene? Boo, kwatupalika nepani amabu baku naka alongu baku kuhika kugujinamii kwi isima palongi jako?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Akalongu baki bumbonila wipu, lakini atati baki babiya aholale lijambu leheli.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josepu atenda kunndombesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Lisoba limu, alongu baka Josepu bajenda kulima inyama ya atati babu pambipi nu kumusi uku Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Ndienu, Izilaeli ampwagila Josepu, “Gumanyiki alongu baku alima inyama ku Shekemu. Henu mbala nugutuma kwabu.” Josepu jajibua, “Hena nndumaje.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Atati baki ampwagila, “Jenda wakalinga akalongu baku ni inyama ngati abii sapi, ndi wiika kumbwagi.” Ndienu Yakobu antuma Josepu kuhuma ku libonde luku Hebuloni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Josepu pajahegaliya ku Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />mundu jumu anketaninya jakajendajenda kukioli, anndalukiya, “Gutaputa kyane?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Josepu jajibua, “Naataputa akaabeli bango. Gupepa koku gumbwagila pandu paalima inyama.”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Mundu jola ampwagila, “Niwasalii bibiya abokani, ndaba najoana bakapwaganinya ajenda ku Dotani.” Ndienu Josepu jaapwata akaabeli baki jaakolila ku Dotani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Akaabeli baki pabummbona jubii sukutali na kabula ngasejuhegali bapwaganiya ankoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Bapwaganinya, “Linga! Jojulotalota ndotu jojuhuma ako. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Henu, tunkoma nukundeke mulibomba limu kati ja mabomba haga. Mwenikatai twiipwaga jutei kukomeka nu kulewa ni inyama ikali imwikioli. Henu twaibona ndotu yake ye ibiya boo.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Lakini Lubeni pajajoa malobi haga, japala kunhoko mwamaboku gabu, henu jaapwagila akalongu baki, “Mpepakoku, twaankoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Mwaankoma ila munzegala mu libomba lela pulukoba, lakini mwanhumisa.” Japwaaga hela ndaba juwesa kunhoko Josepu mu maboku gabu, na mwenikatai ankelubua kwa atati baki. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Josepu pajahikila akalongu mundu bombi bunhula kanzu jaki jejabalembiki sapi. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Ndipala bunkamula nukundeke mu libomba langa na masi.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Pabatamaniya kula posu likundi la Aisimaili ahuma ku Gileadi kujenda ku Misili latenda kupeta. Ngamia wabu babiya atotwi ubani, mitela juntomoni jebijikema zeli na manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Hapa Yuda jaapwagila alongu baki, “Twiipata kii anatunkomiki nndongu witu nukunhiya jojukomiki? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Nambanga tunndombesi kwa bandu baka Ishimaili, lakini twiigusa womi waki, ndaba jombi ndi nndongu witu, jombi mwai gumu natwenga.” Alongu baki bajetanganinya naku. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Baalombesa nu kulomba buku Midiani pabahika pandu je hapa, akalongumundu hapa bumpia Josepu mu libomba, nukunndombesa kwa Aisimaili kwi ipandi isilini ga feza, nabombi bunzukua Josepu mbaka ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Ndienu, Lubeni pajakelubukia mu libomba mola, ngakummbona kabee Josepu jajendula ingobu yaki su ubini, <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />jaajendila alongu baki, jaapwagila, “Nkombu ngasejubii na nepani kabete, boo, ngiti henga kike?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ndienu, basinza imbui, bajukua kanzu jaka Josepu nukutobake mu mwai wi imbui gola. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Ndipala baapelakiya atati babu kanzu je jela, baapwagila, “Tujitondwi kanzu jenze. Mwijilingalakia ana jaka mwana winu au boo.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Atati babu bijimanyiki kanzu, bapwaaga, “Sakaka! Neholale kinyama si mwikioli ankamwi nu kunkula. Sakaka Josepu ansekulini ipandi ipandi.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Ndienu, Yakobu jajendula ingobu yaki ku usungu, jawata ligunii mwikibunu. Nukundelee mwana waki kwa masoba gingi. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Bana baki boti bahika ili kungangamalisa mwoju, lakini jakana kungangamalisa japwaaga, “Nekaje nhendale kundele mwana wangu, mbaka panihuluka pai pajubii koatama bandu baawi.” Ndipala atati baki ebundelila.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Kipindi sehesi ku Misili kola, Amidiani bala bunndombisa Josepu kwaka mundu joankema Potipa, jumu jwaka ntumisi nkolongu mu ulongosi waka Palau, jojuwe jakabii nkolongu jikikosi su ulonda mu nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Kipindi sehesi, Yuda jatama kutali na alongu baki, jajenda kutama na mundu jumu Mwadulami liina laki Hila. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Pajabii hoku, Yuda ammbona kamwali joankema Shua Mkanani jatenda kunzukuu kuba nhwanuwaki. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Kamwali Shua japata kitumbu jabelika mwana mwanalomi, Yuda ankema Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Japata kabee kitumbu sengi, jabelika mwana mwanalomi, ankema Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Ndipala japata kitumbu sengi japata mwana mwanalomi, ankema Shela. Kipindi Shela pajabelikika, Yuda jabiya ku Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Mwenikatai Yuda anzukua mwana waki ju utumbulii oti Eili, ku mmbomba jobunkema Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Lakini Eili jojutumbuli kubelakeka kwaka Yuda, jabiya mbaja palongi ja Bambu Sapanga henu Bambu Sapanga jatenda kunkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Ndienu, Yuda ampwagila Onani, “Nnzukua nhwanu ukunndongu waku jojuwii, ndi ekupalika kuhenga ili kuwesa kumbelake nndongu waku bana.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Lakini Onani jamanyiki ana bana be haba ngabakabii bake. Henu, pajagonila nu nhwanu ukunndongu waki, japikia pai imbeju yu kubeleka jihika kumpeke nndongu waki mwana. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Lihengu leheli lunhumisa Bambu Sapanga, ankoma Onani kabeti. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Ndienu Yuda ampwagila Tamali, nhwanu waka mwana waki, “Kelubuka kunyumba kwa atati baku, wakahigali gummbomba joawii alomi mbaka mwanawa Shela ejikola.” Yuda jahola najombi Shela jiikakuuwa ngati alongu baki. Ndienu, Tamali jabuja kunyumba ja atati baki.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Ndienu kamwali Shua nhwanu waka Yuda, jatenda kuwa. Yuda pajajomula kujanu matanga jaboka nu nkosi waki Hila Mwadulami, bajenda ku Timuna kwa baaseku mangoma ga makondoo. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Tamali pajajoa kubanga atati baki na akowanu baki abii mwiindela kujenda ku Timuna kuseku mangoma ga makondoo gaki, <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />jahula ingobu yaki yu kuwelee alomi nu kuliyeka shela ndipala nukutama pu nndyangu ukujingalii ku Enaimu, kijiji sesabii mwiindela kujenda ku Timuna. Jahenga hela ndaba jabona Shela jubii mwanahota, lakini jombi Tamali ngasebunzetakiya kunzukuu Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Ndienu, Yuda eankolila Tamali papuje, anholaliya ndi mmbomba nselati, ndaba jabiya jiliyekali pamihu. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Papuje bila kumanya ana kumbi jwabii nhwanu uka mwanamundu, anzendila puunkegi ji indela, ampwagila, “Mbai kugone nawehapa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Tamali anndalukiya, “Wiimbekiya kyane ananugujetakali?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yuda jajibua, “Nagupekiya katoli ki imbui kuhuma mu likundi lango.” Tamali ampwagila, “Beka poni kuhingamaki wiinetila imbui heji.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yuda anndalukiya, “Gupala nugupekiya kii ngati pone?” Najombi jajibua, “Mbekiya peti jejibii na nembu heji nu lugoji lwaki pamu na ndonga jegukamwi.” Ndienu, Yuda ampekiya hindu yoti yejipala, nukugone naku. Tamali japata kitumbu saki. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Ndienu Tamali jabuja kunyumba jahula shela jela jejiyekiki nukuwata kabee ingobu yaki yukundelele nndomi.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Kipindi paantuma nkosimundu jola, Mwadulami ampelakiya mmbomba jola katoli ili ankelabukiya hindu ya poni yeandeki, Hila ngaseampataje. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Hila jaalalukiya benei buku Enaimu, “Jubii kwaa mmbomba nselati jola jojabii pambipi ni indela jenzeno?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">“Pani ngasejuwaiki kuba mmbomba nselati.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Ndienu nkosi waki hoju jakelabuka kabee kwaka Yuda, “Ngasenumpatiki, kabee akambomba ba konioku ambwagi ngaseawaiki kummbona mmbomba nselati jokapi hoku.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda jaapwaaga, “Nndeka jujukua hindu heye, ananga hela jatuhenga atulonga. Wehapa wamweti gubweni numpelakiya litoli. Lakini wehapa ngaseumpatiki.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Ejapeta miei mitatu, Yuda bumpwagila, “Tamali nhwanu waka mwanamundu jubii nselati kabee jupatiki kitumbu kukuhenga uselati.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Ndienu, Yuda andagalakiya, “Mumpia kunza bunzosa mwotu.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Pababia bumpia kunza, Tamali antuma ntenga kwa akoanu baki kwaapwagi, “Jojubii na hindu yenze ndi jojumbeki kitumbu. Henu nuguloba gumanya jwana peti jenze nu lugoji lwaki londo na ndonga jenze.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda jiimanyiki hindu ye heyi, japwaaga, “Tamali ndi jwaamboni kuliku nepani. Sakaka ndaba ngasenuntoi kwaka mwana wangu Shela.” Tumbuka lisoba leheli Yuda ngasejagonila kabee na Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Kipindi sukubeleka Tamali pawahikila kwamanyikana jabii ni kitumbuu sa mapaa. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Ndienu pajapata ubini ukubeleka mwana jumu japiiki kuboku kunza, najombi nkunga ankonga kwa usi nkeli, nukupwaaga, “Hajo ndi jojusaliwi ju kutumbuli.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Lakini mwana hoju pajakelubua kuboku kwaki nkati nndongu waki jasaliwa ju utumbuli. Jojulamisa jola jaapwaaga, “Mbona wehapa gupetiki kwa makile?” Henu ankema Pelesi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Mwenikatai jasaliwa nndongu waki jola na usi nkeli mu kuboku najombi ankema Zela.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Nhwanu waka Potipa na Josepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Ndienu, Josepu ebunzukua mbaka ku Misili, mundu jumu juku Misili jobunkema Potipa jojuwe jabii ntumisi waka Falau nu nkolongu jwi likundi lu ulonda, andomba Josepu kuhuma kwa Aisimaili babundeta ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Bambu Sapanga jabii pamu na Josepu, anhwesisi mu kila sindu sejwahenga. Josepu jabiya juhenga lihengu mu nyumba jaka bambu waki hoju Mmisili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Bambu waki we hoju jamanyiki kubanga Bambu Sapanga jabii pamu na Josepu, na ndi anzangatiya mu majambu goti Josepu. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Ndienu, Josepu jwapaliki ngamaa palongi jaka Potipa, jabiya ndi ntumisi waki, anhenga jujemaliya nyumba jaki na juangaliya mali gaki goti. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Tumbuka kipindi Potipa paanhenga Josepu kuba jojujemale nyumba jaki na jojuangalii mali gaki, Bambu Sapanga jijipengaliya nyumba jaka mundu we hoju ndaba jaka Josepu. Mbenge yaka Bambu Sapanga yabiya panani ja kila sejabii naku, munyumba na ku matui. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Kwa ndaba heji Potipa ampekiya Josepu ulongosi panani ja majambu gaki goa, najombi Potipa jakotuka kuhenga sokapi ila pee posu jaki mweni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Josepu jabii nkombu jojubii na nhyega jejibi na makili na jojunyambiki. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Ndienu egapeta masoba masokopi, nhwanu waka Potipa antokuliya Josepu nukumpwagi, “Gonila na nenga.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Lakini Josepu jakana nukumpwagi mmbomba hoju, “Nganhwese hata kulenga! Bambu wangu jumekiki kuba panani ja kila sindu pani panyumba na kwa ndaba nepani mii pamba ngasejuhenga sindu sokapi kabete. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Pani panyumba jombi ngasejubii nu ulongosi kuliku nepani. Jombi ngasejunganiki kukamu sindu sokapi ila wehapa pena kwa ndaba wehapa gu nhanu waki. Nnhwesa boo, kuhenga kihakau kikolongu ngati hese nukunkose Sapanga.” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Mmbomba hoju jaendaliya kunkolo kila lisoba, lakini Josepu ngasejajoani wala kujetake kuba pambipi naku.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Lisoba limu, Josepu jajingala mu nyumba kuhenga lihengu laki ngati ejayobali, na baahenga lihengu ajaki ngasebabii panyumba. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Ndienu, nhwanu waka Potipa jakamula ingobu jaka Josepu nukumpwagi, “Gonila na nepani.” Lakini Josepu anndekila kikwinda saki mumaboku gaki, nukutili kunza. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Hapa mmbomba jola ejabona Josepu jililei lingobu laki mu maboku gaki nukutili kunza, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />jaakema atumisi bu nyumba jaki na kwaapwagi, “Nndinga! Mundu juku Ebulania jobutuleti jutupeke iyoni kwitu twepani twaboti. Jahika kwangu nukupala kungamu kwa makili, lakini ndendika kujamali. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Ejajoana ndenda kujamali jikilekika kikwinda saki, nukutili kunza.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Ndienu, mmbomba jola jikibeka kikwinda sela mbaka nndomi waki ejakelubuka kunyumba. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Ansimuliya sindu sela kukupwaga, “Ntumisi juku Ebulania hoju jogunndetiki kwitu junhikila ili jumboa lihamu. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Lakini enyamaliya pe kulela ili bandu anyangatia, jikileka kikwinda sakiaki nukutili kunza.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Ndienu, bambu waka Josepu jagajoanakiya malobi gu nhwanu waki, japata inyela, <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />anzukua Josepu nu kunzege mu ligelesa, pandu pabaakongiki bandu bahalabini baka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Lakini hata mu ligelesa Bambu Sapanga jabiya pamu na Josepu antunza nu kunhenga jupalika na akaakolongu bi ligelesa. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Henu nkolongu ju ligelesa ammbeka Josepu jubiya nkolongu jwa apugwa boti mu ligelesa mola, kila sindu sesahengika homu sahengika ku ulongosi waki. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Nkolongu ju ligelesa jola ngasejahenga kabee sindu sokapi seankabisi Josepu kwa ndaba Bambu Sapanga jwabii pamu na Josepu nukunhwesesa kila sindu sejuhengika.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Josepu jutapusili ndotu yaapungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Masoba masokopi egapeta majambu haga, akaatumisi abeli baka bambu nkolongu juku Misili bunkosii bambu nkolongu. Akaatumisi behaba babii jojutunza inywaji nkolongu na jojujosa mabumunda nkolongu jwa akabambu nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Falau jayomila aka atumisi baki abeli, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />jaapungila nkati ja ngomi juku nkolongu jwikikikosi su ulonda, mu ligelesa pandu paangongiki Josepu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Nkolongu jwi kikosi su ulonda anhagula Josepu jaatumakiya. Nabombi babiya mu kipungu kwa masoba gingi.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Ndienu, Ikilu jimu jojutunza inywaji nkolongu jola jojujosa mabumunda nkolongu jaka bambu akolongu juku Misili, balota ndotu mu ligelesa mola, kila ndotu jabii na mana jaki. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Josepu pajajenda pulukela kwaabona, boa abeli babiya baabii ni usungu. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Ndienu Josepu jalalukiya akaatumisi baka bambu nkolongu juku Misili Falau baabii mu kipungu pamu najombi nnyumba jaka bambu waki, “Mbona lelenu mbii nu usungu ngamaa?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Bunzibua, “Tubii nu usungu ndaba tulotiki ndotu lakini piligelesa pani ngasejubii jojuwesa kutapusili ndotu itu.” Josepu jaapwaagila, “Boo, kutapusili ndotu le nga lihengu laka Sapanga? Nala, mbwagila ndotu inu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Jojutunza inywaji ansimuliya Josepu ndotu jaki, kupwaaga, “Mundotu jangu nugubona mzabibu palongi jangu, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />nagwombii wakabii ma mambandi matatu. Papapa pe etumbuli kutundulii manyoi, maua gaki gatenda kubondule na ndongutongu yaki yabiya Zabibu yeibewiki. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Mumaboku gangu nakabii ni kikombi saka Falau, ndienu najukua zabibu, minyika mwikikombi sehesi nukumpeke Falau.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Josepu ampwagila ntumisi jola, “Tapusili ja ndotu jaku ndi jenze, mambandi matatu haga ndi masoba matatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Egipeta masoba matatu Falau jagujua nu kugukelabuu kabee mu seu saku. Wiwesa kabee kumpeke Falau kikombi mu kuboku ngati eguhengika pamwandi pala. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Lakini wiinyegwa majambu gaku egibiya gajenda sapi, wihengila uamboni nukunogo palongi jaka Falau, ili nhwesa kupita mu ligelesa moni. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Ndaba nepani bandilisa kuhuma mu nndema uku Ebulania na pani pa Misili ngasendei sindu sokapi sekipalika kunyege mu ligelesa.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Jojujosa mabumunda jola ejabona jutapusili sapi, ampwagila Josepu, “Hata nepani nalotiki ndotu! Mu ndotu jangu natotwi itonga itatu ya mabumunda ga sapi. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mu kitonga sa panani, kwabii na yakula ndalindali yeajosiki kwa ndaba jaka Falau. Lakini ijuni yabiya ikula kuhuma mu kitonga se sela pamutu jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Josepu ampwagila, “Tapusili ja ndotu jaku ndi jenze. Itonga itatu yela ndi masoba matatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Egapeta masoba matatu, Falau jagujukua kuhuma mu ligelesa jiisekula mmutu waku nu kuntonga mu mpengu, nayombi ijuni ikula yega jaku.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Elahika lisoba la tatu lelule jabiya lisoba lukusaliwa kwaki, Falau jaandaliya tipati atumisi baki boa. Jaapia mu ligelesa jojutunza inywaji nkolonguna jojujosa mabumunda nkolongu, jaabeka palongi jaka atumisi baki. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Ndipala ankelabukiya seu saki jojutunza inywaji nkolongu, ili ampekiya Falau kikombi kabee. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Lakini jojujosa mabumbunda nkolongu jola antonga mu mpengu, ngati Josepu ejabiya jwaatapusili ndotu yabu. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Lakini jojutunza inywaji nkolongu jola ngaseankombwiki Josepu.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Josepu jutapusili ndotu yaka Falau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Eyapeta yaka ibeli, Falau jalota ndotu. Jilikolila jujemiki mulutengu ja losi lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />jiibona ng`ombi saba yeinyambiki na yeikendiki ihuma kulosi kula manyai. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Kabee baada jikibona hei jiibona yengi kabee saba yeikombii nakanopi ihuma ku losi luku Naili, yahika nukujema pambipi na ng`ombi yeinyambiki yela pulutengu ja losi. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ng`ombi yeikombi nakanopi yela yaakula ng`ombi yengi saba yeinyambiki nu kukenda yela. Hapa Falau jajumuka mulugonu. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Pajagonila kabee jalota mala ja pili. Jagabona mapongoo saba makolongu na gaganyambiki gatundulii mu lipei limu. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Kabee egapeta haga, mapongoo saba gangi gagakombi na gagajomiki nu nhwai nkali gogubii na lyotu upulukoba gatenda kupiti. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Mapongoo gagakombi saba gala gagamila mapongoo saba gaganyambiki na makolongu gala gagatweli ilebi. Ndienu, Falau pajajumuka ndi jamanya jabiya nndotu. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Ekwahika pulukela, Falau moju waki waangajiki ngamaa, jaakema ahabi boti buku Misili na bana malangu, jaapwagila ndotu yaki, lakini nga hata jumu jojawesa kuntapusili ndotu yeheyi.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Ndipala, jojutunza inywaji jola ampwagila Falau, “Lelenu ngomboka makosa gangu. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Kipindi sewabiya gutei kutuyome twaatumisi baku twepani, nepani na jojujosa mabumunda nkolongu, utupungii mu ngomi ngolongu jikikundi su ulonda. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Ikilu jimu twalota ndotu, kila jumu ndotu jaki ndalindali n maana jqaki. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Ndienu nkombu jumu juku Ebulania ntumisi nkolongu jwiki kikundi su ulonda, jabii pamu na twepani mu ligelesa. Etunsimuliya ndotu itu, jombi jawesa kutapusili kila mundu kulengana na ndotu jaki. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Ejatapusilia ndi ekwapitila, nepani nakelubukiya mu lihengu langu na jojujosa mabumunda nkolongu buntondika mu mpengu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Ndienu, Falau jalagalakiya ankema Josepu, najombi ampia mu ligelesa nyata. Ejabiya jujomwili kumoga nu kung`anambu ingobu yaki, Josepu jahika palongi jaka Falau. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Falau ampwagila Josepu, “Nepani notiki ndotu, lakini nga mundu jojuwesiki kundapusilia. Nyoini ulumbi waku anabugupwagi ndotu guwesa kundapusilia.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Josepu anzibua Falau, “Ngasemii nu uwesu hogo lakini Sapanga ngiti jugupekiya lijibu lelipalika.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Hapa Falau ampwagila Josepu, “Nalota ana, najemiki pulutengu ja Losi luku Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />niibona ng`ombi saba yeinyambiki na yeikendiki ihuma kula manyoi nndosi. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Hei yapwatwa na ng`ombi yengi saba yeikombi kwa namuna jejeje mu musi uku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Ndienu, ng`ombi yeikombi ngani yela yiikula ng`ombi saba yeikendiki yeyatumbuli kupiti. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Lakini hata eyabiya yaakuliki yeikendiki, mundu jokapi nga kuwesa kumanya iikuliki ijaki, ndaba yabiya yakona eyakombale ngati pa mwandi. Hapa najumuka mu lugonu. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Kabee nalota ndotu jengi, nagabona mapongoo saba gaganyambiki gagatweli ilebi mu lipei limu. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Kabee gakagula na mapongoo gangi saba matopu, gagakombii na gagajomiswi nu nhwai nkali uku lukoba. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Mapongoo gagakombi saba gala gagamila mapongoo saba gagnyambiki. Ndienu, nepani naapwagi ahabi boti ndotu ye hei lakini nga mundu jojuwesiki kundapusilila.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Ndipala Josepu ampwagila Falau, “Ndotu yaku yoti tapusili jaki je jimu. Sapanga juguyekuli majambu gajihenga pambipi. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ng`ombi saba yeinyambiki yela ndi ipindi ya yaka saba, na mapongoo saba gala ndi kabee yaka saba, ndotu je heji tapusili jaki ndi jimu. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Ng`ombi saba yeikombi ngamaa, yeyuye biipwata yeikendiki yela, na mapongoo saba gagakombi ngani na matopu gala na gagajomisi nu nhwai nkali uku lukoba, mana jaki je ndi yaka saba iling`ai li inzala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Ngati enugulandi mwa Falau, Sapanga juguyekuli majambu gajihenga kipindi sa pambipi. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Kwibiya na yaka saba yu kuusa ilebi ingi mu nndema gwoti guku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Lakini mwenikatai kwibiya kabee na yaka saba ili ling`ai li inzala, hata hela kutupi kola kwitenda kujeweka ngani. Ling`ai li inzala jeheji jikoma nndema goni. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Kutupi je hoku kwiitenda kujweka ngani kwa ndaba inzala jejipwata jiibiya ingali nakanopi. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Ndotu yaku yakelabukiya mala pabeli kwa malenganu gagalengana kugulangi ana Sapanga jutei kuamuu, najombi jwihenga lijambu heli masoba ga pambipi.”<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Henu kupalika mwaa Falau gunhagula mundu jojubii nu umanyi na malangu, gumpekiya lihengu lukulingalii nndema gwoti guku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Kabee, mwaa Falau, wahagula babijemaliya asokopi pani punndema, waalagalakiya akusanya pandu pu nhwanu pi ilebi yoti yuku Misili mu masoba ga yaka saba gukutupi. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Walagalakiya bajemale behaba akusanya posu ja yaka saba yeihika kwi ilebi hingi. Ilebi heyi nu kubekwa pai ju ulongosi waku, mwaa Falau, jibiya akiba ja posu kwa misi yoti, nabombi baitunza ilebi ye heyi. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Posu jeheji jibiya jaangatii Amisili pa liika ling'ai li inzala ja yaka saba jejihika ili bandu bupunndema biikomeka ni inzala.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josepu jupata seu ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Lijambu lende lejapia Josepu labonikana kuba laamboni palongi jaka Falau na atumisi baki boa. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Henu Falau jaalalukiya atumisi baki, “Mundu hajo jubii na mbomu jaka Sapanga. Boo, tuwesa lee kumpata jongi ngati ajojo?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Ndipala ampwagila Josepu, “Kwa ndaba Sapanga juguyekulii haga goti, nga mundu jongi jwana malangu na umanyi ngati wehapa. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Wehapa ndi wewijemaliya wa nyumba jangu na bandu bangu boti bibiya pai ja amuli jaku. Nepani pena ndi nu nkolongu kupeta wehapa kwa ndaba nepani bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Ndienu, sajenu nuguhagu kuba gunkolongu jwa nndema woti uku Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Ndipala Falau jahula peti jaki jejibii na nembu pu lukonzi lwaki nukunhwatika Josepu, anhwatika ni ingobu yaki yeibii sapi nu ukupu wa zahabu nhingu. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Falau ankweika mu ligali laki la pili leliutwa na palasi na alonda balonguliya palongi jaka Josepu bajamaliya nukupwaaga, “Mpega magoti!” Hela ndi Falau eampeki Josepu ulongosi nkolongu musi woti uku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Egapeta haga, Falau ampwagila Josepu, “Nepani na Falau! Mbwaga ana, mundu jokapi mu musi gwoti guku Misili jiitondabe kuboku wala kugolu kwaki sanga kujetake wehapa.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Falau ampekiya Josepu liina liki Misili, Sapenati Panea. Antoguliya Asenati kamwali waka Potipela, nngolu jwa musi uku Oni. Ndienu Josepu jatumbuliya kugutembale musi woti uku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Josepu jabii na yaka selasini pajatumbuliya kuntumaki Falau, bambu nkolongu juku Misili. Jahuma kunyumba jaka Falau nukugutembale musi woti uku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Kwabiya mu yaka saba yukutupi yela, matui guku Misili gapia ilei ngayeyo. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Josepu jakusanya posu yoti kipindi sa yaka saba yukutupi nu kuibeka akiba mu musi uku Misili. Kila musi jabeka akiba ja posu kuhuma mwa matui gabu gagabii pambipi na musi we hogu. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Josepu jabeka akiba ji ilebi hingi ngani yabiya ngati nsangi gu munhanga nkolongu, wanga kupemeka.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Kabula ja yaka saba ji inzala, Josepu jabiya jupatiki bana abeli kukunhwana mundu Asenati, kamwali waka Potipela, nngolu jwa musi uku Oni. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Josepu ankema mwana waki ju utumbulii Manasi, japwaaga, “Sapanga junhengiki nyewaa mang`aliku gangu goti na akalongu bangu ba atati bango.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Mwana waki jwa pili ankema Epulaimu jaapwaaga, “Sapanga jumbeki bana mu nndema wa mang`aliku gangu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Yaka saba yela nndema uku Misili yaka kupeta. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Yatumbuliya yaka saba yi inzala yela ngati ejabiya jupwagiki Josepu pamwandi. Misi yengi yoti yabiya ni inzala, lakini musi gwoti uku Misili wabii na posu. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Kipindi bandu buku Misili pabatumbuliya kujibona inzala, bundelila Falau jaapekiya posu. Najombi Falau jaapwagila Amisili boa, “Nnzendaninya kwaka Josepu, lejukumpwagila mwakahenga.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Inzala jajonzukika kuba ingali pandu poti nukuene nndema uku Misili woti. Henu Josepu jahogula ikoku yoti kila pandu, kwaalombase Amisili boti posu. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Egapeta haga, bandu boti bupunndema kila pandu bahika ku Misili kwaka Josepu kulomba posu, ndaba inzala jabii ingali nndema gwoti.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Aabeli baka Josepu ajenda ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Yakobu pajajowana ku Misili kibii kilebi, jaapwagila bana baki, “Boo, mbona ntamani koni nndingalanii pena?” <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Nyoini ku Misili ibii ilebi. Nnzendaninya mwakalomba ilebi ili twiikuwa ni inzala.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Henu akaabeli baki komi baka Josepu bajendaninya ku Misili kulomba ilebi. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Lakini Yakobu ngaseandekakiya Benjamini, nndongu waka Josepu jujenda pamu nabombi ndaba jajogupa juwesa kupata ling`ai.<verse eid="GEN 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Ndienu bana baka Yakobu bahika ku Misili babiya kati ja bandu babahika kulomba, ndaba hata nndema uku Kanani wabii ni inzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Kipindi se hesi Josepu jabii nkolongu juku Misili. Jombi ndi jojuhusika kwaalombase bandu ilebi. Ndienu akaabeli baki bahika nukunzinamii Josepu kwi isima. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Josepu ejaabona akaabeli baki jaamanyiki, lakini jilihenga ngati ngasejaamanyiki, jalongila naku ku ukali. Jaalalukiya, “Nhumi kwako?” Bunzibua, “Tuhumii ku nndema uku Kanani tuhikiki kulomba posu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Lakini Josepu jaamanyiki abeli baki ila bombi ngaseamanyiki. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Jakombuka ndotu yaki ya mwandi kupete akaabeli baki, jaapwaagila, “Mwanganya mwaapelelesi. Nhikiki kutupelelesa ili mmanya ana ngasetubii na makili.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Bombi bunzibua, “Ngahela, bambu witu. Twepani twaatumisi baku twiihikiki kulomba posu. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Twepani twakakilongo, bana ba atati bamu. Twepani twabandu totuhobaleka nga twaapelelese.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Lakini Josepu jahingamakiya, “Ngahela! Nhikiki pamba kutupelelesa ili mmanya ana ngasetubii na makili.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Bumpwagila, “Twepani twaatumisi bako, tubii twaakilongu komi na abeli, bana baka mundu jumu twabenei buku nndema uku Kanani. Nnuna witu juhigali na atati kunyumba na nndongu witu jongi we jawiile.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Lakini Josepu jaapwagila, “Ngati ebwagiki mwanganya mwa apelelesi pena.” <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Hela ndi emwilengika. Napa kwi liina laka Falau, ngammboki pamba mbaka nnuna winu pajiihika. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Muntuma jumu winu akunndeta nndongu wii nsoku hoju, kipindi bangi binu bundendale mwiligelesa. Hapa ndi malobi ginu pagimanyikana usakaka waki. Ana ngahela napa kuliina laka Falau ana mwanganya ndi mwaapelelesi. <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Ndipala jaajegala mu ligelesa kwa masoba matatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Lisoba la tatu Josepu jaapwagila, “Kwa ndaba nepani nundumbali Sapanga, nhenga ana ili nhwesa kulama. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Ana mwanganya ndi mwabandu monhobaleka, jumu winu juhigaliya mu kipungu, bangi baapelakiya posu akalongu bii bini inzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Ndienu mwandeta pamba nndongu wii nsoku. Hoku ndi kwiihingamakiya usakaka wa malobi ginu, nanamu ngamwiikomeki.” Ndienu bajetanganinya kuhenga hela. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Ndipala bapwaganinya beni na beni, “Sakaka twepani tung`alika ndaba ja mahakau gatunhengi nnuna witu. Hata ngati jabii nu usungu, twepani ngasetwalingaliya hata pajutulobalakiya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:21">Ndimana gutupata goti gani.<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Lubeni jaapwaaga, “Boo, ngasenumpwagi twaankoma nkombo? Lakini mwanganya ngasemwanyoanile! Henu tung`alika ndaba ja mahakau gitu.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Bombi ngasebamanyiki ana Josepu ngati juelewa gaalongela, ndaba pajalongila nabu kwabiya kwi indela juku nkalimani. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Josepu jajenda pulutengu jatenda kulela. Pajatulia jakelubuka kulongee nabu. Ndipala ankamula Simoni nukunzege pingu palongi ja miu gabu.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abeli baka Josepu abuja ku Kanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Josepu japia amuli mipuku jabu atwelakiya ilebi, na kila jumu wabu ankelubukiya lupija lwaki mu mpuku waki, na jaapekiya posu ji mwiindela. Baahengila majambu goti haga. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Bijitweka maponda gabu misigu jabu ji ilebi, nukubokane. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Pabahika pandu pukugone mwiindela, jumu wabu jahogula ligunii laki ili juwesa kulilea liponda laki, jasangia kwiiketane lupija lwaki mu ndomu gu mpuku waki. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Jaapwagila ajaki, “Lupija lwangu atei kukelabua. Lola pamba mundomu ju mpuku wango!” Pabajoa haga bahangajika su lujogopu. Balingalaninya koni abagaja nukulaluana, “Boo, lenieli lijambu boo lejutuhengi Sapanga?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Pabahika ku Kanani kwa atati babu Yakobu, bunsimulia goa gagapatiki, bumpwagila, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Nkolongu jwa nndema jola jalongila na twepani su ukali, nukutupwagi twepani twaapelelesi mu nndema waki. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Lakini twepani tundandila ndi twabandu totuhobaleka, na nga twaapelelese. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Tunndandila ana, twepani twaatumisi bako, tubii twaakilongu komi na abeli, bana baka mundu jumu twabenei buku nndema uku Kanani. Nnuna witu juhigali na atati kunyumba na nndongu witu jongi we jawiile. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Ndipala nkolongu jwa musi we hoju jutupwaagila, ‘Hela ndi panummanya mwanganya mwabandu bahobaleka. Mundeka nndongu wii jumu, namwabangi mpelika posu kunyumba kwa alongu bii bangi baabii ni inzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Ndipala mukundeta kwangu nnuna wi nsoku Benjamini hoju, na hapa ndi paniimanya mwanganya nga mwaapelelesi, ila ndi bandu baahobaleka. Ananhengiki hela nandekakiya nndongu winu Simoni, nanamu nanzetakaliya mwiibiya ntenda kulombesa nu kulomba mu nndema gongo.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Pababiya ajakana ilebi mu mipuku jabu, basangia kubona kila jumu wabu ankelubuki kipuku su lupija lwaki nkati ji ligunii laki. Pababona haga, boa pamu na atati babu lwaakamula lujogopu. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Atati babu Yakobu, jaapwagila, “Boo, mpala le kunyaga bana bango! Josepu ngasejubii, Simoni ngasejubii, henu mpala kunzukuu na Benjamini. Goti haga gambata nepani.”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Lubeni jaapwagila atati baki, “Ana ngasengelabwiki na Benjamini, waakoma bana ba abeli. Nndeka Benjamini mu maboku gangu, nanepani nukuntunza nukunkelabuu kwaku.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Lakini atati baki bunzibua, “Mwana wane ngajujendi na mwanganya, nndongu waki jukuwiki, najombi juhigali kajika jaki. Nepani nunseja jojubii na uliya ana kubii nkombu hoju jupatiki mang`aliku gokapi mu sapwali jenzenda eji, henu mwiingomaa ku usungu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Akaabeli baka Josepu ajenda ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Ndipala ling`ai inzala jabiya jitenda kujonzukeka ku nndema uku Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Ebajomula posu jela jebabiya ahemi kuhuma ku Misili, Yakobu jaapwagila bana baki, “Nnzendaninya kabee ku Misili mwakalomba posu nzokope.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Lakini Yuda jaapwagila atati baki, “Mundu jola jutulakali ngamaa, kupwaaga, ‘Ngananzopi ana ngamwiiki nu nndongu wii nsoku.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Ana gujetaki nndongu witu Benjamini jujenda pamu na twepani, ndienu, ngiti tujenda kulomba posu. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Lakini ana ngagujetake jujenda na twepani, ndi twepani ngatujende konioko, ndaba mundu jola jutupwagila, ‘Ngananzope ana ngamwiiki nu nndongu winu nsoku.’”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Israeli japwaaga, “Boo, ndaba jaki kumbeleka mu mang`aliku kupwaaga mmbii nu nndongu wi jonge?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Bunzibua, “Mundu we jola jwatenda kutulaluki sukuhingamki ngani kupete majambu gitu na alongu bitu kupwaaga, ‘Boo atati bii bakona bome? Boo, mmbii nu nndongu wi jonge?’ Henu tunnzibua kulengana na maswali gaki. Tukawesa boo kumanya ana ngiti jutupwagila, ‘Munndeta nndongu wii.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Yuda ampwagila Izilaeli atati baki, “Nyetakaliya nepani nyenda naku ili tuboka naku sajenu ili tubia twabomi na twiikuwa ni inzala twepani na wehapa pamu na bana bitu. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Nepani nakabiya nunzemale. Wehapa wiinaja nepani. Ana ngasenunkelabwii ili gummbona kwa mihu gaku wamweti, lawama joti jibiya jangu nepani yaka petapeta. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Ana ngasetwakakabaki twakabiya tupiti nu kukelabuka mala pabeli.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Hapa Izilaeli atati baki bapwaaga, “Hena kwa ndaba kupalika kuba hela ndienu, nhenga helahela, nnzukua mu mipuku jinu indu ya sapi yu punndema witu, mukumpekiya nhupi nkolongu mundu we hoju. Munntotuliya ubani, mitela juntomoni jebijikema zeli na manemane na mahuta masokopi gu nkwaju, busi nsokopi na posu jejilengana na malabi gu munkongu na lozi. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Nntotula lupija mala pabeli ju lupija lolupalika kwa ndaba mpalika kunkelabu lupija lola lomuluketaninya mu mipuku pengi babei kwa makosa pena. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Munzukua kabee nu nndongu winu nsoku nnzendaninya kabee kwaka mundu we hoju. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Sapanga Jwana Makili jumpekiya ikia palongi jaka mundu we hoju, jukunndekakiya nndongu wii jola pamu na Benjamini akakelubuka pamu na mwanganya. Ku upandi wangu ana kupalika kuwelee na bana bangu mmanyibasi kubiya aelaela.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Hapa batola nhupi yela nu lupija mala ibeli na yu utumbuli, bajenda ku Misili pamu nu nndongu wabu Benjamini. Pabahika bajenda kujema palongi jaka Josepu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Josepu eammbona Benjamini pamu nabombi, jaapwagila jojujemale nyumba jaki, “Waapelika bandu haba kunyumba, wakasinza kinyama simu nukulenganake sapi, ndaba bandu be haba posu ja lyobamutu ngiti akula na nepani.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Jojujemale jola jahenga ngati ebunndagalakiya. Jaapelika bandu bala kunyumba jaka Josepu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Pababona apelekwa kunyumba jaka Josepu lwakamula lujogopu bapwaganinya beni na beni, “Butuletiki kongo kwa ndaba ju lupija lobutukelubukiya lola mu mipuku jitu, patwahikiki lisoba la mwandi ili apata kikopakale sukutuhenga liyaa nukutujopa maponda gitu nukutuhenga twaatumwa baki.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Henu bunzendila jojujemale nyumba jaka Josepu nukulongee naku koni abiii pu nndyangu, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />bumpwagila, “Gupepa koku bambu, twepani twahiki pani pamwandi kulomba posu. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Etwahika pandu pukugone mwiindela, twahogula mipuku jitu, twasangia kulukole lupija kila jumu witu mu ndomu umpuku waki ngati eyabii. Henu tukelabwii lupija lola. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Tuletiki nu lupija longi lukulombe posu. Ngasetumanyiki nya jojutubekila lupija lwe holu mu mipuku jito.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Jojujemale jola jajibua, “Mwiikuba ni kiholu, wala mwiijogopa. Pangi Sapanga winu, Sapanga wa atati binu, ndi jojunkelubukiya lupija mu mipuku jinu. Nepani najopa lupija lwinu.” Ndipala jaaletila Simoni nndongu wabu.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Jojujemale jola pajaajopa pa nyumba jaka Josepu, jaapekiya masi nukusamba magolu gabu nakwagalea maponda gabu. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Nabombi baandia nhupi yabu yukumpeke Josepu pajihika lyobamutu, kwa ndaba bajoa ngiti akula pamu najombi. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Josepu pajakelubuka ku nyumba, bunndetila nnyumba nhupi yebabii atotwi bunzinamiya kwi isima. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Josepu jaalalukiya majambu gabu ndi nakwapwaagi, “Mwanzimuliya majambu gaka atati bii baasejiki bala, boo, ajumwike? Bakona bome?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Bunzibua, “Ntumisi waku atati bitu ajumwiki na bakona bome.” Ndipala bajinama kwi isima.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Josepu ejalinga nu kummbona Benjamini, nndongu waki mwana wa anyongo baki japwaaga, “Jonzo ndi nndongu wii nsoku jomwapwaga majambu gake?” Ndienu Josepu jaapwaaga, “Sapanga jugupengala mwanangu!” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Apalapa, Josepu jaboka pandu je pala, ndaba maholi gabiya gapala kupita kwa hamu ngolongu juku nndongu waki, jajingala kusumba jaki kulela kwa sauti. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Ejajomula kulela jasamba masi pamihu jaki, japita koni jilikasa, jalagalakiya posu jiihika. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Josepu bunhandaliya posu jaki kajika jaki, na alongu baki baandaliya pakajika ahelahe kabee bandu buku Misili babakula pamu naku, baandaliya pakajika jabu, ndaba ngasekupalika Amisili kula posu pamu na Aebulania ndaba wabiya nhilu. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Alongu baka Josepu batami pamu kulengana na umuli wabu, kutumbuli ju utumbuli mbaka jwamwisu, babiya alingalani sukusangaa. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Posu jabiya jijukulika pamesa jaka Josepu nukupelekwa kwabu, lakini Benjamini bumpekia mala nhwanu ja posu jebapekiya alongu baki bangi. Ndienu bakula na kunywa nukutogule pamu.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Kikombi kibonakana kwaka Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Ndipala Josepu anndagalakiya jojujemale nyumba jaki kupwaaga, “Ntwelakiya mipuku ja banganya aba ilebi ye awesa kutoto. Kabee, mmbeka kabee lupija lwabu mundomu ji mipuku jabu. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Mumpuku guku nsoku hoju, mmbekila kikombi sa madini gu feza pamu nu lupija lwaki.” Jojujemale jola jahenga ngati eandagalakiya Josepu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Ekwakusa baajetakaliya alongu baka Josepu kuboka pamu na maponda gabu. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Babiya ajendiki mwendu nsokopi pena kuhuma ku musi, Josepu ampwagila jojujemale nyumba jaki jola, “Kanyata, waakagula bandu bala na pawakakolila waalalukiya, ‘Ndaba jaki kulepa ubaja na twepani tunhengi gaamboni? Ndaba jakii kujiba kikombi saka bambu wango, <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />sesuse jombi junywele nu kulote majambu gagihika? Nkosii ngamaa kuhenga hela!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Jojujemale jola pajaaketaninya jaapwagila malobi ganga. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Lakini bombi bunndalukiya, “Bambu gubii na mana boo kutupwagi malobi haga? Twepani twaatumisi baku nga twekuwesa kuhenga lijambu ngati alele. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Kombuka bambu, lupija lotulukolila mumilomu ji mipuku jitu twakelabwii kuhuma ku musi uku Kanani. Kwiwesikana bole kabee tujiba lupija au zahabu ju nyumba jaka bambu wako? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Ndienu, ana jupatakini jumu witu jubii ni kikombi sehesi jukomika na twepani twabangi twiibiya twaatumwa baku.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Jojujemale jola japwaaga, “Hena kubiya ngati empwagiki. Jokapi jiibia ni kikombi se hesi, jwiibiya ntumwa jwango, lakini mbangi mwaboti ngamwiikubi na lawama.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Ndienu, kila mundu jatola mpuku waki pai nyata nukupobo. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Jojujemalee jola jalingalakia mipuku joti, kutumbulii luku nkolongu wabu nukujomule luku nsoku ngani. Kikombi se sapatikana mu mpuku waka Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Hapa bajendula ingobu yabu ku usungu. Kila jumu wabu jakwea nsigu waki piliponda laki nukukelabuka ku musi.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda na alongu baki bahika kunyumba jaka Josepu najombi Josepu jabiya jakona kunyumba. Ndienu pajajingala bunzinamiya kwi isima, <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Josepu jwaalalukiya, “Ndaba jakii nhengiki hela? Boo, ngasemmanyiki ana ngati nepani mii nu uwesu ukulotela?” <verse eid="GEN 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda ampwagila, “Tugupwagila kii bambu? Tupwaaga kike kulangi ngasetubii ni kihakao? Sapanga juyekwi kihakau situ, twepani twaatumwa baku. Henu twaboa twaatumwa baku na jojupatakini ni kikombi saku.” <verse eid="GEN 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Lakini Josepu japwaagila, “Ngahela! Nepani nganhwesi kuhenga hela! Jojupatakini pe ni kikombi sangu ndi jojwiibiya ntumwa jwango. Mwanganya mwaboti mmbujaninya kwa atati bino.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ankengale Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />“Ndienu Yuda anhegaliya Josepu nukumpwagi, Bambu, ndenda kuguloba gunyetakaliya nepani nu ntumisi waku, nilikengaliya palongi jaku kwa malobi masokopi, nuguloba winhyomela, ndaba wehapa ndi ngati Falau mweni. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Bambu, wehapa utulalukiya ana, ‘Boo, mmbii na atati au kilongo?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Natwepani tugulandila tubii na atati kabee hokomundu, na tubii ni kilongu witu jongi nsoku jojasaliwa kipindi su useja wa atati bitu. Mmbeli waka nkombu we hoju jajomwike, nu nsoku ajo ndi jojuhigali kajika jaki kwa anyongo baki, na ahokomundu bitu ampai ngamaa nkombu we hoju. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Bambu utulagalakiya twepani twaatumisi baku kunndeta nnuna witu ili gummbona. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Tugulandila ana, ‘Nkombu we hoju ngakuwesa kulekana na atati baki haba, kwa ndaba anajuhengiki hela atati baki biitenda kuwa.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Lakini wehapa bambu utupwagila anangasetuhikiki nu nndongu witu ngawatujopi kabee.<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />“Etwakelubuka kunyumba juku ntumisi waku, atati bitu tundandila ngati eutulagalakiya bambu. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Najombi jutupwagila twepani tuhika kongo kulomba posu jengi kasokopi, <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />tumpwagila, ‘Ngatuwesi kujenda sanga nndongu witu nsoku, kujenda naku ngajukutujope mundu we hojo.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Ndienu, atati bitu ntumisi waku, jutupwagila, ‘Mmanyiki nhwanu wa Laeli jamelaki bana abeli akanalomi pena. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Jumu we jahobiki, nanepani napwaga sakaka yunkuliki inyama imwikioli yunsekulini ipandiipandi, ndaba ngasenumbweni kabete. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Ana munzukwi kabee ajo kuhuma kwangu, henu mwiindaga mu litenge nunseja jojubii nu usungu koni mii nu usungu.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />“Henu bambu ana ngelabwiki kwa atati bangu sanga nkombu hajo, koni womi wa atati bangu guhobale womi waka nkombu ajo, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />ana jubweni nkombu ngasejubii pamu na twepani jakatenda kuwa. Henu twaatumisi baku twaakoma atati bitu ku usungu. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Pamu na goa ge haga nilipia kuba jukunzemale nkombu we hoju kwa atati bangu sukupwaga, ana ngasenunkelabwii Benjamini kwaku, lawama jibiya panani jangu yaka yanga na mwisu. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Henu, bambu nuguloba, nepani nuntumisi waku nhigaliya mia nu ntumwa waku badala juku nkombu ajo. Gundeka jombi jubuja kunyumba pamu na akalongu baki. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Niiwesaboo kwa kelabuki atati bango sanga nkombu ajojo? Nganakawesi kunhinakali kukibona sindu sesakakolila atati bango.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Josepu julimanyisa kwa alongu baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Hapa Josepu jasidwa kuliiya palongi jaboa babahikanii naku, jalagalakiya apitaninya kunza. Henu Josepu jabiya kajika jaki pajilimanyisa kwa alongu baki. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Lakini jalela kwa sauti ngolongu mbaka bandu buku Misili bunzoini, ahelahe kabee na bandu ba alongu baka Falau nabombi bunzoini. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Josepu jaapwaagila akaalongu baki, “Nepani ndi Josepu. Boo, atati ba bakona bome?” Lakini akaalongu mundu ngasebawesiki kunzibu ndaba julujogopu lobabinaku palongi jaki. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Josepu jaapwagila akalongu baki, “Nhegaliya pambipi jango.” Pabunhegaliya jaapwagila, “Nepani nu nndongu winu Josepu, jomunndombisa ku Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Lakini henu mwihangajika wala kujilaumu ndaba juku nombesa ku Misili. Sapanga ndi jojaneta kongoni nunndonguliya ili nhokua womi wa bandu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Senze saka sa pili pena toka inzala pajajingala pani pu nndema, na yakona yaka yengi nhwanu ngabiiwesi kulema wala kuhusa. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Sapanga janeta kongoo nundonguliya, ili kuulamisa womi nhigaliya mwabomi punndema na kwaakombo ku ukombosi nkolongu. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Henu ngamwanganya moonetiki nepani kongoo, ila ndi Sapanga. Ndi jojunhengiki ngati atati kwaka Falau, jojujemale nyumba jaki joti nu kulongosa Misili joti.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Henu ntenda nyata nzenda kwa atati mwakapwagila, Josepu mwana waku jupwaaga. Sapanga junhengiki miya nu nkolongu juku Misili henu jwiiselewa kuhika kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Wiitama pambipi nanepani ku Gosheni, wehapa bana baku na asoko baku, mipugu jaku na mali gaku goa. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Pawibiya ku Gosheni nepani nagutunza wehapa, alongu baku pamu na indu yaku yoti yemmbii naku ili mwiikuwa ni inzala, ndaba jakona yaka nhwanu yi inzala.<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Ndipala Josepu jaapwaaga, “Mwanganya kwa mihu gii mmbweni nu nndongu waa Benjamini kwa miu gaki jubweni kuba nepani ndi Josepu nenongi na mwanganya. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Nzenda mwakaapwagila atati bangu namuna hembatiki isima ku Misili na goa gamwagabweni. Ndienu nhenga nyata mwakaaleta atati bangu kongo.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Ndipala Josepu anzobatiya Benjamini, nndongu waki nukulela, Benjamini najombi jatenda kulela koni ajobatani. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Pajabiya jakona jakalela, Josepu jaajobatiya alongu baki na kwaabusu. Hapa ndi alongu baki pabawesa kulongee naku.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Majambu haga pagahika ku Ikulu jaka Bambu nkolongu, kupwaaga alongu baka Josepu atei kuhika majambu ge haga gunndenganii ngamaa Falau na aka kilongosi baabii paijaki. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Henu Falau ampwagila Josepu, jaapwaagila alongu baki akwea misigu jabu mu maponda gabu abuja ku Kanani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />bakaaleta pamba atati babu na bukunyumba jaki boti. Nepani ngiti naapekiya pandu pa sapi papabii na mbolea ngani punndema wa pa Misili papuje biiwesa kutogule kupata ilebi yoti gupu nndema goni. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Waapwagila ajukua magali gagahutwa na ngamia kuhuma pa Misili pani ga kwaatoto bana babu akeki na akahanamundu na wala biikosa kuhika na atati babu. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Wakaapwagila biijogopa kupete mali gabu ndaba pandu pasapi kupeta poa pu nndema uku Misili piibiya gwabu.<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Ndienu bana baka Yakobu bahenga ngati ebaalagalakiya. Josepu jaapekiya magali kulengana na malagisu gaka Falau na posu ja kula mwiindela. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Jaapekiya kila jumu wabu ingobu yukubadilisa, lakini Benjamini ampekiya ipandi selasini yu lupija ni ingobu inyai nhwanu yuku badilisa. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Kabee jaatumila atati baki nhupi yenze, maponda komi gagatotwi hindu ya sapi yuku Misili, maponda gakambomba komi gagatotwi ilebi, mabumunda na yakula yengi. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Ndienu Josepu jatabukana na alongu baki. Pababiya atenda kuboka jaalagaliya kupwaaga, “Mwiilosana mwiindela.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Ndienu baboka ku Misili nukubuja kunyumba kwa atati babu Yakobu, ku nndema uku Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Baapwagila atati babu, Josepu jubii mwome! Jombi ndi jojujemale hindu yupunndema goti guku Misili. Hapa atati babu batenda kusangaa, ndaba ngasebawesa kuhobale malobi gabu.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Lakini pabasimuliya goti gajalagalakiya Josepu na pajagabona magali gaampeki Josepu kunzukuu, mwoju waka Yakobu atati babu watenda kutuli. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Izilael japwaaga, “Henu nisiki, mwana wa Josepu jakona mwomi! Ngiti nyenda kummbona kabula ngasenguiki.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu jujenda ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Ndienu, Yakobu jatumbuliya sapwali jaki pamu na mali gaki goa. Pajahika ku Beelisheba, ampikia matambiku Sapanga waka Isaka, atati baki. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Sapanga jalongila na Yakobu mumabonu ikilu ankema, “Yakobu, Yakobu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Yakobu jajetika, “Hena mi pambane.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Sapanga ampwagila, “Nepani ndi Sapanga, Sapanga wa atati bako. Wiijogopa kujenda ku Misili, ewibiya hoku naguhenga gubiya waatati ba bandu bingi. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Nepani namweti ngiti nyenda pamu nawehapa ku Misili hoku, kabee naikelubua ibeleku yaku mu nndema guku Kaanani gongo. Pawiikuwa kuboku kwaka Josepu ndi kokwiyekaliya mihu gaku.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Ndienu, Yakobu jaboka ku Beelisheba. Bana baki bunzukua jombi, bana babu akeki na akahanu babu mu magali gaguge Falau japelika gukunzukua. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Bajukua kabee, mipugu na mali gabu goa gababiya apatiki mu nndema uku Kanani, bajenda ku Misili. Yakobu jajukua ibeleku yaki yoti. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Jaajukua bana baki akanalomi, asoku baki akanalomi na bana baki akambomba na asoko baki akammbomba, boti jaaleta ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Bana akanalomi baka Izilaeli babapiti ku Misili pamu najombi babiya Lubeni mwana ju utumbuli jwaka Izilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Bana akanalomi baka Lubeni, Henoki na Palu na Hesiloni na Kalimi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Bana akanalomi baka akanalomi baka Simoni babiya, Jemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohali na Shauli, jojabelakika nu mmbomba juku Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Bana akanalomi baka Lawi babiya, Gelushoni na Koati na Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Bana akanalomi baka Yuda babiya, Eri na Onani na Shela na Pelesi na Zela. Lakini Eri na Onani bakuwa ku nndema uku Kanani. Bana baka Pelesi babiya Hesiloni na Amuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Bana akanalomi baka Isakali babiya, Tola na Puva na Yashubu na Shimuloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Bana akanalomi baka Zebuluni babiya, Seledi na Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Bana akanalomi baka Lea babube jabiya ambelaki Yakobu ku Padani alami pamu na Dina kamwali waki. Bana baki boti akanalomi na kamwali baki na asokoo baki babii bandu selasini na tatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Bana akanalomi baka Gadi babiya, Sipioni na Hagi na Shuni na Esiboni na Eri na Alodi na Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Bana anakanalomi baka Asheli babiya, Imuna na Ishuva na Ishuvi na Belia na Sela jabia nndombu wabu. Belia na bana baki na Hebeli na Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Haba ndi bana akanalomi baka Zilipa mtumisi jojuwe Labani ampekia Lea kamwali waki, nukummbelake Yakobu jumula ja bana na asokoo babia komi na sita.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Laeli ammbelakiya Yakobu bana abeli, Josepu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Ku Misili Asenati, kamwali waka Potipela, jojabii nngolu wa musi uku Oni, ammbelakiya Josepu bana abeli, Manase na Epulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Bana akanalomi baka Benjamini bakabii Bela na Bakeli na Ashibeli na Gela na Naamani na Ehi na Loshi na Mupimu na Hupimu na Alidi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Bandu haba komi nu nnsesi ndi bana baki na asoko baka Yakobu na Laeli nhwana mundu. <verse eid="GEN 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Mwana waka Dani jwabiya Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Bana akanalomi baka Naputali babiya, Yaseeli na Guni na Yeseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Bandu saba haba ndi bana na asoko baka Yakobu na Bilia kamwali waka Laeli jobumpekiya atati baki Labani.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Bandu boti babapiti ku Misili na Yakobu, babaii kibeleku saki, sanga kwaabalanga akahanu ba bana mundu, jumla babii bandu sitini na sita. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Ku nndema uku Misili Josepu jabelika bana abeli akanalomi. Bandu boti bi kibeleku saka Yakobu babajingala ku Misili babii sabini.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu na ibeleku yaki juhika ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakobu anndongulikiya Yuda kwaka Josepu kunndoba abonana ku Gosheni, nabombi bahika ku Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Josepu jakwela ligali laki la Palasi, jajenda kunzopa Yakobu atati baki ku Gosheni. Josepu pajahikila atati baki, jajobatiya nukulela ku kipindi kilasu ngani. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Izilaeli ampwagila Josepu, “Henu mi tayali kuwa, ndaba nugubweni nukumanya wakona wamwome.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Josepu jaapwagila alongu baki ni kilongu soti sa atati baki, “Nyenda kumpwagii Falau ana mwaalongu bangu ni ilongu yoti ya atati babii mu nndema uku Kanani ahikiki kwango. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Nukundandila ana mwanganya mwaalimi ndaba mkubika mndima mipugu, nunhikiki pamu ni imbui na makondoo na ng`ombi na mali gii goa. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Ndienu Falau anajunkemiki nukunndaluki, nhenga lihengu bole, <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />mwakapwaaga, bambu twepani twaa atumisi baku ndi twaalimi bi mipugu tumbuka umwana witu mbaka lelenu, hela ndi ebabii akahoku bitu, mwakapwaga hela ili bukunnzetakaliya kutama mu lieneu luku Gosheni.” Josepu japwaaga hela, ndaba kwa Amisili baasunga makondoo kwabu ngakupalika.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Ndienu, Josepu jajenda kwaka Falau, ampwagila, “Atati bangu na alongu bangu pamu makondoo na ng`ombi na mali gabu goa, ahikiki kuhuma ku Kanani. Henu abii pandu pa Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Josepu jabiya jaajukwi alongu baki nhwanu, jaamanyisa kwaka Falau. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Falau jalalukiya, “Nhenga lihengu bole?” Bunzibua, “Bambu, twepani twa atumisi baku ndi twalimi bi inyama, ngati ebabii akahoku bitu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Ndipala bumpwagila Falau, “Twepani atumisi baku tuhikiki kutama ngati twaageni mu nndema wi moni ndaba inzala jibii ingali ku Kanani na ngakuba kabeti nusukulekee mipugu jitu. Henu bambu tuguloba twepani twaatumisi baku, gutujetakaliya kutama mu nndema uku Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Falau ampwagila Josepu, “Atati baku na alongu baku aguhiki wehapa. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Nndema woti uku Misili gubii pai jaku, wapekiya atati baku na alongu baku pandu paasapi munndema gongo. Waaleka atama mu lieneu luku Gosheni. Anakubii waamanyi bandu baamboni kati jabu, wahagula abiya bandu baajemale mipugu jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Ndipala, Josepu jaaleta atati baki Yakobu kunndamuki Falau, najombi Yakobu ampekiya Falau mbenge yaki. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Falau anndalukiya Yakobu, “Gubii na yaka ilenga?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobu jajibua, “Mii na yaka mia jimu na selasini yuku hama. Yaka yeheyi ibii isoku na yeitweli mang`aliku, kabee ngasejihiki yaka yebatami aseja bangu punndema gongo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Ndipala Yakobu ampengaliya Falau nukuboka. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Ndienu, Josepu jaapekiya atati baki na alongu baki ni lieneu luku Lamesesi lelibii la sapi ngani mu nndema uku Misili, libiya pandu pabu beni, nabombi bililongosa ngati ejalagalakiya Falau. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Josepu jukubika jaapeke posu atati baki na alongu baki na kilongu sa atati baki kulengana na bana babu.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sejahenga Josepu kipindi si ling`ai li Inzala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Mwenikatai posu jabiya jijomwiki musi woti. Inzala jabii ingali ngamaa heji jaahenga bandu boti buku Misili nuku Kanani kukombala kwa ndaba ji inzala. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Josepu jakusanya lupija lwoti lwa Musi uku Misili nuku Kanani kulengana ni ilebi yebalombiki, japelika lupija lwe holu ku nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu kwaka Falau. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Bandu boti bunndema uku Misili nuku Kanani ebajomula kutumii lupija lwabu lwoti luku Misili boti bunhikila Josepu nukumpwagi, “Tupekiya posu. Ndaba jakii gupala tukuwa palongi ja miu gako? Linga henu lupija lwitu lujomwiki.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Josepu ampwagila, “Ana lupija lwii lujomwiki, mbekiya mipugu jinu, nanepani ngiti numpekiya posu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Ndipala bunndetila Josepu mipugu jabu, Falasi yabu na makondoo gabu ni imbui yabu na maponda gabu najombi jaapekiya posu. Saka se hesi Josepu jabiya jaapeke posu sukubadilisa ni mipugu jabu.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Saka sesapwata bahika kabee nukumpwagi, “Bambu, usakaka weni lupija lwitu lwoti lujomwike ni inyama itu ibii mali gaku. Henu bambu twepani twaatumisi baku sajenu ngasetubii na sokapi setuwesa kugupeke ila yega itu na matui gitu pena. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Kubii na mana boo twepani kuwa palongi ja miu gaku na matui gitu kuhalabika? Utulomba twepani pamu na matui gitu, tubiya twaatumwa baka Falau, ili pe tupata posu. Tupekiya posu ili twiikuwa, gutupekiya ni imbeju kwa ndaba ja matui gitu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Henu Josepu anndobila Falau nndema woti uku Misili gubiya mali gaka Falau. Kila mundu juku Misili japalika kulombesa litui, kwa ndaba ji inzala ejabii ingali. Nndema woti wabiya waka Falau, <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />na Josepu jaahenga bandu kuba atumwa, kuhuma upandi gumu mbaka upandi gongi uku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Hata hela, Josepu ngasejalombiki nndema gwaka agolu. Haba ngasebalombisi nndema wabu ndaba apatika posu kuhuma kwaka Falau. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Ndipala, Josepu jaapwagila bandu, “Nndinga nundombiki mwanganya mwaboti na matui gii kuba mali gaka Falau lelenu. Ngiti bumpekiya imbeju nanamu mwakapanda mu matui gino. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Kipindi sukuhusa, pandu pamu pu nhwanu mwampekiya Falau. Pandu pu nnsesi papaigali pibiya imbeju ja matui ginu na ndaba jinu mwabeti na posu ja bandu bu nnyumba jinu na posu ja bana binu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Bunzibua, “Bambu, uguokwi womi witu.” Kwa ndaba utulangi uamboni waku, twepani twibiya twaatumwa baka Falau. <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Ndienu Josepu jaatangasiya lilagalaki limu lelule libii mbaka lelenu mu musi uku Misili. Kila mundu jupalika kupia pandu pu nhwanu pi ilebi yaki kwaka Falau. Luombi lwa agolu ndi ngasebalomba nukuluhenga mali gaka Falau.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuloba kwa mwisu kwaka Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Henu bandu buku Izilaeli batama lieneu luku Gosheni nndema uku Misili. Ebabii hoku, bapatiki mali ngagago, babelikana nukujonzukeka ngamaa. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobu jatama ku Musi uku Misili kwa yaka komi na saba, mbaka pajahikila yaka mia jimu alubaini na saba. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Kipindi sa kuwa kwaki Izilaeli esahegaliya, ankema mwana waki Josepu, ampwagila, “Henu ana sakaka gumbai, beka kuboku kwaku mumiungu ja amo nuku napi, gunyetakaliya ana gwi ndendila kwi isima na haki. Ngawiindaga koni ku Misili, <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />ila wiing`onika pamu naka ahoku bangu. Wiinyukua kuhuma ku Misili wakandaga ku matenge gabu.” Josepu jajibua, “Ngiti nhenga ngati empwagiki.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Izilaeli ampwagila, “Napila,” Josepu jaalapila. Ndipala Izilaeli jajinamiya upandi ukumutu upi kitanda saki kwi isima.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Izilaeli jaapenge Epulaimu na Manasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Egapeta haga, Josepu japata majambu kupwaaga atati baki abii atamwa. Henu jajukua bana baki abeli, Manasi na Epulaimu, jajenda naku kwa atati baki. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Yakobu paampwagila ana Josepu mwana waku juhikiki kugubona, jakasana kujumuka, nukutama pikitanda. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yakobu ampwagila Josepu, “Sapanga jwana makili jambitila panabii ku Luzu mu nndema uku Kanani, jatenda kumbenge. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Jaambwagila, ‘Linga naguhenga gubiya ni ibeleku nukujonzukeka kuba likundi la bandu bingi, naguhenga gubiya mwaahoku wa bandu bingi. Nndema gongo naapekiya bana baku ajilongusa yaka yoti.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Yakobu jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Bana baku abeli bawapatiki pani pa Misili kipindi ne kanuhika, ndi bana bangu, Epulaimu na Manasi bibiya bana bangu ngati eabii Lubeni na Simoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Lakini bana bangi bawapata mwenikatai bibiya baku, mu nndema gobilisa biimanyikana kwi liina la alongu babu. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Panabiya ngelabuka kuhuma ku Padani, Laeli jakuwa mu nndema uku Kanani, patwahegaliya kuhika ku musi uku Epulati, janekila usungu.” Ndienu nuntaga papa, mulutengu ji indela jejijenda ku Epulati yani Betileemu.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Izilaeli pajaabona bana baka Josepu, anndalukiya, “Boo, baniaba be akanyane?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Josepu jaajibua atati baki, “Haba ndi bana bangu bajambekiya Sapanga pamii kongone.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Izilaeli japwaaga, “Gupepa koku waaleta pambipi pamba ili naapengila.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Mihu gaka Izilaeli gabiya ngasegalinga sapi ndaba ju useja. Ndienu, Josepu jahegakiya bana baki pambipi na atati baki najombi jabusua na kwaajobate. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Ndipala izilaeli ampwagila Josepu, “Kyee ngasenaholali kugubona kabee, lakini kumbi Sapanga junhwesisi kwaabona mbaka bana baku kabee.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Hapa Josepu jaaboa bana baki mwamagoti ga atati baki, ndipala jajinama kwi isima.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Josepu jaatondabiya bana baki abeli, Epulaimu kuboku kwaki kumalele, koni anndangi kuboku kwaki ku mangega kwa atati baki, Manasi kuboku kwaki kwa mangega, anndangi kuboku ku malele kwa atati baki, jaahegakiya kwa ahoku babu. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Lakini Yakobu jakobangana maboku gaki. Kuboku kwa malele jabeka kwaka Epulaimu jojabii nsoku nu kuboku kwa mangega jabeka pamutu jaka Manase jojabii kibeleku su utumbulii. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Ndipala, Izilaeli ampengaliya Josepu kupwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Sapanga jwa ahoku Ibulaimu ni Isaka jobunzoaninya mu womi wabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Sapanga jojunongwisi mu womi wangu mbaka lelenu,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />nu ntumi jwaka Sapanga jukunani jojanhokua mu ubaja goti, na jaapengaliya akakombu bamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Liina langu na mahina ga aseja bangu, Ibulaimu ni Isaka, gahendaliya kwaka akombu haba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">nabombi ajonzukika ngani punndema pani.” <verse eid="GEN 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Josepu ejabona atati baki abei kuboku kwa malele pamutu jaka Epulaimu ngasejatogulile. Ndienu, jajukua kuboku kwa atati baki japala kuguboa panani jaka Epulaimu jugubeka panani ju umutu waka Manasi. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Jaapwagila atati baki, “Ngahela atati, jonzo pamba ndi kibeleku su utumbuli. Mpepa koku mmbeka kuboku kwi kwa malele panani ju umutu wake.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Lakini ahengo batenda kukana, “Manyike, mwanangu, manyike. Bana baka Manasi bibiya bandu bingi ngani na baajoanike. Hata hela, nndongu waki nsoku jibiya nkolongu kuliku jombi, ni ibeleku yaki ibiya misi jingi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Ndienu, Izilaeli jaapengaliya lisoba le heli kupwaaga, “Aizilaeli bagatumia mahina ginu kupenge, biipwaaga, ‘Sapanga juguhengila gaamboni ngati Epulaimu na Manasi.’ ” Ndienu Yakobu eambeka Epulaimu palongi jaka Manasi.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Ndipala Izilaeli ampwagila Josepu, “Ngati egubona, nepani nhegale kuwa. Hata hela, Sapanga jibiya pamu na mwanganya, nukunkelabuu mu musi wa ahoku bino. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Nugupeki wehapa wala nga alongu baku lieneu luku kitombi, lenaanyaga Aamoli ku mpamba nu upindi wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu jaapenge bana baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Yakobu jaakema bana baki, jaapwagila, “Nkusanyika pamu numpwagila majambu gagampata masoba gagahika.” <verse eid="GEN 49:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />“Nkusanyika nnzoaninya mwabana baka Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">nnzoaninya nepani Izilaeli atati binu. <verse eid="GEN 49:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Wa Lubeni wewatumbuliya kubelakeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">wehapa ndi makili gangu nugubelika kipindi su ukombu gwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Wehapa gu nkolongu nu gubii na makili kwaapeta alongu baku. <verse eid="GEN 49:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Wehapa gubii ngati masi gi kikoka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Lakini ngawiikubi wamwana ju utumbuli kabeti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">ndaba wagoni nilibangu langu la atati baku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">wehapa wapilia kitanda sangu sukukwela panani jaki hena wehapa wakweile.” <verse eid="GEN 49:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />“Simoni na Lawi mwakilongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">hindu yukukomane anhenge kuhenga ukatili, <verse eid="GEN 49:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />lakini nepani nganyetangane nabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">wa mbomu jangu wijetakane ni mikutanu jabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">ndaba mu inyela yabu baakoma bandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">ku ungukuna wabu basekula misipa mikolongu ju kugolu ulikambaku la ng`ombi. <verse eid="GEN 49:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Niilapii yambamba inyela yabu ndaba ibii ingali ngani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">ni inyela yabu yanga ni ikia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Nantawanisa mu makabila gaka Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">nantawanisa mu nndema uku Izilaeli.” <verse eid="GEN 49:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />“Wa Yuda alongu baku biitenda kugulumbalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">abaja baku wainyatiya pahingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">na alongu baku biijinama palongi jaku. <verse eid="GEN 49:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yuda gubii ngiti liimba likolongu lelipatiki inyama yejuiibengiki yaki mukinyoi nu lelijomwi kula posu jaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Ngati liimba lijinyosa nukugone pai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">liimba lana makili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">nya jojulenga kulijumua. <verse eid="GEN 49:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Ubambu nkolongu ngawiboki kwaku Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">wala ulongosi ngawiiboki mwamagolu gaku mbaka pajihika mbelekwa waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">jojuwe bandu boti bupunndema biitenda kunzoanela. <verse eid="GEN 49:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Jiikonga liponda laki mu Zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na katoli kaki mu Zabibu jejibii ja amboni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Jusapa ingobu yaki mu divai ngeli ngati mwai. <verse eid="GEN 49:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Mihu gaki ndi makeli ngati divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">minu gaki manhuu kupeta masiba.” <verse eid="GEN 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />“Zebuluni wiitama lieneu luku mbwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">mbwani jaki jibiya pandu pukujemeka meli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">nndema waki wiihegalaninya na musi uku Sidoni.” <verse eid="GEN 49:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />“Isakali jubii ngati liponda lana makili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">lelegone pikilanda ji misigu jaki. <verse eid="GEN 49:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Jabona pandu pukupomule ndi paamboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">na nndema gongo ndi gogunyambiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">jajinamisa nngongu waki kutoto misigu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">jabiya ntumwa kuhenga mahengu sanga kupalika. <verse eid="GEN 49:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Dani jibiya jojuamu kwa bandu baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">ngati jumu jwa makabila guku Izilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 49:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Jibiya ngati lijoka mwiindela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">lijoka limbetu lelibii na sumu mulutengu ji mwiindela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">jojuluma magolu ya falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">najombi jojukwei li falasi kuhabuka kihanga nyuma.” <verse eid="GEN 49:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />“Waa Bambu Sapanga nendale gunhokuaje.” <verse eid="GEN 49:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />“Gadi baantukaliya bandu baanyaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">lakini jombi jajengaliya munyuma nakwaatukali.” <verse eid="GEN 49:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />“Nndema waka Asheli wiipia ilebi hingipi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">najombi jiipiya posu jejundengane bambu nkolongu.” <verse eid="GEN 49:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />“Naputali ngati kinyama sebikema holoku jojulekakiwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">jojubeleka bana baabii sapi.” <verse eid="GEN 49:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />“Josepu ndi ngati nkongu gu nzabibu gogupapa mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">gogubeleka pulutengu ja pandu pagatimbilikana masi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">mandambi gaki gabambaa mu ukuta. <verse eid="GEN 49:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Baapega mikoa busambuliya ngamaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">bundekaliya mikoa nukunsumbuu ngamaa. <verse eid="GEN 49:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Lakini lupendi lwaki lwakona nganganganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">na maboku gaki bagapeki makili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">ku uwesu Jwana Makili gaka Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">ku liina luku Nndimi, Lilibu luku Izilaeli, <verse eid="GEN 49:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />ndi Sapanga wa atati baku ngiti jugujangatiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">ndi Sapanga Jwana Makili jojagupengila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">gupata mbenge ji iyula kuhuma kunani ku maundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">mbenge ya masi semusemu kuhuma pai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">mbenge ni ibeleku yaka nyongo ni mipugu. <verse eid="GEN 49:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Mbenge ya atati baku ibii na makili kupeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">mbenge yi milema ya yaka petapeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">ibiya ya amboni kupeta milema ja mwandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Mbenge yeheyi ibiya panani jaka Josepu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">panani ju mmutu waki jola jobummbei kuba kilongosi kati ja alongu baki.” <verse eid="GEN 49:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Benjamini jubii ngati jibwa ingali ji mwikioli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">pulukela jaatukali abaja baki, na pakamii jubaga hindu yejaanyaga bandu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Haga ndi makabila komi na mabeli guku Izilaeli na haga ndi malobi gabaapwagila atati babu pajaapengila, kila mundu ngati ekwapalika.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa nu kutagwa kwaka Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Ndipala, jaalagalakiya bana baki ana, “Nepani nhegale kuwa nukujongana na bandu bangu. Mwiindaga pamu na aseja bangu mu likolo lelibii mu litui luku Epuloni Nhiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />ku Makipela kolipiti lyoba ku Mamule nndema uku Kanani, Ibulaimu jalombiki likolo ni litui heli laka Epuloni Nhiti libiya laki lukuntagi. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Hoku ndi kobatagiki Ibulaimu nu nhwanamundu Sala, hoku ndo kobaatagiki Isaka nu nhwanamundu Lebeka na hoku ndi kununtagiki Lea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Litui leheli ni likolo laki balomba kwa Ahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakobu pajajomula kwaapeke malobi ga mwisu bana baki, jakelubua magolu gaki pikitanda, jakuwa nukujongana na akahoku baki.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Hapa Josepu jaajinamiya ntui wa atati baki nukujobate koni jakalela. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Ndipala, jaalagalakiya akasing`anga baki bumpakia Izilaeli atati baki, mitela jukunkenga jiibola nabombi bahenga hela. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Batumia masoba alubaini ndaba ndi kipindi sesapalika kujege mitela ili yega jiibola. Nabombi bandu buku Misili bunndelila Yakobu kwa masoba sabini.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Ebajomula kukanga luwai, Josepu jaapwagila akolongu ba bandu baka Falau, “Mii ni malobi mbala kumpwaagi Falau mpepa koku noba nndongila naku badala jangu, ‘Atati bangu bambwagila napa ili nhenga ngati heambwagi nukumbwaagi, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />nepani nhegale kuwa. Kupalika kundaga ku litenge lenenganaki ku Kanani.’ Henu nunndoba junyetakaliya nyenda kwaataga atati bangu ndi nihika kabee.”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Falau jajibua, “Jenda ukaataga atati baku ngati ebugulapila.” <verse eid="GEN 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Ndienu Josepu jaboka kujenda kwaataga atati baki jalongana na atumisi boti baka Falau, aseja ba nyumba jaka Falau pamu na aseja bu nndema woti uku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Ahelahe na Josepu jalongana na alongu baki boti, aka kilongu boti baka Yakobu. Mu lieneu luku Gosheni bahigaliya bana babu pena pamu na makondoo ni imbui na ng`ombi yabu. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Kabee balongana naku baakwelale falasi na magali, wabiya nsambi nkolongu ngamaa.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Pabahika ku kibanza sukupeta ilebi sa Atati kwii ja losi luku Yoludani, balobalakiya ku usungu nkolongu, najombi Josepu jaahengila ahengo matanga ga masoba saba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Akanani bu Musi we hogu, pababona kulobalake kobahenga ku kibanza sa Atadi, bapwaganiya, “Kulobalake hako kwa Amisili sakaka kukolongu.” Henu ndi pandu je pala kwakemika Abelimisili, napombi pabii kwii juku Yoludani.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Henu, bana baka Yakobu baahengila atati babu ngati ebalagalakiya. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Baajukua mbaka musi uku Kanani, baataga pi likolo lelibii mu litui luku Makipela, upandi golipiti lyoba guku Mamule. Likolo pamu ni litui heli Ibulaimu jabiya julombiki kwaka Epuloni Nhiti, ili pabiya pandu paki pukuntagi. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Ebabiya baatagiki atati baki, Josepu jakelubuka ku Misili pamu na alongu baki na bandu boti babalongini naku kujenda kwaataga atati baki.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josepu jaaboa kiholu akalongu baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Ekwapeta kuwa kwa atati babu, alongu baka Josepu bapwaganinya, “Pengi Josepu juwesa kulepa ubaja gwoti gotunhengi.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Henu bumpelakiya Josepu ujumbi, “Atati baku kabula jukujomoka balagalakiya ana, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Mwampwagila Josepu kwa ndaba jangu. Gupepa koku gwaalekakiya akalongu baku makosa gabu ni kihakau soti seaguhengi.’ Henu gupepa koku gutulekakiya kihakau setuguhengi twepani twaatumisi baku baka Sapanga wa atati baku.” Josepu pajapata ujumbi gola jalei ngamaa.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Ndipala aka kilongu bala bunhikila, bajinama mbaka pai palongi jaki, nukupwaaga, “Linga twepani twaatumisi baku.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Lakini Josepu jaapwagila, “Mwiijogopa, boo nepani ndi nguba badala jaka Sapanga? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Mwanganya mwapai kuhenge lihaya, lakini Sapanga janhengila gaamboni ili bandu bingi apata kuba bomi ngati emukubona lelenu. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Henu mwiijogopa. Nepani ngiti nuntunza mwanganya pamu na bana binu.” Ndienu jaapolisa mioju nukulongee naku sapi.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Josepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Josepu jaendalia kutama mu nndema uku Misili pamu na aka kilongu baki boti ba atati baki, jaatama kwa yaka mia jimu na komi. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Josepu jawesiki kwaabona bana na asoko baka Epulaimu mwana waki na kabee jaabona bana baka Makili mwana waka Manasi na kwaajuku ngati bana baki. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Mwenikatai Josepu jaapwagila alongu baki, “Nepani henu nhegale kuwa. Lakini Sapanga jiihika kunzangatii. Jammboa mu nndema gongo nukumpeleka mu nndema goanndagila Ibulaimu ni Isaka na Yakobu.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Ndipala Josepu jaalapisa bana baka Izilaeli kupwaaga, “Sapanga pajihika kunzangatii, mwihakikisa ana, mwiijukua mahupa gangu kuhuma kongo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Ndienu, Josepu jawelila ku Misili, koni jubii na yaka mia jimu na komi. Nabombi bapakia yega jaki mitela jiibola, bijibeka yega mu lisanduku ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>